<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">Isaiah</book>
  <para style="h">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Isaiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi laibu sungah, Amoz ii tapa Isaiah tungah Judah kumpite ahi Uzziah, Jotham, Ahaz le Hezekiah te hun lai in Judah le Jerusalem huvau Pathian pualaak thute kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in, “Leitung le vantung awng, kong ci bang ngai vun! Ka vaak ka taa sa ka tate in kei hong langpan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khuite in a topa he uh a, laate in a topa ii an piakna mun he hi. Ahihang ka mihing Israel te in tua za in he ngawl hi. Amate in tel vet ngawl uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />No a khial a maw minam, siatna vawtin a seksol mihingte a lal tu hi zo nu hi! Na mawnate in note hong kaisuk hi! Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian, Topa nialin na nungngat zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghangin hong langpan lalai nu ziam? Daan thuak thua nuam lai nu ziam? Israel te awng, na lu tung theampo liamma dim zo a, na thin uh ngim mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na lutang pan na peang dong, na pumpi tung a dam mun om ngawl hi. Liamna chinumte, meimate le liamma balhte taw kidim nu hi. Na liammate kisil ngawlin, kituam ngawl hi. Zatui zaha kinoai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na ngam uh lalcip zo a, na khuapite kihaltum zo hi. Na mu tangin ngamdangmite in na ngam uh hong laaksak a, na theampo susia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem khuapi bek taanglai a, tua zongh ki uumci a — sapithuan sungah huan cingpa ii buk ahibuale, tangmai huan ah thaampheang bangin, a hung tu le a cing tu nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa, Topa in mi pawlkhat hong nungtasak lai buathong le, Sodom le Gomorrah bang keakma in Jerusalem kilalsak siat zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, no hong ukte le na mihingte sia Sodom le Gomorrah a te bang keakma na hi uh hi. Topa in no tungah hong cina ngai vun. Ih Pathian ii no hong hilna nadon vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in, “Kei tungah nong piak bul biakpiaknate theampo dei tu in hong um nu ziam? Nganhing a limci, a thaute le meihal biakpiakna a nong nei tuute zaa sangin a kicing vaal zaw ka nei hi. Khuitalte, tuute le kealte ii chi cimtak zo khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei bia tu in nong pai uh ciang, hite theampo keng tu in akua in hong sawl ziam? Ka Biakinnpi sung tuanhcil kawkoai tu in akua in hong sawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nong paipui uh biakpiaknate kimanna nei ngawl hi. Na hal uh paaknamtui ngim ka kii hi. Thadet Poaite, Sabbath nite le biakna kikhopnate ka thuak zo bua hi; tuate a vekpi in na mawnate uh in ninsak siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na Thadet Poaite le na ni thiangthote ka ngaimaw hi; tuate in vanhngit khat hi a, ka puakna in ka cimtak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Thungen in na khutte na lapto ciang note kong en buatu hi. Bang zata thu na ngen ta uh zongin kong ngai buatu hi, banghang ziam cile na khutte chi taw kituam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Noma le noma kithiangsak vun. Ka mu tangin a sia na vawt uh theampo vawt nawn heak vun. Hi hi, a sia ngamtatnate kheal vun a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuaciang a maan sep tu kisin vun. Thukhaikim thu omsak vun — a kizawthawk vawtte hu vun, tangate ii nga tuakte pia vun a, meingongte panpui vun” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in, “Tu in, thukhensat tawng. Note in mawna chisan na baang uh a, ahihang vuuk bang a thiang tu in kong sil tu hi. Note tungah a sannum baang kale zong, tuu mul bangin na kaang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima thu bek nong ni uh le lei pan a piang a pha nate na ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang kei nong langpan uh le note thi tu nu hi. Keima, Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khatvei lai in a thumaan khuapi sia pumpi zuak numei khat bangin ngamta hi! Khatvei lai tua khuapi sia mihing thutangte taw kidim a, ahizong tu in mithatte bekma taang lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, khatvei lai in ngunntang bang na hi a, ahizong tuciangin na mannung bua hi; sapittui pha taw na kibang ngei a, ahizong tuciangin tuidam bek na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na lampuite sia ngual leedote le ngutate ii lawmte veu hi a; amate in letsong le sumngukte saang tawntung uh hi. Amate in tangate, zumkong maangkong ah panpui ngeingawl a, meingongte ii a thusun ngai ngeingawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahiciang tu in, Vaanglianbelpa Topa , Israel te ii a vaanglian Pathian ii a ci bang ngai vun: “Ka ngalte ahi note tungah phu kong la tu a, note in kei ngim nong pia nawn buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Note tungah thu kong vawt tu hi. Thik sia mei taw a kithiansua bangin note kong thiansua tu a, na thiantho ngawlna theampo kong hepsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Taanghlai in na nei uhte bangma in no hong uk tute le ngaisutna hong pia theite kong pia tu hi. Tua zawkciang Jerusalem sia a thutang, thumaan khuapi kici tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa thutang ahikom, Jerusalem le tualai ah a om a kisiik kik theampo, ama in ngum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahihang mawna a vawtte le ama a langpante theampo, ama in sucip tu a; ama a taisan peuma thatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thingkungte na biak ngei hang le huan thiangthote na vawt ngei uh hu in na hee tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Note in a thi dek limkung khat le, kuama tui buak ngawl husuan khat taw kibangin na vulcip tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mei eak leang khat hu a, taangvawng a kak bangma in, mihing thahatte sia a sia a vawtna uh taw ma amate kilalcipsak tu a, amate lalna sia kuama in phel zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia sia Judah le Jerusalem taw kisai, Amoz ii tapa Isaiah tungah Pathian thu piak ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maisang hunin Biakinnpi dinna mun ahi, hi mual in mual theampo sung pan a saangbel hi tu a, mualno theampo tungah dokto tu hi. Tua munah minam tam mama kikaikhawmin hong pai ngeingui tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuaciang a mihingte in, “ Topa ii mual, Israel te ii Pathian Biakinnpi ah kaato tawng. Ama in ih sep tu a dei sia ih sep thei natu in hong hil tu hi; ama tealsa lampite ih tawn tu hi. Banghang ziam cile Jerusalem pan Topa ii hilcianna hong pai tu a; Zion panin ama in a mihingte tungah thu son tu hi,” a ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in minam liante sungah thu nawngkaite khensat tu hi. Amate in a namsaute lo thawna tumanh le a teite thingbaak heuna namte in seak tu uh hi. Ngam khat le ngam khat kido kik ngei nawn ngawl tu a, ngal sim tu in kithoai kik nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu in, Jacob suan le paalte awng, Topa hong piak khuavak sungah kalsuan tek tawng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian awng, Jacob suan le paal, na mite na nusia zo hi! Ngam le lei sia nisuana sang pan le Philistia pan mitbum nasepnate taw kidim zo hi. Mihingte in ngamdang ngeinate zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate leitang sia ngunn le khamh taw kidim a, amate ii sum le vanh manphate bo hun nei nawn ngawl hi. Amate ngam sia siphu taw kidim a, a siphu ngalleangte sim zawk hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate ngam sia milimte taw kidim a, amate khut taw a vawt tawm uhte ma amate in bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A vekpi in kiniamsuksak tu a, kimaizumsak tu hi. Amate mawna maisak heak in Topa awng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa ii thin uukna pan le a vaangletna le a minthannate pan a suatak natu hanciam in, amate sia mualkawm suanghawng sung ahibuale leihawng tawna sungah buu tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihingte kiphatsakna le, mihingte kisaktheina a kilalsak tu ni khat hong theng tu hi. Tuasia ciang Topa bekma kipok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ni ciang Vaanglianbelpa Topa in a vaanglian theampo le, a kiphasakte, a kiliansakte theampo niamsuksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Lebanon Cedar kung saangte le Bashan ngamsung oak thingkung te theampo susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in mualpite le mualnote tamkimsak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tausaang theampo le a muanhuai kulh pangte theampo kikimsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a lianbel le a hoibel teambawte ngawngawn tum suksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing kiphatsak nate bo tu a, mihing kisakthei nate kilalsak tu hi. Milimte mangthang siat tu a, tua ni in Topa bekma kipok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in leitung lok tu in hong pai ciang, mihingte in Topa ii thin uukna pan le a vaangletna le a minthannate pan a suatak natu hanciam in, ahibuale leihawng tawna sungah buu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ni hong thet ciang, khamh le ngunn taw a vawt sa milimte, amate ma in vawkkeak tu a, tuate sia buite le bakte nusiat tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in leitung lok tu in hong pai ciang, mihingte in Topa thin uukna, vaangletna le a minthannate pan, a suatak natu hanciamin leihawngte sung le mualkawm suanghawngte sungah buu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A thithei mihingte muanin nei nawn heak vun. Amate in bang kimanna nei uh ziam?
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu in Topa , Vaanglianbelpa Topa in Jerusalem le Judah pan mihingte ii tulmawkna theampo, suan le muan mihing theampo laaksak tu in kithoai hi. Topa in amate ii an le tui,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a ngalhangte le a ngalkapte, a thukhenmangte le a kamsaangte, aisaan theite le a ngam lampuite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a ngalkap sang lampuite le a mihon lampuite, a ngam vai thu kinte le thupiangte uk tu a zak mitbum thiamte theampo laaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in mihingte sia a khanthin ngawl lai patangte in uksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihing theampo khat le khat tungnut kituu in meetna la tu hi. Khangmoite in khanghaamte zakta ngawl tu a, a mannung ngawl mihingte in a tungsia te zakta ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate bee sung pan mihing khat a teal tu hun khat theng tu a, a teal sia pa tungah, “Nang na hile puansilh tawm tu nei buang na hi ciang, hi bang ngim le kham hun sungah kote lampui hong seam ka ven,” ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahizong ama in, “Kei hi ngawl khi hi! Hong hu zo ngawl tu khi hi. Ka anneak tu ka puansilh tu nei ngawl khi hi. Na lampui hong seamsak heak vun!” ci in zo kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi peu hi, Jerusalem sia a lal tu hi zo hi! Judah sia a lalal hi zo hi! Amate kampau theampo le a sep a vawt theampo in Topa langpan hi; amate in Pathian mama sia a langh takin selno hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngual ngaimaw khol a doidanna sia amate ii puk natu ahi hi. Sodom mite bangin amate in a langh takin mawna khialna vawt uh hi. Amate a lal tu hi zo a, a zon bangin tawk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thumaan thutang mihingte lungdam tu uh a, amate atu in a pha hong piang tu hi. Amate a sepna bang zui in nuamsa thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang mi seksolte a lal tu hi zo hi; amate in ngual tung a vawt bangin tu in, amate tungah kivawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sum pukthaakte in ka mite zawthawk vawt a, a leiba tote in amate theam uh hi. Ka mite awng, na lampuite in lam hong pui khial ahikom, na kiheak natu lampi na he bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa sia ama ii thu sung tu in kinging hi; ama in a mite tung thukhen tu in kithoai zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in ama mihingte ii upate le a lampuite thukhenna thuaksak tu hi. Ama in hi bangin: “Note in sapithuante na suttol uh a, na inn uh sia mizawngte tung pan na laak uh vanhte taw kidim teak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka mite na sukcip natu le mizawngte tung pan meetna laak natu thu bangma na nei bua uh hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa, Vaanglianbelpa ka pau zo hi,” ci in mawsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in, “En vun Jerusalem numeite kiphasak mama hi! Amate vandak sa in lampai uh hi. Amate sikvil tawntung hi. Amate a kal tomsakin pai vakhiangh a, a siakmit tungah haakte ngingsak vasial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang amate daan ka pia tu hi — a sam uh ka meetsak tu a, lutol in ka nusia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in Jerusalem numeite tung pan tuabang a, a kiphatsak pui nate theampo — a siakmit tungah a but, a lu tungah a tot, a ngawng ah a aw kizepnate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuaciang a khut tung a but haakte theampo a laak tu hun ni khat hong theng tu hi. Ama in a maisitnate le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a lukhute; a baan tung le a kawngah a vom mitbum aite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a khutmete tungah a but khutzungbute le a naakba te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />puasil puantual te, puantualte, puanvante le a dangka ipte theampo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a vang silsial a puanzate, a puanneal dial note, ngawng aw puante le lu tung khuk maisitna puan a saute la siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Paaknamtuite a zak luangin amate namsia valut tu hi; kawngkhau phate luangin khauhual teang tu hi; a sam hoite taangin a lu uh tol tu hi; puansilh phate luangin, puansia ngapkaai kisilhsak tu hi; a mealhoina in maizumna suak tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hi hi, khuapi sung pasalte, a thahat belte ngawngawn ngal sungah kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khuapi kongpite mau in kap tu a, a khuapi mama sia a puan teng kisuutsak a, a pumnguak in lei ah a to numei khat taw kibang tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun hong thet ciang, numei sali in pasal khat lencip in; “Koma le koma kivaak zo in, puansilh nikteen ka heang thei tu uh a, ahitazong ko pasal taan ci ka maizum seal natu in, nong hesuakna in nang sia koma pasal hi hong cisak ka po in,” ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in ngam sungah a om ankung le thingkung theampo a khantosak tu le, a limciitsak tu hun hong thetheng tu hi. A nungta lai Israel mihing theampo in a ngamsung pan a piang an kungte hu in lungpilna le kiphatsak puina nei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem ah a taanglai, Pathian ii a nungta lai tu a tealsa theampo sia, a thiangtho kici tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in ama ii vaangletna taw minam tung thukhenin thiansua tu a, Jerusalem ii mawna le tua munah chi kibua sia silthiang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Zion mualtung le tua munah a kikhawmte theampo tungah, sun hunin meeikaai khat, zan hunin meikhu le meikuang taang sitset khat, Topa in puak tu hi. Pathian ii minthanna in khuapi bup huamin dal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama ii minthanna in tua khuapi sia sun ni satna pan lia tu a, vuipi le nguapi pan bukna le belhna muan mun khat hisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi la kong sak laitak hong ngai ta'n, ka lawmpa le ama sapithuan taw kisai la khat hi: Ka lawmpa in leipha mama mual khat ah sapithuan khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in leito in suang teng vawk a; sapitkung pha belte suan hi. Ama in tuate a cin natu in tausaang khat sa in, sapitngate a cil natu in leidum khat to hi. Ama in sapit a min tu ngak a, ahihang sapitnga theampo thuk siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuabang hi a, tu in ka lawmpa in, “Jerusalem le Judah ngam ah a teang no mite awng, kei le ka sapithuan kilaklaw ah thu hong khen tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hisia atu ka sep laak bang om ziam? Tuaciang ka muanmawk bang sapit phate piang ngawl a, banghang sapit thuk piang thong ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Hi bangin ka sapithuan tungah ka vawt tu hi; a kiim uumna dalte ka lakeak tu a, a dalna ngawlte thiaktanin, ngamsate in ka nesak tu a, ka tuanhcilsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lopa in ka khunelsak tu hi. Sapit baakte ka heu buatu a, a lei zongh ka tho buatu hi; tuasia luangin, lingte ling kungte in ka khunelsak tu hi. Ngua a zuksak ngawl natu in meeite ngawngawn ka khaam tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa ii sapithuan hi; Judah mite sia ama suan sa sapitkungte ahi hi. Topa in amate a pha vawt tu in muangmaw a, ahihang amate in tual that zaw uh hi. Ama in amate sia a maan bang seam tu in muangmaw a, ahihang amate ii a vawtsiatte in thumaanna dei in kap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note a lal na hi uh hi! Na neisa inn le lote belap natu in na lei thawthua uh hi. Hai ngawlin midangte teen natu mun om ngawl tu a, tua leitang tungah noma bekma na teang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “Hi a lian a pha inn theampo a hawm suakin lal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sapitkung hectare sawm ciinna leitang in sapittui litre liat bekma piangsak tu hi. Anci litre za le sawm liat in vaimim litre sawm le liat bek piangsak tu hi,” a ci ka za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Note a lal na hi uh hi. Zingsang zu ne tu in na thopal uh a, nitak ngei hial veu zu ne zu khamin na om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na poai sung uh ah tengtongh, daalkual khuangnote, tamngaite, na tum uh a — tuaciang sapittui na ne uh hi. Ahihang Topa in bang seam cisia na tel bua uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tua ahikom thongtaakte bangin hong kipaipui tu hi. Na lampuite ngilkialin pukthi tu a, nautaang mite dangko in thi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mithi khua in amate ne tu in kamkat hi. Tua in Jerusalem mithupite sia a ngamlum nautaang mihonte taw valhtum khawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kuama po kimaimawlsak tu a, a kiphasak theampo kiniamsuksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang Vaanglianbelpa Topa in ama ii letna sia thutang sepna taw lak a, ama thianthona sia a mite tungah a thu khenna taw pualaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A sia sa khuapite sungah tuute in lopa ne tu a, kealnote in a tatna tu mun mu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Note a lal na hi uh hi! Na mawnate uh pan suatak natu in na kisaan zo bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note in, “ Topa in ka vawt tu hi a ci sia hi vabil in vawt tahen, tua hile ih mu thei tu hi. Israel ii a thiangtho Pathian in ama ngealnate vawt hen; a thinsung ah bang ngaisun ziam en tek tawng,” na ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note a lal na hi uh hi! Note in a siate pha hi, a phate sia hi na ci uh hi. Note in khuazing sia khuavak ah, khuavak sia khuazing ah na heak uh hi. Note in a kha sia a thum, a thum sia a kha na sua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Note a lal na hi uh hi! Noma sia ciim kisa, pilvang mama kisa si nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Note a lal na hi uh hi! Sapittui ne in a hangsan te awng! Zu helin na neak tu uh hangsan in launa nei ngawlte awng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang sumnguk khat po taw a maw mite na suaktasak zeang uh a, a maw ngawlte ii thukhaikim thu khenna a nga natu na khaam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahiciang tu in, taangphaw le lopa ko ngimngeamte mei a kak bangma in, na zungte muatin na paakpalhte kongaw tu a, vui in lenkeak tu hi, banghang ziam cile, noma in Vaanglianbelpa Topa Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian ii ei hong hilna thu na nial zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa sia a mite tungah thin uukin amate daan pia tu in a khut vaan zo hi. Mualte liing tu a, mithi luangte ninteak bangin lampi tungah kinusia tu hi. Tuasia ngawngawn zong Topa thin uukna thai zo ngawl lai tu a, daan pia tu in a khut vaan lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in, a khualana ah a om minam khat sapna tu in limlakna khat pia hi. Amate leimong pan hong pai natu in Topa in phit tum in sam hi. Tuasia ciang amate hi sungah manlang takin hong pai paih hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate kuama toi ngawl a; lutu in a liik om ngawl hi. Amate mutsuak in lusu ngeingawl, mu ngeingawl hi. Kawngkhau khat zongh kawm ngawl hi; peangdap khau khat zongh tat ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate thaltangte hiam a, a thalte kaa tawm tu bekin eal pinpen uh hi. A siphu peangcinte thausuang bangin sak a, a muite suumpei bangin pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ngalkapte sia, tawpite in ngam sa khat man a, amate kung pan kuama ii a laaksak thei ngawl natu munah tua in, a hawk bangin au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ni a thet ciang, amate in tuipi nging bangin nging takin Israel mite hawksan tu uh hi. Ngam hisia en vun! Khuazinna le ngim thuakna! Khuavak sia khuazing in valhtum hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uzziah Kumpipa ii thi kumin, Topa ka mu hi. Ama sia a kisaangkhai kumpi tokhum tungah to a, a puantual sia Biakinnpi bup dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama kiimkot ah a ding, meikuang bang ahi Seraphim vantung mite khat simin tha luk tek nei hi. Tha nii taw a mai tek uh, tha nii taw a pumpi tek uh tuam a, a tha dangte nii tek taw leang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate khat le khat ki oksan in: “Thiangtho, thiangtho, thiangtho! Vaanglianbelpa Topa sia thiangtho hi! Ama ii minthanna in leitung zel hi,” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate awnging in Biakinnpi tawdappha liingsak a, tuaciang Biakinnpi mama meikhu taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in, “Kei atu bangma lam et om ngawl hi! Kei a lal hi ing, banghang ziam cile ka muk pan a pusuak kammal sim sia mawna veu hi a, a kampau sim mawna veu ahi mite sungah ka teang hi. Tuabang teng ahitazong, Kumpipa, Vaanglianbelpa Topa sia ka mittang vateak taw ma in ka mu zo hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Seraphim vantunglalangte khat sia biaknatau pan taitee taw a laak meikam khat dep a, toai in ka kungah hong leang suk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in meikam taw ka muk hong bitsak a, “Hisia in na muk hong bi zo hi, tu in na mawna bo siat zo a, na mawna teng kimaisak zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in, “Akua sawl tu khi ziam? Akua in eite kamtai hi tu ziam a ci ka za hi. “Keima pai tu khi hi! Hong sawl ta'n!” ci in keima in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in nangma va pai ta'n a, hi thu mihingte tungah son ta'n ci in hong sawl hi: “Bang zata na ngai uh zong, na tel thei buatu uh hi. Bang zata na en uh zong bang piang cisia na he buatu uh hi”.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in keima tungah, “Hi mihingte lungmusakin, a na ngongsak in a, a mittawsak in, tua hile amate khuamu thei ngawl, khua za thei ngawl, tel thei ngawl tu hi. Tuabang hile ka kung hong zuan thei in, a ci ka damsak tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima in, “ Topa awng, hi bang ahi tu sia bang tanvei ngei tu ziam?” ci in ka dongh hi. Ama in, “Khuapite siacipin, a lei awngthong dong — innte innhawm a sua dong — a leitang kolh in leitul a sua dong ngamkhingin om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima in mihingte a khuala na ah puakin a ngam bup ka ngamkhing didesak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ngam sungah mihing sawm sung pan khat bek a taang ta zongin, tuasia pa ngawngawn kilalcipsak tu hi; ama in a kiphuktan sa lim thingkung bul khat taw kibang tu hi,” ci in hong zo hi. (Tua thingbul sia Pathian ii mihingte kipat thakna lim a lak ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jotham ii tapa, Uzziah ii tupa ahi, Ahaz kumpipa in Judah ngam a uk lai in ngal piang hi. Syria kumpipa Rezin le Israel te kumpipa Remaliah ii tapa Pekah in Jerusalem khua sim a, ahihang la zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Syria ngalkap honte Israel ngamsung theng zo hi ci thu Judah kumpipa kung a thet ciang, ama le a mite theampo lausak mama ahikom, vui ii seam thingkungte bangin liing vadil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in Isaiah tungah, “Kumpipa Ahaz taw kimu tu in na tapa Shear Jashub paipui in. Ama sia puan khuite nasepna phual paina lampi tung, tuicing tungnung kung pan tui laakna luam tawpna ah mu tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama kinging sa in a om khinkhian natu le a thin patau ngawl natu in son in. Kumpipa Rezin le ama ii Syria mite le Pekah kumpipa ii thin uukna te sia meikuang valiat thingkhua nii panin meikhu sia sangin lauhuai ngawl zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Syria sia Israel le a kumpipa taw a sia khat vawt tu tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in Judah ngam simin, amate sangah Judah mite a pawl natu in lausakin, Tabeel ii tapa kumpi tu in koi sawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ahihang Topa ahi, Keima in, hi thu piang ngeingawl tu hi, ci in ka thangsak hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Banghang ziam? Syria sia a khuapi Damascus sangin thahat zaw ngawl a, Damascus sia Kumpipa Rezin sangin thahat zaw ngawl ahihang hi. Israel ngam ahile, ngam khat in a din zawk nawn ngawl natu in kum sawmluk le kum nga sungin kitamhtham dipdeap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel sia a khuapi Samaria sangin thahat zaw ngawl a, Samaria sia Pekah kumpipa sangin thahat zaw ngawl hi. “Na upna a kip buale nang na kip zo buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Ahaz tungah thudang khat puak hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Limlakna khat hong piak natu in, Topa na Pathian tungah ngen in. Tuasia in a thukna mithi khua pan ahibuale a saangna vantung pan hi thei hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahaz in, “Limlakna ngen ngawl tu khi hi. Topa ze et nuam ngawl khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Isaiah in, “David kumpipa suan le paalte awng, tu in ngai vun. Mihingte na thin na veilaaksakna uh sia no atu in sia khop zo hi — Pathian zongh a thin vei la sak lai tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahile pha zo hi, Topa ama mama in limlakna khat hong pia tu hi: ngaknu moi khat naungil om in tapa khat nei tu a, ama min ‘Immanuel’ ci in phuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama thu in a sia a pha khen thei tu in hong let hun ciang, mihingte in khuinoai dawn in khuaitui ne tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua hun hong thet ma ngawngawn in, note hong lausak kumpi niite ii ngamte kinusia cip tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Judah ngam pan Israel kumpi ngam a kikhen zawk a, a tung ngeingawl ngim ngana nite sia Topa in nangma, na mite tung le kumpi innkuan bup tungah tungsak tu hi — ama in Assyria kumpipa hong puak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tua hun hong thet ciang Egypt te atu, Nile ngunnaak a khuala belna pan tho bangin hong pai natu le, Assyria te atu in amate ngam pan khuai bangin hong pai natu, a limlakna in, Topa in phiit tum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate mualkawm, luamkawm, suanghawngte sungah hong pai tu a, lingkung sawlpaang kawm theampo le ngantatna mun theampo ah hong kiliim nitnut tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tua hun hong thet ciang, Topa in sam meet pa khat — Assyria kumpilianpa! — sia Euphrates ngunngal khat pan sam tu a, ama in na khamulte, na sam le na pumpi tung mul teng meet tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tua hun hong thet ciang, lothopa khat in khuila khat le keal nii bekma suatak zo ahitazong in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tuate in noaitui tam mama pia tu a, ama kisap theampo nei siat tu hi. Hi hi, ngam sungah a taanglai, a nungta lai tawmno teng in a neak tu khuinoai le khuaitui nei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tua hun a thet ciang, sapithuan pha mama, sapitkung tulkhat a om huan khat ciang, ngunn dangka tulkhat a mante sia lingkung le lingngui te in khannelh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihingte in thal le thaltangte taw tua munah sa vai tu uh hi. Hi hi, a ngam bup sia lingkung le lingnguite taw kidim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khatvei lai a, ankung kiciinna mualte theampo sia lingte in po nelh siat tu a, tua munah kuama pai ngawl tu hi. Khui le tuute tatna mun hi tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in ka tungah, “Lai atna suangpheak lian khat la in a, tua tungah laimal lian taw: ‘Manlang Suttol, Manlang Laaksak’ ci in at in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hong heakpui tu in a muanhuai tetti nii, thiampi Uriah le Jeberechiah ii tapa Zechariah sam in,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua zawk tawmvei ciang ka zi naungil om hi. Ka tapa uh a sua ciang, Topa in, “A min, ‘Manlang Suttol, Manlang Laaksak’ ci in phuak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Patang in, ‘Nu awng’, ‘Pa awng’ a ci thei ma in, Damascus khua hauna theampo le Samaria khua pan a kisuttol vanhte theampo, Assyria kumpipa in la in pua siat tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in kei hong paupui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in, “Hi mihingte in dam tak a luang Shiloah luitui nial zo ahikom Rezin le Pekah kumpite mai ah lau in liing vadil tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa ahi Keima in, Judah ngam sim tu in Assyria kumpipa le a ngalkapte theampo ka paipui tu hi. Euphrates nguntui pawmin, ngun vaalbote theampo a khup siat bangin amate kuan tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah ngam sungah tuipawm bangin amate pai tu a, liangko dong tui khangin na theampo khum siat tu hi,” ci hi. Pathian sia eite taw omkhawm hi! Ama ii tha kiphalte in ngam hu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />No, minamte awng, kiitakna taw kikhawm tua vun! No, ngam khuala ah a omte awng, na ngai vun. Ngalsim tu in kinging vun, ahihang kiita vun! Hi hi, kinging vun, ahihang kiita vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngealnate na nei vun! Ahihang tuate taangtung ngeingawl tu hi. Na uuk zaza son vun! Ahihang a luithawthong vive hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian sia eite taw om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihingte tot lampi ka tot thaak ngawl natu in Topa in ka kidop natu a vaangletna taw thu hong hil hi. Ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hi mihingte vaihawmnate pawlpui heak in a, amate kiitakte kiita heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa ka thiantho hunlam na ciamtee in; na kiitak tatak tu sia keima ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima ii a lamdang thianthona hangin mihingte lutu theina suangtum khat taw ka kibang hi; keima in Judah le Israel kumpi ngammite le Jerusalem khua mite a awksak tu thaang khat taw ka kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate tam mama lutu tu hi; amate pukin, kisucip tu hi. Amate thaang khat sungah kiman tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />No, ka nungzuite sia, kei tungah Pathian hong piak thute a keamcing thiam tute na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa sia ama mite ii a mu thei ngawl natu in ama le ama kiseal hi, ahizong keima in ama ka muang a, ka lametna ama tungah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa ii hong piaksa tate taw hi munah ka om hi. A kumpi tokhum Zion mual tungah a om, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, Israel mite kungah a nungta thupuakte bangin eite hong puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihang mihingte in, maisang thu tu a phun vasup aisaan theite le thaa sam theite tungah thu dongh in hong sawl tu hi. Amate in, “A tatakin ci leang, mihingte in thaa te ii thusuakte nget tu hi a, tuaciang a nungtate atu in a thisate tung thu dok tu ahi hi,” hong ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate tungah, “ Topa in no hong hilna thute ngai vun! Thaa sam theite thu ngai heak vun — amate hong son thute ngimna taw hong kipealsak thei ngawl tu hi,” ci in zo vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihingte ngam sungah thinkiam ngilkial in vak kawkoai tu uh hi. Amate ngilkial thin uuk in a kumpipa le a Pathian haamsiat tu uh hi. Amate in vantung a ento zong, ahibuale
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />lei a salhsuk zong ngimna khamna le khuazing ngawl buang bangma mu ngawl tu hi, amate sia a lauhuai khuazing sungah kihawlkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amate hi bang ngimna hun sung pan a suatak natu lampi om ngawl tu hi. Zebulun minamte le Naphtali minamte teenna ngam sia minsiatna thuak ngei a, ahizong mai sangah hi ngam sia Mediterranean tuipi nisuana ngam sang pan kipan Jordan ngunngal khat dong le ngamdangmite teenna Galilee ngam ngawngawn dongin ngam thupi suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuazing sung a vak mihingte in khuavak lian khat mu zo hi; Amate sia a limh zingna ngam khat ah teang uh a, ahizong tu in amate tungah khuavak taang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in amate lungdamna lian na pia zo hi; nangma in amate na lungdamsak zo hi. Amate in nangma sepsak sate sungah lungdam uh a, mihingte in an a laak ciangin ahibuale a vanh matte a hawm uh ciangin a lungdam bangma in lungdam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, nangma in amate ii vanhngit puakna hakkol le amate ii liangko a saat, ciangkhut na thiaktan zo hi. Nidang lai a Midian ngalkaphonpi na zaw bangkeak ma in na mite nengcipin hong zothaw minam sia na zo zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngalsim a hong kuan ngalkapte ii peangdapte le chi baang amate puante theampo sia mei taw kihal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eite atu nausen khat hong suak hi! Ei atu tapa khat hong kipia hi! Tuaciang ama in eite hong ukpa hi tu hi. Ama sia, “Lamdang, Thu lakpa” “Vaanglian Pathian,” “Tawntung Pa,” “Kilemna Kumpi” kici tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama ii kumpi vaangletna sia kizomin khang tawto tu a; ama ii kumpi ngam sungah kilemna a tawntungin om tu hi. Ama in David kumpipa ii za lai tu a, ama ii vaangletna in a maan le thukhaikim bulphu in tu pan kipan hun bo dongin uk tu hi. Vaanglianbelpa Topa in hite theampo khensatin seam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Israel kumpi ukna, Jacob suan le paalte tungah thukhenna pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel mite theampo, Samaria khuapi sung a teang pawpo te in hi thu Topa in vawt zo hi ci in he tu hi. Tu in amate kiphasak in kisathei uh hi. Amate in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Uksuang innte pukcip zo hi, ahihang suanginn taw ka laih tu hi. Sycamore thing zawlsaute ki attan zo hi, ahihang a phabel cedar thing taw ka laih tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate sim tu in, Topa in a ngalte hol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nisuana sang pan Syria le nitumna sang pan Philistia in Israel valhtum tu in a kam uh kaa zo hi. Tuabangza ngawngawn zongin Topa thin uukna thaisak zo ngawl a; daan pia tu in a khut vaan lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mihingte kisiik kik ngawl hi; Vaanglianbelpa Topa in amate daan a piak zawk ngawngawn zongin, Topa kung zuan kik tuan ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ni khat sungin Topa in Israel lampuite le a mihingte daan pia tu a; a lu le a mei saattan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A khanghaam le a zatak huai pasalte sia a lu hi a — leilot thu a hil kamsaangte sia a mei ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi mihingte lampuite in amate lamkhialsak a, lungmang bikbeksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Topa in tangvalte khat zongh suaktasak ngawl tu a, meingongte le tangate khat zongh hesuak ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile mihing theampo in Pathian sel a, seksol in kamsia nawno pau uh hi. Tua hang zongin Topa thin uukna thai zo ngawl a, daan pia tu in a khut kivaan lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihingte ii seksolna in lingkungte le a mulnei lingkungte a kaanghtumsak mei bangin kuang hi. Meikhu lomtangh a piangsak ngamkaang bangin kuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa thin uukna hangin ama ii daan piakna sia ngam le lei ah meikuang taw hal bangin mihingte lalsak hi, kuama po in ama atu bek ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngamsung koima po ah, mihingte in a zontawm, a mutawm an bekno khat pawpo ne a, ahihang a ngil uh va ngeingawl hi. Amate in a tate ii sa ngawngawn ne uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Manasseh mihingte le Ephraim mihingte khat le khat kisim a, tuaciang amate in Judah sim khawm uh hi. Tuabangza ngawngawn zongin Topa thin uukna thaisak zo ngawlin; daan pia tu in a khut kivavaan lai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note a lal na hi uh hi! Note in ka mite zawthawk natu in a thukhaikim ngawl thukhamte na vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuabangin mizawngte tung pan amate taw kisai a nga tuakte le amate ii thutang khenna nga natu te khaktanin na taansak uh hi. Tuate sia meingongte le tangate ii neisate na sutolzia uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian in note daan hong piak ciang note in bang na law tu uh ziam? Ama in ngam khuala khat panin ngimna, siatna note tungah hong tunsak ciang bang na law tu uh ziam? Hong hu tu zongin koisungah na tai tu uh ziam? Na nei na lamte koisungah na phual tu uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note ngal kisimna sungah hong kithatlum tu hi, ahibuale zong thongtaakte bangin hong kikai keak tu hi. Tuabang ngawngawn taw zongh in Topa thin uukna thai ngawl lai tu a; daan pia tu in a khut kivaan lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in, “Assyria awng! Nang sia ka thin hong uuksakte daan piakna khetbuk khat bangin kong zangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei hong thin uuksak mite ahi Pathian sel minam khat a sim tu in Assyria ka puak hi. Keima in amate sia vanh suttol tu, vanh ngu tu le lampi tung a leivui bangin mite tuanhcil tu in ka sawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang Assyria kumpilianpa in ngoltol ngealnate nei hi. Ngam tam mama siatsak sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama sia kiphasak in, “Ka ngalkap maangte sia kumpi veu ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in Calno le Carchemish khuapite, Hamath le Arpad khuapite ka zo zo hi. Samaria le Damascus ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Milim a bia tua kumpi ngamte daan pia tu in ka khut ka eal hi, a milimte sia Jerusalem le Samaria ah a om milimte sangin tamzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samaria le a milim theampo ka sucip siat zo a, tuabang keak ma in Jerusalem le tua munah a kibia milimte ka siasak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang Topa in, “Zion mual tung le Jerusalem khua sungah ka nasep teng ka man ciang, Assyria kumpipa sia ama ii kisuantaakna le kiphatsakna theampo hu in daan ka pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Assyria kumpilianpa in, “Keima mama in a vekpi in vawt zo ing. Ka hat a, ka ciim a, ka pil hi. Ngam khat le ngam khat kilaklaw ngamngite bosakin amate kholsa vanhte ka sut siat hi. Keima in khuital khat bangin tualai ah a teang mite ka tuanhthal zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leitung ngamte sia vacim bu khat taw kibang a, a tuuite ol zeang tak khoptua bangin keima in amate haunate ka khawmtua ziau hi. Kei hong lauthawn tu in a thaphil ngam le om bo; kei hong ausan tu in a kamkaa khat beak le om bo!” ci in kisuangtaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang Topa in, “Hei khat in a zangh pa sang lian zaw ing ci thei tu ziam? Thingatnam khat in a zangh pa sangin thupi zaw ziam? Khetbuk khat in mihing khat laamto ngawl a; mihing khat in khetbuk laamto hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu laitakin pha tak a, a kivaak phitphet tua mite daan pia tu in Vaanglianbelpa Topa in natna puak tu hi. Amate ii pumpi sungah a kuang tan mei khat om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel te ii khuavak ahi, Pathian sia mei khat suak tu hi. Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian sia meikuang khat suak tu a, tua in ni khat thu in na theampo, lingkung le lingpaakte ngawngawn kaanghtum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Taam thuk te le lo ngampha te sia natsia khat ii mihing khat a lalsak bangin, siacipsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Duisung ah thingkung a taanglai tawm mama tu a, patang khat ngawngawn in a kung phaza sim thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel mi a suakta teng in amate a mong siatsak dektak minam sia a suan nawn ngawl natu hun khat hong theng tu hi. Amate in Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian Topa muang takpi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel mite sung pan mihing tawm bek amate ii vaanglian Pathian kungah cia kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu in Israel mite sia tuipi hui a om senvui za in tam mama ahitazong mi tawm bek cia kik tu uh hi. Mihingte atu in lalna sia a kikoi sa hi a, thuak tu in a kilawm tatak ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi hi, Vaanglianpipa, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in vawt tu khi hi, a ci sa bangma in ama in ngamsung theampo ah siatna tungsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa Vaanglianbelpa in Zion ah a teang a mite tungah, “Egypt te in note hong zawthawk vawt tawntung bangin, Assyria te in note hong zothaw hial zongin amate kiita heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tawmvei no sungin, note daan kong piak sia ka man tu a, tua zawkciang amate ka lalcipsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa keima in, Oreb Suangpi ah Midian mite ka saat bangin, ka ciangkhut taw amate ka saat tu hi. Egypt mite daan ka piak bangin Assyria mite daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua hun hong thet ciang Assyria te ii khut sung pan note kong suaktasak tu a, amate hakkol sia note liangko tungah vanhngit hi nawn ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ngalte ii ngalkaphonpi in Ai khuapi la zo hi! Amate in Migron khua kaantan zo hi! A nguai ante Michmash ah nusia uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate in mualciangh kaantan in Geba khua ah zan ngiak uh hi! Ramah khua mite lau in, Saul kumpipa ii khua Gibeah khua mite taikeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gallim mite awng, au vun! Laishah mite awng, ngai vun! Anathoth mite awng, a pau zo vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Madmenah le Gebim khua mite a suatak natu in tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuni in ngalte Nob khua sungah om a, tua mun panin amate in Jerusalem khuapi, Zion Mual a khuttum lak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in amate sia thingbaakte heu bangin saattan tu hi. Amate sung pan a kiphasakbel le a saangbelte zongh kisaat tan in kiniamsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ngam tawnghtol sungah thingte hei taw a kiphu tan bangin, Lebanon mual ah thing hoibelte ngawngawn a puk bangin, Topa in amate phuktan tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David kumpi khang kizopna sia a kiphuktan sa thingkung khat taw kibang hi; ahihang thingbul khat pan a baak meang thak a po bangma in, David suan le paalte sung panin kumpi thak khat khangto tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A mite a uk natu in Topa ii thaa in ama sia ciimna pilna le heakna pia tu hi. Ama in Topa deina he in thasiana nei tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa thunitna sungah nuamsa tu hi. Ama in a puasang muna le thu ngalzaakna bangin thukhen ngawl tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ama in mizawngte a pha in thukhen a, a cimaw mite ii a nga tuak te panpui tu hi. Ama thupiak bangin mite daan kipia in, mi siate thi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in a mite thukhaikim le thutak taw uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngiate le tuute kilemin teang khawmin, pawlbeamte sia kealnote taw lumkhawm tek tu hi. khuinote le tawpi note an nekhawm tu uh a, patangnote in amate cing tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuipuite le vompuite an nekhawm tu uh a, a note kilem in lumkhawm tek tu uh hi. Khuite in taangphaw a neak bangma in tawpite zongh in taangphaw ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nauno khat nguu a nei ngul khat kungah kimai in a om hial zongh in bangma kilaw ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian ii mual thiangtho Zion tungah liamna baina, a sia a kha bangma om ngawl tu hi. Tuipite sia tui taw a kidim bangma in leitung sia Topa thu heakna taw kidim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David kumpi suan pan kumpi thak khat sia minam tam mama te atu in lim khat ahi natu ni khat hong theng tu hi. Amate sia a kumpi khuapi sungah kikhawm in ama zatakna pia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ni a thet ciang, Topa in ama ii vaangletna khatvei zangh kik tu a, ama ii mite sung pan Assyria le Egypt ngamsung, Pathros, Ethiopia, Elam, Babylon, Hamath ngamsung teng le tuipi tuikulhte tung, le tuipi dung ngamte ah a kinusia mite, a inn uh ah puak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in a kithethaang Israel le Judah mite kaikhawm kikin, leitung kiing li panin a ciapui kik natu thute sia minamte a lak natu in lim lakna laandial khat phut tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel kumpi ngam in Judah ngam eang nawn ngawlin, Judah te sia Israel te ngal hi ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in nitumna sangah a teang Philistine mite sim khawm tu a, nisuana sangah a teang mite do khawmin suttol tu uh hi. Amate in Edom le Moab mite zothal tu a, Ammon mite in amate thu ni tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in Suez Tuidok kangsak tu a, tuaciang Euphrates ngun tui a kan natu in vuisa vasak hi, mi theampo ii a kaantan zawk tu in luino sali bek khe lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A taanghpupite in Egypt ngam a nusiat lai in amate atu lampi lian khat a om bangma in, tua munah a nungta lai Israel a mite atu in Assyria ngam pan a suatak natu lampi lian khat om tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihingte in hi bang la a sak tu ni khat hong theng tu hi, “Nang kong pok hi, Topa awng! nang in kei tungah nong thin uuk hi, ahihang tu in nong heeneam a, na thin uuk nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian sia kei hong ngumpa hi; Ama muangin, ka lau buatu hi. Topa in vaangletna le thahatna kei hong pia a; ama sia kei hong ngumpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tui thiang in a dangko te, a lungdamsak bangma in, Pathian ii mihingte zongh ama ii a ngup ciangin lungdam uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihingte in hi bang la a sak tu ni khat hong theng tu hi, “ Topa tungah lungdamko vun! Nang hong hu tu in ama sam vun! Ama sep teng minam theampo tungah son vun! Ama bang zata lian ziam cisia mihingte tungah son vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in na lianpite seam zo ahikom ama tungah lasa vun. Hi thuthang sia leitung buppi in za tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion ah a teang mi theampo au in lasa tahen! Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian sia lian a, ama in a mite sungah teang hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia sia Babylon taw kisai, Amoz ii tapa Isaiah ii Pathian tung pan a nga thupuak khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mual kolh khat tungah ngal simna laandial khaito vun! A kiphasak khuapi kongpite a sim natu limlakna in na ngalkapte oksan in a, na khut laamto in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in a thiangtho ngal khat sim tu le ama a thin a uuksakte daan pia tu in, a kiphasak le a muanhuai a ngalkapte sam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mualtung ngamlumna — mihonpite aw, a kikhawm tua minamte le kumpi ngamte ii ngamlumna awte ngai vun. Ngalkaphonpite ii Topa in a ngalkapte ngalsim tu in kithoaisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate sia leimong ah a om ngam khualate pan hong pai uh hi. Topa sia a thin uukna taw ngam bup lalthamsak tu in hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na sa in kap keak vun! Vaanglianbelpa ii sukcip tu ni, Topa ni, hong nai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing theampo ii khutte zaw vanek tu a, a thinhanna uh kiam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate a vekpi in launa le nasak mamana thuak tu uh a, numei nausuak tun bangin na sa tu hi. Amate khat le khat launa taw ki en tu a, maizum in a mai uh san tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa ni — a kiitakhuai, a thin uuk, a thinso vilvel, ni ngilo ni hong theng tu hi. Leitung sia dui kisuaksakin, mawnei theampo kilalcipsak siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aksi theampo le aksi honpite taang nawn ngawlin, ni a sua ciang mial tu a, tha zongh taang ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in, “Leitung ah ngimna siatna ka thengsak tu a, mi seksolte theampo a mawnate hu in daan ka pia tu hi. A kiphasak theampo ka niamsak tu a, a kisathei theampo le a ngilote theampo daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nungta sunte khamh sangin ka tawmsak zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa keima in, ka thin uukna ka lak ni in, vantungte ka liingsak tu a, leitung sia ama omna pan kithingkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Babylon ah a teang ngamdangmite sia savaite kung pan a suakta sangai bang le a cing om ngawl tuute bangin amate ngam tek ah tai in kithethaang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mat a thuak pawpo kihollum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nausente kivellupsak tu a, a innte kiphuul in, a zite a kibuansak tu sia cimaw in en thong tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in, “Babylon sim tu in Medeste ka hol tu hi. Amate in ngunn sia bangma thusim ngawlin, khamh zongh awlmawk ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in a thal le a thaltangte taw tangvalte thatlum tu uh hi. Amate in nausente hesuak ngawlin, patangte khuangai huai sa ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Babylon sia kumpi ngam theampo sung pan a et hoibel hi a; tuasia in a mite kiphatsakna ahi hi. Ahihang Topa ahi, keima in, Sodom le Gomorrah ka vawt bangin Babylon ka lawnthal tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua munah kuama teang kik ngei nawn ngawl tu hi. A vak kawkoai Arab mite, kuama in tua munah puanbuk phut ngei nawn ngawl tu a, tuucingpa in tua munah a tuu honte tha ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua mun sia sennealngam ngamsate teenna le simbute bu tomna mun hi tu hi. Tua munah kalaoh vacimte teangin, sathakte a sia a lalte sungah kinuntaw tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tausaangte le kumpi innte sungah ngam ui le ngiate auna aw hawl tu hi. Babylon khuapi a siat tu hun theng zo hi! A nite cing dektak zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in ama ii mihing Israel te khatvei ma hesuak kik leleau tu a, ama aituam mi in teal tu hi. Topa in amate a leitang tungah teangsak kik tu a, ngamdangmite pai in tua munah amate taw teang khawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa ii Israel mite a piaksa ngam ah a cia kik natu in minam tam mama in hu tu a, tua munah minamte sia Israel ii sila suak tu uh hi. Khatvei lai in Israel te a mante sia tu in Israel te in man tu a, khatvei lai amate a zothawte sia Israel mite in uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in Israel mite natna ngimna a thuakna pan le nasep ham a kisepsakna panin damna le tawlngak toithaina pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in hi bang a piak ciang, Israel mite in Babylon kumpipa sia: “A ngilo kumpipa pukvawk zo! Ama in kuama zawthawk vawt kik ngei nawn ngawl tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thin uukna taw a mite a zawthawk vawtte le, a zaw sa minamte a vawtsia tan tawntung a tatsia ngamukte ii thahatna Topa in bosak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu tak ciang leitung bup ah tawlngakna le kilemna om a, kuama po thinnuam lungnuam in lasa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zataak kumpipa hu in Lebanon ngam a om cypress le cedar thingkungte lungdam uh hi, banghang ziam cile tu in ama thi zo a, amate a phuktan tu kuama om nawn ngawl hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Babylon kumpipa muak tu in mithi khua kinging hi. Leitung ah a thahat mite ii thaate vak hiithuut kawkoai hi. Kumpite ii thaate sia a kumpi tokhumte pan tho uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate a vekpi in ama ausan in, ‘Tu in nang sia koma bangma in thazawm zo ni hi! Nang sia koma khat bangma na hi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tengtongh music te taw hong kipok bul hi, ahihang tuciang hi mun mithi khua theng ni hi. Thanhte na luppha hi a, lungte na puanvan ahi hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Babylon kumpipa nikonghong aksi awng, vantung panin na taak suk zo hi! Nidangin minamte na zo a, ahizong tu in lei ah hong kikhiasuk zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangma in, vantung ah kaato in, na kumpi tokhum sia a saangbel aksite ii tung pek ah koi tu in na khensat hi. Nangma in pathiante kikhopna tua saksang mual tungah kumpi khat bangin to tu in na kingaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangma in meei dawnte ah ka kaato tu a, Vaanglianbelpa taw ka kibang tu hi, na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahizong mithi khua a thuk belna munah nang hong kipuak suk zo zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mithite in nang hong salh tu a, lamdang sa in hong kamkat tu hi. Amate in, ‘Hisia pa in leitung lok a, kumpi ngamte a liingsak pa hi ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hisia pa in khuapite lalcipsakin, leitung sennealngam a suaksak pa hi ngawl ziam? Hisia pa in a thongtaakte suatak ngeingawl, a inn uh ah a ciasak ngeingawl pa hi ngawl ziam?’ ci in dongh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leitung kumpi theampo sia amate ii a nasia mama thaankuul ah kiphum uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ahihang nangma in thaankuul nei ngawlin, na luang sia a muatcip tu in kivawk hi. Na luang sia ngal kisimna sungah a kithatlum ngalkapte ii luangte in khunel a, suanghawng sung khat ah kivawk khawmin kituanhcil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangma in na ngam susia a, na mite mama na thatlup hu in nang sia kumpi dangte bangin hong kiphum ngawl tu hi. A tatsia na innkuan sungah kuama nungta ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihon kithalupna kipan hen! Hi kumpipa ii tapate sia a taanghpupite mawnate hangin thi tu uh hi. Amate kuama in leitung uk ngei nawn ngawl tu a, khuapite saat zo ngei nawn ngawl tu hi,” ci in nunau tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, “Babylon simin, ka siasak tu hi. Keima in nausente pan kipan kuama ka khoaikhe buatu hi, a nungta kuama om ngawl tu hi. Keima, Topa in, ka son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima in Babylon khuapi buannawng pui khat ka suaksak tu a, tua munah simbute teang tu hi. Babylon sia munphia khat taw ka phiat tu a, tua in na theampo phiatkeak tu hi. Keima vaanglianbelpa Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in: “Ka ngeal bangin piang tu hi. Vawt tu in ka khensat sa bangin kivawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel, ka ngam sungah Assyria te ka lalcipsak tu a, ka mualte tungah amate ka tuanhcil tu hi. Ka mihingte sia Assyria te ii hakkol pan le a puak tu a vanhngitte pan ka suatak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi ngealna sia leitung atu hi a, minamte daan pia tu in ka khut ka vaan hi,” ci in kiciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in hisia vawt tu in khensat zo hi; ama in daan pia tu in a khut vaan zo a, kuama in khaam thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi thu sia Ahaz Kumpipa ii thi kumin, a kipualaak thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Philistia mite awng, note hong saat ciangkhut sia kithiaktan hi, ahihang note lungdamna tu thu om ngawl hi. Ngul khat a thi ciang, a ngilo zaw khat a taangin hong pai hi. Ngul ii tuui panin a leang thei ngulpui khat keu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa in ama mi a cimaw mizawngte ii tuucing pa hi tu a, thinmuang takin nungtasak tu hi. Ahizong ama in no Philistine mite tungah nasia takin kialpi hong tungsak tu a, khat zongh hong hingkhoai ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />No Philistine khuapi theampo awng, huna ngenin kapin au vun! Na vekpi uh in lauthawngin om vun! Saksang pan ngalkapte hong paina leivui khu sia meei bang hi a — tua ngalkaphon sungah a lauthauh khat zongh om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Philistia ngam pan hong pai kamtaite tung bangbang son tu khu ziam? Topa in Zion khua kipsak zo hi, tuaciang a ngim nga ama ii mite sia tua munah ngammuanna nga tu hi, ci in amate ka son tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia sia Moab taw kisai thupuak khat ahi hi. Zan khat thu in Ar le Kir khuapite kilalcipsak a, Moab ngam thim dide hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dibon khua mihingte a thiangtho biakna mun mual tungah kap tu in kaato uh hi. Nebo le Medeba khuapite tungtaang ah khuangai in Moab khua mite nasia takin kap uh hi; a khuangai hu in a samte le a khamulte meet uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lampi tungah a om mite khau-ip puan kisilhsak a; innkhum dawn le khuapi khawlmunte ah a om mite tau in kap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Heshbon le Elealeh khua mite kapin, amate kaana awnging sia Jahaz khua dongin kiza thei hi. Ngalkapte ngawngawn liingin; a hanna teng bo siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka thin takpi taw Moab atu in ka kap hi! Mihingte Zoar khua le Eglath Shelishiyah ah tai zo uh hi. Pawlkhat te Luhith paina lampi ah kap kawmin paito uh a; pawlkhat ahile Horonaim khua ah suakta a, khuangai in ngamlum siasua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimrim Luitui kang hi, tua luihui ah a po lopate vul zo a, lohing mun om nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihingte sia amate ii neisa theampo taw a suatak natu hanciam in Pakngiam Kuam kaantan in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moab ii ngamngi theampo ah kaana awnging kiza hi. Eglaim le Beerelim khuate ah kaana aw kiza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dibon khua ah nguntui sia chisan taw kidim a, Pathian in tualai ah a om mite atu in a sia zawlai pawlkhat nei hi. Hi hi, Moab ngam sungah a kikhe lai mi theampo chisan luangin hon kithalupna khat om tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sennealngam sungah a om Sela khuapi pan Moab mihingte in Jerusalem ah a om ngamukpa tungah tuuno khat letsong in puak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in Arnon Ngun vaalbo tung pan ngak a, vacimte a bu uh pan a kinawkeak ciang a ci a law a heak ngawl bangin vak kawkoai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in Judah mihingte tungah, “Bang seam tu khu ziam hong son tavun. Thingkung khat in suntang ni sat kimlai in, a limh vot khat a piak bangma in noma in hong dal tavun a, na limh sungah hong tawlngasak tavun. Ko sia ngaltaite ka hi uh hi, kuama ii hong mu thei ngawlna munah hong seal tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ngam sungah ko hong teangsak tavun. Kote hong susia nuamte kung pan hong dal tavun,” ci uh hi. (Zawthawkna le suksiat nate bo tu a, ngam lalsak mite thotsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, David suan le paal sung pan khat sia kumpi suak tu a, ama in mihingte thumaanna le itna taw uk tu hi. Ama in a maan sia seam papaih tu a, thukhaikim thu omsak tu hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah mihingte in, “Moab mihingte bang zata in kiphasak ci thu ih za zo hi. Amate a kisaktheina le a kiletsakna ih he hi, ahihang amate ii kisuantaakna sia a luithawthong hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Moab mite sia ngimna a thuak hu in kap tu uh hi. Kir Heres khuapi sungah a om lai in a neak bul uh anlimte a phaw kik uh ciangin, amate a vekpi in kap tu uh hi. A thin kiam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Heshbon khua hui a lote le Sibmah ii sapithuante kilalsak hi — tua sapithuan pan a piang sapittuite in minam ukte zu khamsak ngei bul hi. Khatvei lai in a khualana Jazer khuapi dong, nisuana sang sennealngam dong, nitumna sang Tuipi Thi ngalkhat dong sapitkungte zaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu in Jazer atu ka kaa bangma in tu in Sibmah ii sapitkungte atu in ka kap hi. Mihingte lungdamsak natu in anlaak poai om ngawl ahikom Heshbon le Elealeh atu in ka thitui taak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu in lo ngam pha sungah kuama lungdam ngawl hi. Sapit huan sungah kuama au ngawlin lasa ngawl uh hi. Sapittui vawt tu in kuama in sapitngate cil ngawl uh hi; lungdam in, au nate bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moab atu in khuangai in Kir Heres atu in ka tau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moab mihingte in mualtung a thiangtho biakna munte le a biakinnte ah thungen tu in pai a, thapaai thawthong in, amate atu bangma phattuamna om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia in Moab taw kisai Topa thupuak maksak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu in Topa in, “Kum thum a cin lianin Moab ii hauna letnate mangthang tu a, a mite tam mama sung pan amate tawm bek nungta lai in, thazawm tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Damascus sia khuapi khat hi nawn ngawl tu hi; ninthuk kholna khat bek hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Syria khuapite kinusia top tu hi. Tua mun sia tuu le khui tatna mun hi tu a, kuama in tuate bengkeak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel sia a dal tu om ngawl tu a, Damascus te sia a suatakna taan tu hi. Syria mi a nungta laite sia Israel mite bangma in maimawl tu uh hi. Keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel ii letna a bo tu ni khat hong theng tu a, a hauna sia zawnna taw kilaih tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel sia ankung a kisaattan, an kila sa lo khat, Rephaim kuam sung lo kolh khat taw kibang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mi tawm bekma nungta lai tu a, a kungdawn pek ah a nga pum nii pum thum simngawl, ahibuale a nuaisang a baakte tungah a kikhe lai tawmno teng simngawl, a nga dang teng theampo a kilo siat sa olive kung khat taw kibang tu hi. Keima, Topa Israel te ii Pathian in, ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ni a thet ciang, mihingte in amate a Bitphuapa ahi, Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian kungah hu ngenin zuan tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in a khut uh taw a vawttawm biaknataute suang nawn ngawl tu a, ahibuale a khut vateak taw a vawt sa — Asherah numeipathian limte le ngimnamtui halna taute muang nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ni a thet ciang pha tak a kidal khuapite sia Israel te kung pan a taikeak Hiv te le Amor te ii nusiat khuapite bangin lalcipin taisan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel awng, nang hong suatak a, a thahat suangpi khat bang a hong dal Pathian sia na mangil zo hi. Tuasia taangin, ngamdang pathian khat biak natu in huan thiangthote na vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kungte na suan ni zing mama in meangin, a paak hial zongin an laak tu na nei peang buatu hi. Ngimna le a dam thei ngawl natna bek om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngam thahatte ii ngam sungah tuipi nging bang, tuihual puite kisuk bangin buaina om lialua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Minamte sia tuihualte bangin maisang manaw in pai uh hi, ahihang Pathian in amate teih in pau ahikom nungkin kik a, suumpei sungah taangphawte bang le mualpangh ah leivui bangin kinotkeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nitak sangin amate kiitakhuai mama a, ahihang zingsang in bo hi. Tuasia in ih ngam ih lei hong suttolte theampo ii thuak tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ethiopia ngunte ngalkhat ah ngam khat om a, tualai ah thaphil nging kiza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ngam panin, tongciinte sia pumpa taw a kivawt ngunkuang taw Nile ngun zui in paisuk uh hi. Sawl tangzang kamtaite awng, na inn uh ah cia kik vun! Nguntuite ii a khentanna ngam ah a om a thahat, a vaanglian minam, a tun saangin a ciineal, leitung theampo ii kiitak na mite teng tungah thu khat puak kik vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai vun, leitung ah a teang mite theampo awng! Mualdawn ah a kikhai tu limlakna laandial khat zong vun! Lemle a kitum tu aw ngai vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah, “Keima in anlaak hun zan khualum lai daaituite a taak bang vakhial le, sun lai nitaang kiukiau bangin vantung pan kong ensuk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sapit ngate a kikaikhop ma, a paakte pul siat in a ngate a min ciang, sapitkung pan a baakte nam taw ol takin a kiheu bangin, ngalte in Ethiopia te susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ngalkap te ii mithi luangte sia vacimte le ngamsate atu in kinusia thal tu hi. Khaal sungin vacimte le, phalbi sungin ngamsate in tuate taw kivaak tu uh hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngunte ii khentan hi ngam, a thahat a vaanglian hi minam, a tun saangin a ciineal, leitung theampo ii a kiitak hi mihingte tung panin biakpiaknate Vaanglianbelpa Topa ii a saan thei tu hun khat hong theng tu hi. Vaanglianbelpa Topa a kibiakna mun, Zion Mual tungah amate hong pai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia sia Egypt ngam taw kisai thupuak ahi hi. Topa sia meei tungah to in, manlang mama in Egypt ngam ah hong pai hi. Ama mai ah Egypt milimte liingin, Egypt mihingte a hanna bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in, “Egypt ngam sungah tualngal thosakin, unau khat le khat, innpaam khat le khat ka kidosak tu hi. A kidem khuapite khat le khat kido in, a kidem kumpite khat le khat vaangletna kituu in kihau tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Egypt te ii ngealnate lalsakin, a thin kho nate ka siasak tu hi. Amate in a milimte tungah huna ngenin, thaa sam theite thu dongh in, mithite ii thaa te tungah ngaisutna ngen tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ngoltol a tatkha, zawthawk thu taw a ngilo kumpi khat tungah Egypt te aapin ka uksak tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nile nguntui kiamsuk in, ngun sia dadamin kang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nguntui luanna tuilamte dadamin ko in ui tu hi. Pumpa kung le phaipheang kungte ko ngaw tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nile ngundung vaalbo tungah a kiciing ankung theampo ko ngaw in, hui in seamkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nile ngun sungah ngasa mat taw nuntakna a zong theampo tau in kap tu uh hi; a ngasa tangthaakna le a ngeente kimanna om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puanneal puan a takte thinkiam tu uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />thiamtakte le khutthiam naseamte thin tamthamin a thin lal tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zoan khua lampuite sia mi mawmawte ahi uh hi! Egypt mipil belte in a mawmawthuai ngaisutna pia uh hi! Amate in taanghlai mipilte le kumpite zalaih tu ka hi uh hi ci in bangbangin kumpipa tungah son ngam ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Egypt kumpipa awng, ngaisutna a pia thei tu tua na mipilte koisungah om ziam? Egypt atu in Vaanglianbelpa Topa in bang ngealnate nei cisia amate in nang tungah hong son thei tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zoan le Memphis lampuite mawmaw uh hi. Amate sia minam lampui tute ma in kingaisun ahihang lampui khial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in a lungmanhuai bialbual ngaisutna amate in piasak hi. Tua hu in, Egypt te in a maan ngawl theampo seamin, ama luak naal tawk thei zukham pa khat bangin hoi vatut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Egypt ngam sungah a om, a hau a zawng, mi thupi mi thupi ngawl, kuama in Egypt te hu thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Egypt mihingte sia numeite bangin meidoai tu hun khat theng tu hi. Vaanglianbelpa Topa in amate daan pia tu in a khut a vaan sia a mu uh ciang, amate lau in liing tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa ii Egypt mihingte daan piak tu in a seesa thu a phaw kik simin Egypt mihingte in Judah te kiita tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua hun a thet ciang, Egypt khuapi ngate sungah Hebrew kam kipau tu hi. Tualai a mihingte in Vaanglianbelpa Topa min suangin kiciamnate vawt tu uh hi. Khuapite sung pan khuapi khat sia, “Ni ii Khuapi” kici tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuasia hun a thet ciang, Egypt ngam sungah Topa biaknatau khat om tu a Egypt ngamngi ah, ama min in khansuang khat kiphut tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuate sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa ii Egypt ngam sungah a om hunlam a kilakna limte hi tu hi. Tualai ah a om mite kizothaw in Topa tungah huna a nget uh ciang, ama in amate a suatak tu mihing khat puak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa sia Egypt mihingte tungah ama mama kilangh tu hi, tuaciang amate in ama he in, bia tu a, sangaw biakpiakna le meihal biakpiaknate pia tu uh hi. Amate in Topa tungah a ciliap huai kamciamnate pia in, tua a kamciamna bangin seam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in Egypt te daan pia tu hi, ahihang tua zawkciang damsak tu hi. Amate in Topa sangah kiheak tu uh a, ama in a thungetnate za in a ci uh damsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua hun a thet ciang, Egypt le Assyria ngam kilaklaw ah lampi lian khat om tu hi. Tua ngam nii te pan mihingte khat le khat kihaw in minam niite in Topa bia khawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuasia hun ciang, Israel sia Egypt le Assyria taw za kikim tu a, hi minam thumte leitung theampo atu in thupha a hi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in amate thupha pia in, “Ka mi Egypt te awng; no kong bitphua sa Assyria te awng; tuaciang no kong teal mi Israel te awng, thupha kong pia tu hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Assyria kumpilianpa Sargon thupiakna taw in, Assyria ngalkapmang lianbelpa in Philistine khuapi Ashdod sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hun ma kum thum lai in Topa in Amoz ii tapa Isaiah tungah a silh khau-ip puan le a peangdapte suut tu in sawl hi. Ama in thu ni in a pumnguak le a peangnguakin vak kawkoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ashdod khua a kilaak zawkciang, Topa in, “Ka naseampa Isaiah sia a pumnguak, a peangnguakin kum thum sung vak kawkoai hi. Hi thu in Egypt le Ethiopia te tungah maisang bang teng piang tu cisia, lakna lim ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ngamte nii pan a ngal matte sia a pumnguakin Assyria kumpilianpa in paipui tu hi. Egypt mite maizum kipia tu hi, a moi a haam ci tuan om ngawlin, a ngoaibulte zongh kiseal ngawlin a pumnguak le a peangnguakin vak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ethiopia te muangin, Egypt te hangin a kiphasak tha te a khial hunlam kiphawksak tu a, a lametna uh bo siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasia hun a thet ciang, Philistia ngam tuipi dung ah a teang mite in, ‘Assyria kumpipa kung pan ei hong dal tu in ih suan ih muanbel mite bang tat thong ziam, en vun! Eite bangbang nungta nawn thong tu hi ziam’ a ci tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia sia Babylon taw kisai thupuak ahi hi. A lauhuai ngam khat panin suumpei khat bangin sennealngam kaantan in, tuasiatna hong pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ngitlo huai thupiangte mukholna khat ka mu a, kilee heakna le lalcipna ahi hi. Elam ngalkapte awng, sim vun! Media ngalkapte awng, khuapite kiim uum vun! Babylon ii a piansak ngimna a thuakna sia Pathian in bosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mukholna sungah ka zaak le ka mute in hong lausakin, numei khat nau a tut ciangin na a sak bangin na ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lu hong vai in, lau in ka liing hi. Nitak hong thet tu ka thangai a, ahihang hong thet takpi ciang liinna le launa bekma hong puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka mukholna ah anneakpoai khat kingingin ka mu hi; leangnate to natu in puan saate kipha hi. Amate an ne tui dawnin a om laitak thakhat thu in thupiakna khat nging hi; “Uliante awng! Na lumte pua khol vun!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in kei tungah, “Pai in a ngal encik khat koi in, a mu bangin thu hong puak tu in sawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing nii veu, nii veu siphu tungto in hong pai ahizong, mihingte laa tung le kalaoh tung to in hong pai ahizong ama in a mu le, pha takin tuate a etcik tu ahi hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngal encik pa au in, “Topa awng, a sun a zanin ngalvilin ka ding tan hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thakhat thu in amate hong theng hi! Mihing nii veu nii veu siphu tung to hi. Ngal encik pa in, thu puak in, “Babylon bo zo hi! Amate ii biak milim theampo lei ah tamhtham dipdeapin om hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel ka mite awng, mangtaang bangin no hong kicil zo hi, ahihang tu in Israel te ii Pathian ahi, Vaanglianbelpa Topa tung pan ka zaak, a zaaknophuai thuphate kong son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hisia in Edom taw kisai thupuak ahi hi. Edom pan khat in kei hong samin, “Phualcing pa awng, zan hun a bo nai tu ziam? A bo pal tu ziam hong son ta'n,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka zo kikna pan, “Zingsang hong thetheng hi, ahizong zan hun hong theng kik leleau tu hi. Nong dongh kik nuam le hong heak kikin hong dongh ta'n,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hisia in Arabia taw kisai thupuak ahi hi. Dedan mi, Arabia ngamkol sungah kalaoh hon taw ngiaphual saatin a om note awng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />note kungah hong pai tuidu dangtaak mihingte tui pia vun. Tema ngammi note awng, ngaltaite an pia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Namsau taw kithalupna pan, thal taw kikaplupna pan le ngal launa theampo pan a suakta tu in mihingte tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in kei tungah, “Kum khat sung lianin Kedar minamte ii a letna bo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kedar mite sung pan thal toaite sia ngalhang belte hi a, ahihang amate sung pan tawm bek taang lai tu hi. Keima, Israel te ii Topa Pathian in ka son zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia in Mukholna Kuam taw kisai thupuak ahi hi. Bang thu piang ziam? Banghangin khua mite theampo in innkhum tungah poai vawtin om uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuapi bup ngamlum siasua a, aw sa le thin patauna taw kidim hi. Hi ngal sungah a thi na mite sia ngal simin a thi hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lampuite theampo taikeak in, thaltang khat beak zongh a kaap ma in kiman uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mihing a thite theampo atu in nasia tak ka kaa thei natu in, tu in keima nguak hong nusia ta'n. Hong heeneam heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi hun sia Mukholna Kuam sungah a liinglawng patauna, ngallelna le ahi biaibuai a pian hun hi a, tuate sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa Vaanglianpipa in ei tungah hong thengsak hi. Ih khuapi uumna luphungte kisaattham zo a, huna ngenin auna awte mualte kawm ah hawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Elam ngam pan ngalkapte thal le thaltang toai in siphu tung to in, hong pai uh hi. Kir ngam pan ngalkapte a lum tek taw kithoai sa in om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lei pha mama Judah kuamte sia siphu ngalleangte taw kidim hi; siphu ngalkapte Jerusalem kongpite mai ah ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah te ngal dalnate theampo cimhtham hi. Tuabang a pian ciang, ngalvanh koina phual pan ngalhiamte na la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem luphung koisung teng pua tuak cisia na mu hi. Jerusalem khua ah a om innte theampo na en kawkoai a, khuapi luphungte pua kik natu in, zak tu suangte nga natu inn pawlkhat na pheltham hi. Tui khol natu in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuikhuk a lui sia pan a luangsuk tuite khol natu in khuapi sung sangah tuibeam khat na vawt uh hi. Ahihang nidang lai pekin, hite theampo hong ngealsak le a piangsak Pathian na thusim bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang Vaanglianpipa Topa , Vaanglianbelpa in a kap tu a mau tu le sam meettol in, khau-ip puan silh tu in note hong sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua taangin note nuiza in poai na vawt uh hi. Neak tu in tuu le khuite na ngo uh a, sapittui na dawn uh hi. Noma in, “Ei teng zongh ne in dawnin ih om thei tha tu hi! Zing ciangin a thi tu ih hi hi,” na ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa , Vaanglianbelpa ama mama in kei hong paupui a, “Amate a nuntak lai teng a siatna kimaisak ngeingawl tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa Vaanglianbelpa ka pau zo hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in keima tungah kumpi innkuan sung thuzeakpa ahi, Shebna kungah pai in hi bangin va ci ta'n,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nang akua kisa ni ziam? Mualpangh suang sungah nangma atu thaan khuk khuak tu in bang thu nei ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thupi zongh thupi tha tu ni hi, ahihang Topa in nang hong zamhin hong vawk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in bawlung top bangin nang hong tawm tu a, a lian zaw na ngam khat ah hong vawk tu hi. Na kiphatsak pui mama ahi siphu ngalleangte ii kungah na thi tu hi. Na topa te innkuan maimawlsak ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in na zum panin hong not tu a, na za letna pan hong khia suk tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in Shebna tungah, “Tuabang a pian ciang, Hilkiah ii tapa, ka naseampa Eliakim ka samsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na zum puantual ama ka silsak tu a, na kawngkhau thuasak in, na thuneina theampo ama ka pia tu hi. Ama in Jerusalem le Judah mite tungah pa khat bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David ii suan le paal kumpipa nuai ah a pawlcing thuneina ama ka pia tu hi. Ama in zum tawtangte nei tu hi; ama hon sia, kuama in khak ngawl tu a, ama kha sia, kuama in hong ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama sia vanh khaina khat sawm bangin kip takin ka koi tu a, ama ii innkuan bup atu in maipha ngana ii a naak hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ahizong a beete le ama a bealhte theampo sia ama atu in vanhngit khat suak tu hi. Amate sia vanh khaina ah um le bealte a kikhai bangin ama tungah kibomkhai tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuabang a pian ciang kho takin a kikhen vanh khaina sia zuukin taak tu hi. Tua in a tungah a kikhai nate theampo ii bona hi tu hi,” ci hi. Topa pau zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia in Tyre taw kisai thupuak ahi hi. Tuipi tung a pai teambaw hawlte awng, khuangai in kap vun! Teambaw tawlngakna na khuapi Tyre sia kilalsak zo hi; a innte le teambaw tawlngakna munte lalcip in om hi. Na teambawte Cyprus pan hong heak kik ciang hi thute na za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sidon sumvawtte awng, tau in kap vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Egypt ngam ah a piang ante a lei a zuak tu le ngam theampo taw sum vawt kipee tu in tuipi kaantan in mihingte na paisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sidon khuapi awng, na maimawl hi! Tuipi le tuipi thuk liante in nang hong nialin, “Kei ta khat zongh nei ngei bong. Tapate, tanute ka vaak ka taa ngei bua hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tyre khua lalna thu a zaak uh ciang Egypt mite ngawngawn liinglawngin thinkiam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />No Phoenicia mite awng, he in kap vun! Na suatak natu in Spain ngam zot tu hanciam vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hisia in taanghlai pekin a kisaat Tyre khua nuam hi thei na tu ziam? Tuipi kaantan in ngamthakte saatin a teang tu mite a puak sia hi khuapi ahi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpi khuapi ahi, leitung ah ngual ii zatak, sumvawt thiamte ii khuapi ahi, Tyre khua ah hi bang theampo a pian natu in akua in ngeal ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in ngeal hi. Amate ii nasepna tungah a kiphatsak nate a bo natu le a zatak mite maizum natu in Topa in ngeal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Spain ngam ah ngamthak saatin a teang no mihingte awng, pai in lotho vun! No hong khoi tu kuama om nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in tuipi tungah a khut vaan in kumpi ngamte lawnthal zo hi. Phoenicia sum vawtna phualpite a kilalsak natu in ama in thupia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sidon khuapi awng, na lungdamna bo zo in, na mite in zawthawk thuak uh hi. Amate Cyprus ah a suakta zongin, ngammuang tuan ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />(Tyre khuapi ngamsate tatna a suaksak sia Assyrian te hi ngawlin, Babylon te ahi uh hi. Ngal matna tausaangte a sa, Tyre khua kulhte a pheltham le khuapi susia in a nusiate sia Babylon te ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuipi tung a pai teambaw naseamte awng, khuangai in kap vun! Na muan uh khuapi sia kilalcipsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tyre khua sia kumpi khang khat, kum sawmsali sung a kimakngil tu hun hong theng tu hi. Tua kumte a cin zawkciang, Tyre sia hi la sungah pumpi kizuak numei bang hi tu hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kuama ii phaw ngawl, a khuangai huai pumpi kizuak numei awng, na tengtongh la in khuapi kiimkot in pai in! Pate khatvei na kung hong zot kik thei natu in tengtongh tumin na lasakte sa kik in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum sawmsali a cin ciang, Topa in Tyre khuapi sia ama sep ngei sia ma seam kiksak tu a, leitung kumpi ngam theampo ah ama le ama a pumpi kizuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama ii sumvawtna pan a thalaw sumte Topa tungah ki aap tu hi. Ama in tua sumte kholcip thawthong ngawlin, Topa a bia mite in amate atu a kisamh an le puante leina in zangh tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in leitang lalsakin ngamkhingsak tu hi. Ama in lei maitang heakcipin, a mite thethaang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing theampo — thiampite le mihingte silate le tote, vanh leite le vanh zuakte, sum pukthaakte le sumpute, a hau a zawng, a thuakna uh kibang kim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leitang tamhtham in kisiacip tu hi. Topa in son zo a tuabangin kivawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitang ko ngaw in tul hi; leitung buppi zawngkhal hi; lei le van a nii in lal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihingte in Pathian thukhamte paltan na taw le a tawntungin a kikhomsuan tu a vawt thuciamna a siatsakna taw leitang ninsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom Pathian in leitang haamsiat zo hi. A mite in amate ii vawt bangin thuak uh hi. A nungta mihing tawm vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sapitkungte vul in sapittui tawm hi. Khatvei lai in a lungdamte tu in khuangai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a lungdamhuai tengtongh le khuang ngingte thim zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sapittui a neak uh hang lungdam in lasa thei nawn ngawlin; kuama in a limna he nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khuapi sungah na theampo kibuai in om a, kihuk natu in amate a inn sung tek ah kikhabil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sapittui a om nawn ngawl hu in mihingte lampi ah au uh hi. Lungdamna mangtatam siat zo a, leitung pan kibosak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuapi sia siacip in, a kongpite kisaat tham zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi sia in leitung theampo ah a om minam sim tungah a piang tu thu ahi hi. Tuasia in Olive ngate kithing siatin, sapitkung tung pan sapit sanghte a kilaw siat zawkciang an kila siat sa lo taw kibang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A suakta sunte lungdam in lasa tu uh hi. Nitumna sangah a omte in Topa ii letna thu son tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />nisuana sangah a omte in ama pok tu uh hi. Tuipi dung ah a teang mihingte in Israel te ii Pathian, Topa pok tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Leitung a khuala belnate panin a thumaan Israel minamte a kipokna late ih za tu hi. Ahihang kei atu in lametna bangma om ngawl hi! Kei zawm dikdek ing! Ngual a leeheakte in tawp ngawlin thetheam lai a, ngual a leeheakna nasia vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing theampo awng, hong ngai tavun! Launate, dumte le thaangsia nate in note hong ngak nginge hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A lauhuai patauna pan suatak tu a hanciam pawpo dum sungah taak tu a, dum sung pan a suakta pawpo thaang sungah kiman tu hi. Vantung pan a biing a bealin a sun bangin nguazu tu a, lei tawdapte liing tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitang kektham, tamhtham in, kikhen keak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Leitang mama sia zukham khat bangin hoi vatut tu a, vuipi sungah vui ii seam buk bangin huang tu hi. Leitung sia a mawnate in nengcip ngawpin, puk in tho kik ngei nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa ii, tungsang vaang neite le leitung ukte daan a piak tu hun khat hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dum sungah thongtaakte bangin Pathian in kumpi honkhat kaikhawm tu hi. Amate daan piak tu hun hong thet mateng Topa in thong sungah khabil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tha mial tu a, ni taang nawn ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile, Vaanglianbelpa Topa sia kumpi hi tu hi. Jerusalem khua Zion Mual panin ama in uk tu a, mipi lampuite in a vaangletna mu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in ka Pathian na hi hi; nang kong patoai tu a, na min ka pok tu hi. Nangma in nalamdangte na vawt siat zo hi; taanghlai pek a na ngealnate thumaan takin na vawt siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuapite na siasak zo a, a kulhte na lalcipsak zo hi. Ih ngalte ii sak kumpi innte bo zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thahat ngammite in nang hong pok tu hi; a ngilo mite ii khuapite sungah nang hong kikiita tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mizawngte le a cimawte in nang hong beal zo a, ngim le kham hun sungah ngammuanna nga uh hi. Vuipi vak ciang bukna na pia a, ni sat ciang nilim na pia hi. A ngilo mite in phalbi vuipi bangin le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />kongaw ngam ah nguatui hang bangin sim hi. Ahihang Topa nangma in ka ngalte na thimsak zo hi; mihing ngilote ii aunate, sun nisa sia meei ii a votsak bangin, na thimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in hi sung Zion Mual tungah leitung minamte theampo atu in anneakpoai khat — a limbel an le a phabel sapittui taw na vawtsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi lai ah minam theampo ii heena meeikaaite ama in thakhat thu in hepsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in thina a tawntungin mangthangsak tu hi! Ama in mihing theampo ii thitui nawlsak in, a mite ii leitung mun theampo ah a thuak maimawl na sia laaksak tu hi. Topa ama mama in ci zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuasia a pian ciang, mihing theampo in, “Ama ih Pathian hi! Ama ka muang zo uh a, ama in hong suatak zo hi. Ama in Topa hi! Ama ka muang zo uh a, ama in kote hong ngum zo ahikom. tu in lungdam thinnuamin ka om uh hi” ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Zion Mual dal tu hi, ahihang nganhing eak sungah taangphawte a kitotcil bangin Moab mite kituanhcil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in tui op tu hanciam bangin a khut vaan tu uh hi, ahihang Pathian in amate niamsuksak tu a, a khutte cimaw in khuumsuk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in Moab te ii a muanhuai luphung saangte susia in leivui suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah ngam sungah mihingte in hi la a sak tu ni khat hong theng tu hi; Ih khuapi muanhuai hi! Pathian mama in tua luphungte hung hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuapi kongpite hongin a thumaan minam, a maan a seam a mihingte tumsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa awng, nang hong muangin, tupna kho a nei mihingte a kicing thinnopna na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tawntung Topa muang in; ama in a tawntungin eite hong dal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in mihing kiphasakte kiniamkhiaksak hi; amate teenna a muanhuai khuapi lalsakin, a kulhte cimhthamsakin leivui suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zawthawk vawt a thuak mihingte in tu in tua khua zothal a, a peang nuai ah tuanhcil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa awng, mihing phate atu in a lampi ngilsakin; a khualhawna lampi na tamkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na deina bang kong zui uh a, nang sungah lametna kong nei uh hi; Kote deina theampo sia nangma na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zan in ka thin theampo taw nang kong thangai uh hi; leitung le a mihingte tungah thu na khen ciang amate theampo in thukhaikim thu sia he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing seksolte tungah nang dik napi in, amate in a maan a vawt tu he ngeingawl uh hi. Mihing thutangte teenna hi ngam ngawngawn zongh ah amate in khialna vawt veve lai hi; amate in na letna thusim ngawlin nial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na ngalte in amate daan na piak tu hunlam he ngawl uh hi. Topa awng, amate maizumsak in a, ngim ngasak in; amate atu in, na koisak sa daan piaknate thuaksak in. Na mite na it mama zia amate lak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa awng, kote mavan daupaina nong pia tu hi; kote ii matutna theampo sia nangma ii sepna hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kote Topa Pathian awng, kote sia ngual dangte in hong uk zo a, ahihang nangma bekma in kote Topa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu in amate thi zo a, nungta kik ngawl tu uh hi; amate ii thaa te thoto ngawl tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in amate daan na pia zo a, na lalsak zo hi. Kuama in amate phawk nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in koma ii minamte nong khangtosak a, a ngamngi theampo na keak hi, hi thu in nang hong thupisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa awng, na mihingte daan na pia hi, a thinna sa in nang tungah thu hong ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Numei nausuak tu a tut ciang na sa in a au bangin Topa awng, kote nong ausak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kote in na sa bot sa in om ka hi uh hang bangma a piang bua hi. Kote ngam atu in ngalzawna bangma ka nei bua uh hi; bangma taangtut ka nei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka mipui a thisate nungta kik tu uh hi! A pumpi uh nungta kik tu uh hi. Thaan sungah a mute theampo thoto tu a, lungdamin lasa tu uh hi. A tee vasip daaitui in leitung thathak a piak bangin Topa in taanghlai pek a, a thisate nungtasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka mihingte awng, na inn sung uh ah tum vun a, na inn uh khak vun. Pathian ii thin uukna a thai dong tawmvei sung buu zii vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in vantung a teenna mun panin leitung mihingte mawna hangin daan pia tu in hong pai tu hi. Leitung ah a kithatlum ku mihingte kipualaak tu a, leitang in tua a kithatlumte seal nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ni in tuipi sungah a om nganhing pui sia a that tu le kizialin a kual, a kiitakhuai Leviathan ngul sia daan pia tu in Topa in a vaang nei, thisakna namsau zangh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ni in a dei huai sapithuan thu Topa in son tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Keima in tua huan cingin tui ka buak tawntung hi. Kuama ii suk siat thei ngawl tu in sun le zanin ka cing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sapit huan tungah ka thin uuk nawn ngawl hi. Mot tu ling le lingkungte a om le ka haltum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang ka mite ii ngalte in, kei ii huuk tu a dei le, keima taw kilemna hong vawt tahen. Hi hi, amate in kei taw kilemna vawt tahen,” ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mailam sangah, Jacob ii suan le paal ahi Israel mite, thingkung khat bangin zung tha tu a, hong mom in a paak palh tu hi. Leitung sia amate ii nga taw kidim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in Israel te ii ngalte nasia takin daan a piak za in Israel te daan pia ngawl a, a thi a bo zongh tam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in a mihingte ngamdang ah saltaang tu in a puakna taw daan pia hi. Topa in amate sia nisuana sang pan hong va vui ngilo in seamkeaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahizong, Israel te ii mawnate sia, lawkite ii biaknatau suangte, leikaang bangin a kingoaicip zawkciang le Asherah numeipathian lim te a bo zawkciang, le ngimnamtui halna biaknataute a om nawn ngawl ciang bekin, kimaisak bek tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A muanhuai khuapi sia lalcip in om hi. Ngamkol khat bangin kinusia hi. Ngan thana le ngan lup thei na mun suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thingbaakte kongaw in taltan a, numeite in thingkang tu in tom uh hi. Banghang ziam cile mihingte in bangma tel ngawl ahikom amate a Bitphuapa Pathian in amate khuangai huai sa ngawl tu a, hesuakna lak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ni in, Euphrates ngun pan kipan Egypt ngamngi dong, taangcilte khat po in a zungtaang a tak le a si a khen bangin, Topa in a mihingte khat zawkciang khat kaikhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ni a thet ciang, Assyria le Egypt ngam ah saltaang in a om Israel te theampo tua mun pan sap kikna tu lemle khat kitum tu hi. Amate hong cia a, Jerusalem khua ama ii mual thiangtho tungah Topa bia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel kumpi ngam sia a lal ahi hi! Ama ii minthanna sia zukham a lampuite ii lu tungah a khuk paak taw a kivawt kumpi lukhute taw kibangin mang vadi tu hi. Paaknamtui pha tak kinoai napi in a kiphasak amate ii lutangte sia, zu a kham hu in khuaphawk ngawlin tua munah lumcip uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in amate sim tu in a kinging a vaanglian, a thahat khat nei a, tua pa sia hui le ngial bang, ngua a biing a bealin sun bang, tuipawm hawktai bang, tuiliim bangin hong pai in tua ngam zothal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua zukham lampuite kiphatsakna sia peang nuai ah kituanhcil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua a kiphasak lampuite ii a kiamsuk minthanna sia theipal min hun ciang a min masa pawpo kilo in, a kine khawng papai bangin mang vangeu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa sia a nungta lai ama mihingte atu in, paak taw a kivawt, a minthang kumpilukhu bang ahi tu ni khat hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in thukhenmangte tungah thutang khennate heak theina thin pia tu a, khuapi kongpi cingte sia ngalte hong sim ciang thinhanna pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kamsaangte le thiampite ngawngawn zu kham in hoi vatut uh hi. Sapittui le zuhang tam ne lei ahikom amate lungmangin lutu uh hi. Kamsaangte zukham lei ahikom Pathian ii a musak khol thute tel zo ngawl uh a, thiampite zongh zukham lei ahikom amate kungah a kipuak thute khensat thei ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tona sabuai theampo luak taw kidim in, a thiangtho mun khat zongh om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in kei hong phunsan uh hi. Amate in, “Tua pa in akua ka hihil ci in kingaisun ziam? Akua in ama ii thupuak dei ziam? Ama ii thupuak sia a nu noai a ten tuung naunote atu bekin pha hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Laimal khat zawkciang mal khat, lailam khat zawkciang lam khat, thu khat zawkciang thu khat ama in ei hong hil tiuteu tu hanciam hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei thuson nong ngai bua uh ahile, no tungah thu hong hil tu in kam tumdang a pau ngamdangmite Pathian in zangh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in note theampo tungah tawlngakna le noptuamna hong pia napi ama thu na ngai nuam bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua hu in laimal khat zawk mal khat, lailam khat zawk lam khat, thu khat zawk thu khat, Topa in no hong hil tu ahi hi. Tua zawkciang kal khat na suan simin na lutu tu uh hi. Note hong kiliamsak tu a, thaang sungah hong ki awksakin, thong hong kitaaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hisung Jerusalem khua panin hi mihingte a uk, no a kisathei mite awng, tu in Topa thu ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note in, thina taw thuciamna khat ka vawt zo uh a, mithi khua taw thukimna khat ka nei zo uh hi, ci in na kisuangtaak uh hi. Siatna hong pai ciang, hong pial tu hi ci in na kimuang uh hi, banghang ziam cile no hong huu tu in theamna le leilot thute na suang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu in Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Keima in Zion ah a kip a kho inn tawdap khat ka koi hi. Tua ii sungah innking suang sak khat ka phut a, tua tungah hi bang kammalte ki at hi, ‘A kho upna sia a thin zongh sau hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thutang khenna sia inn tawdap atu in a teena khau hi a, thumaanna sia a thikbawk khaukhai hi tu hi,” ci hi. Ngialtang le vuipi in na belh na suan leilot thute theampo seamkeak tu a, tuikhangte in na ngam muanna bosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thina taw na kiciam na kiphiat tu a, mithi khua taw na thukimna kiphiat tu hi. Siatna ii hong nawk ciang, note hong zothal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuasia in note sia zing khat zawk zing khat hong suu kikik tu hi. Sun zong zan zong na thuak uh kul tu hi. Topa kung pan hong pai thuthak khat sim in, patauna thak veu hong puak tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A kikhuathuang tham ngawl lupna tom mama khat tungah lum a, a kicing zo ngawl puanvan no mama khat silhin, mut tu a hanciam, paunak sungah mihing khat pa taw na kibang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in ama ngamtatna te a lamdang bang ahi hial zong — ama ii vawt tu a ngaisut sia vawt tu in Perazim Mualtung le Gibeon kuam ah ngal a sim bangin sim tu hi. Ama in ama ii a tel hak a nasepna khuang khim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima ii kidop natu kong thupiak sia nuisan heak vun! Na nuisan uh le, na suatak natu uh haksa vaial zaw tu hi. Ngam buppi lalcipsak natu in Vaanglianbelpa Topa ii thukhensat nate ka za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kong paunate ngai vun; kong sonte nadon vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lotho pa khat in an ciin natu a kingin ciang in tawlnga ngawl liangin lo laaih thapaai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khatvei lei laaihin a puua zawkciang ama in taang cite le an namtuisak ankung cite poai hi. Ama in zungtaang le mangtaang te a ngual in tu a, a lo hui sangah ancii dangte tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in a nasep tu zia he hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian in ama hil zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in simit ciite le an namtuisak ankung ciite saat natu in khetbuk ngit khat zangh ngeingawl hi; tua taangin ama in a zaang a pha bek ciangte zangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in zungtaangte a lal tu liang dongin, a cil tan viuveu hi ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile antangte a zaantham ngawl tu in leang taw cilna zia ama in he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi bang ciimna heakna theampo sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa kung pan hong pai ahi hi. Pathian ii ngealnate sia ciimna taw a ngeal hi a, tuate a tawntungin taangtung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian ii biaknatau ahi Jerusalem mama a lal ahi hi! David ii ngiana khuapi sia a lal ahi hi! A an neak poaite le poai khaamnate taw kum khat, kum nii omsak zii po vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua zawkciang, “Pathian ii biaknatau” a kici khuapi tungah Pathian in siatna thengsak tu hi. Kaana le tauna om tu a, a khuapi buppi sia chi taw a kituam biaknatau khat bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian in tua khuapi sia kiim uum in, sim tu in uumci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem sia leinuai pan pau nuamin a kisaan thithaa khat bang le leivui sung pan hong suak aw theap khat taw kibang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, nang hong sim ngamdangmite theampo leivui bangin kimut keak tu a, a kiitakhuai ngalkapte sia taangphaw bangin leangkeak tu hi. Muanmawk ngawl het le thakhat thu in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in vanto le zinliing taw nang hong suatak tu hi. Ama in vuipi nguapi le a kuang vazak mei khiak tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuasia ciang Pathian ii biaknatau khuapi a sim minamte ii ngalkap hon theampo, a ngalhiam le a ngalvanh a vekpi — na theampo — zanin khua ngaisut bang, mangmat khat bangin mang vadi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem sim tu in a kikhawmtua minamte theampo sia, andu ngilkial in a pukthi dek mihing khat in a mang in an ne a, a khanlaw ciang a ngilva tuan ngawl, ahibuale tuidu dangtaak mihing khat in a mang in tui ne a, a khanlaw ciang a dangko in a thoto taw kibang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Paisuak vun a, mawmaw in om vun! Paisuak vun a, mittaw in om vun! Sapittui ne ngawl bulin kham vun! Zu mal khat zongh ne ngawlin hoi vatut vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mutthip natu in Topa in na mut hong suaksak hi. Kamsaangte sia mihingte ii mittang hi tu a, ahihang Pathian in amate mit humcipsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kamsaan mukholnate theampo ii a khiakna sia note hong lak ngawl tu hi; a kikhakcip laizial khat taw kibang tu hi. Laisim thei khat kungah paipui in, nang hong sim tu in sawl le te a laizial kikhak cip ahikom kei sim thei bong hong ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Laisim thei ngawl khat tungah tua lai pia in hong simsak ta'n ci in sawl le te, ama in kei sim thei bong ci in hong zo kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in, “Hi mihingte in kong bia tu uh hi hong ci a, ahihang amate kammalte sia khiakna nei ngawlin, a thinsung in thudang ngaisun hi. Amate biakna sia bangma hi ngawlin, a teptee pak uh mihingte zui tu ngeinate bekma hi lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahiciang keima in amate muanmawk khol ngawlin a kiitakhuai tuasiatna, khat zawkciang khat ka tungsak tu a, lamdang ka sasak tu hi. Mihing ciimte a mawmaw suakin, a pilna theampo sia kimanna nei ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ngealnate Topa tungah a iimcip nuamte, a lal ahi hi! Amate a tup a sawmte vawt ku uh a, kuama in hong mu buan te, hong he buan te ci in ngaisun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in na theampo lumlet uh hi. Beal seakpa le tungman a koisia thupi zaw ziam? Mihing khat ii a vawt sa na khat in a vawt pa tungah, “Nang in kei nong vawt bua hi,” ahibuale, “Na vawt sia nangma in na he bua hi,” ci thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kam tepteena sungah, khuangei ngawlin taam thukpui sia lo ngam hong suak tu a, tuaciang lo ngam sia taam suak kik tu hi, ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ni ciang, nangongte in laibu a ngingin a kisim sia za thei tu a, khuazing sungah a om mittawte in, a mit uh hakin khuamu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zawngkhal in, a kiniamkhiak mihingte in, Topa ahi, Israel ii a thiangtho Pathian ii a piak lungdamna sia khatvei nga kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuasia sia midangte a zawthawk vawtte le Pathian a melsiate ii bona hi tu hi. Mawnei theampo kilalsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngual dang a sonsiate, khialna lian neite, daan piak tu a khaktante le thumaan mihingte tungah thu khaikim in thu a khen thei ngawl natu leilot thusonte sia Pathian in lalsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahikom tu in ngimna pan Abraham a suatak, Israel te ii Pathian Topa in, “Ka mite awng, note hong kimaimawlsak nawn ngawl tu a, maizumna taw na mai uh daang nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima kong piak tu tanote na mu uh ciang, keima sia Israel ii a thiangtho Pathian ka hi hunlam na tel tu uh hi. Zatakna nong pia tu uh a, lamdang sa in launa taw ka mai ah na ding tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihing mawmawte in thu tel thei tu a, a phuphun mihingte in a kihil tu uh sia lungdam tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in: “Judah ngamukte a lal ahi hi, banghang ziam cile amate in kei hong langpan uh hi. Amate in kei ngealna ahi ngawlte zui in, kei deina langpanin thuciamnate vawt a, mawna khat zawkciang khat vawt thawthua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in kei ngaisutna hong dongh ngawlin huna ngen tu in Egypt ah pai uh hi. Egypt te ii huuk tu a thangai manin, Egypt kumpipa muang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang kumpipa in amate hu zo ngawl tu a, Egypt te ii huukna in siatna taw tawp tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate ii tongciinte sia Egypt te ii khuapite ahi, Zoan le Hanes theng zo napi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah mite in huna a muanmawk uh bang a pia zo ngawl, a muanhuai ngawl minam khat sia a muan thaak phawphot uh a kisiik tu hi,” ci in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi thu sia thangsang sennealngam sungah a om nganhingte taw kisai Pathian thupuak ahi hi: “Tongciinte sia tawpite teenna, a nguu nei ngulte le a leang thei ngulpui omna, a lauhuai ngam sungah vak kawkoai uh hi. Amate huna mal khat zongh a pia zo ngawl minam khat a piak tu in a manham letsongte, a kalaoh le a laate tungah suanh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Egypt te ii a piak huna sia lui thawthong ahi hi. Tua ahikom Egypt sia, ‘Bangma hong law thei ngawl Ngulpui’ ci in min ka phua hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua mihingte bang taw kibang ziam cisia laibu khat sungah at in ci in Pathian in kei hong sawl hi, tua hile mihingte bangza in tatsia ziam ci in tepteena kho khat om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in Pathian langpan tawntung, leilot tawntungin, Topa hilnate nial tawntung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in kamsaangte a thim khipkhep natu in sawl uh hi. Amate in, “A maan sia bang ziam ci in ko hong son heak vun. Koma zaak nopte bek hong son tavun. A maan bua zong koma ii om ngei bangin hong omsak tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka lampi uh hong awn tavun a, hong khak heak vun. Na Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian ii thu za nuam ngawl khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian in, “Kei kong sonte thusim ngawlin zawthawk tatna le theamna na suang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />No, a maw na hi uh hi. No sia a kektham suk pang saang khat taw kibang nu hi; thakhat thu in puk tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zan niknek ahikom meikhuk sung pan meikam lua tham natu ahizong, tuikuang sung pan tui sua tham natu ahizong a bek lian zongh a om ngawl leibeal khat bangin nang hong kitamhthamsak tu hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian in mihingte tungah, “Hong heak kik tavun a, keima hong muang hiithiat tavun. Tua hile na tha uh hat tu a, ngammuang tu nu hi,” ci hi. Ahihang nong nial uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuasia luangin, siphu tai ngang mama tung to in na ngalte khut sung pan suatak tu na sawm uh hi. Maan nu hi — suatak natu ahile noma sep tu ma hi! Na siphute ngang khop hi ci in ngaisun nu hi, ahihang no hong delte ngang zaw lai tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngalte ngalkap khat na mu uh ciang no, a tulkhat in na taikeak tu uh a, tuaciang ngalte nga in note theampo hong taikeaksak zo tu hi. Mualdawn ah a kiphut laandial mung om liiliai khat simngawl buang, na ngalkap honte sung panin bangma kinusia ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuabang hi napi note hong hesuak tu in Topa in hong ngak veve hi. Ama sia note tungah hesuakna lak tu in a kinging sa in om hi, banghang ziam cile ama in a tawntungin a maan seam hi. Topa tungah muanna a nei te in mi lungdamte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />No Jerusalem ah a teang mihingte kap nawn ngawl tu nu hi. Topa sia hesuak thei a, ama tungah huna ngenin na kaa uh ciang ama in hong zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in haksatna hunte no hong phulsak zo tu a, ahizong ama mama tua munah note hong hil tu in om tu hi, tua ahiciang note in ama na zon uh kul nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lam ziat, ahibuale lam vei ah na pial tha uh le na nungsang pan ama in, “A lampi in hisia hi. Zui in,” hong cina aw na za tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngunn taw kizut in khamh taw a kituam, na milimte na la tu uh a, tuaciang ninteak bangin vawkkeak in, “Ka muna ah om heak vun!” ci in na ausan tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anciite na poai po uh ciang po a, khang a an tam na laak natu in Topa in nguazusak tu hi, tuaciang na ngante in a tat natu mun zai nei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na lo hong thawsak khuitalte le laate in a phabel le a limbel lopate ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na ngalte ii kulhte a kilaak ni ciang le a mite a kithalup ni ciang, muallian le mualnote theampo tung panin luitui luang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tha in nitaan za ma in taang tu a, ni in a taan ngeina sangin a zaa salivei in taang zaw tu hi, ni sali sung nitaanna bup sia ni khat a kingawm taw kibang tu hi. Topa in a mihingte tungah a thuaksak liammate tuamsakin a damsak ciangin hi thu theampo hong piang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa ii vaangletna le minthanna sia a khuala panin kimu thei hi. Mei le meikhu in Topa ii thin uukna lak hi. Ama pau a, a kammalte mei taw kibangin kuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuipawm in na theampo a taikeak bangin a mai ah vui vasak hi. Tua in minamte phialmang in susia ngawpin, amate ii a sia a ngealnate bosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahizong Pathian ii mihing, note in, poai thiangtho khaam ni zan a, na vawt uh bangin lungdam in la na sa tu uh hi. Israel te a huu Topa sia Biakinnpi ah a pai uh lai in tamngai aw zui in a paite bangin na lung uh dam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa in ama ii vaangletna aw mihing theampo in zasak tu a, ama ii thin uuk tutna thuak tu hi. Meikuangte, meei puakthamte, ngialtang kiate, a biing a bealin sun bangin nguazuknate om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Assyria mite in Topa ii aw a zaak uh ciang le a daan piakna a nasia mama sia a thuak uh ciang lau tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Topa ii amate ngim a piak kikik ciang, ama mite in khuang le tengtongh aw zui in lungdam tu uh hi. Pathian ama tatak ma in Assyria mite sim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nidang pek panin Assyria kumpilianpa kihal natu mei phualpi mun khat kivawt zo hi. Tua mun sia thukin zai a, thing a vum in kiseng hi. Topa ii husan ahi a kipee tan meikuang in tua mei taw tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Egypt ngam ah huna ngenin a paite a lal ahi hi! Amate in Egypt te ii ngalkap thahatna — siphute, siphu ngalleangte le ngalkapte suang uh hi. Ahihang amate in Israel mite ii a thiangtho Pathian ahi, Topa suang ngawlin huna zongh ngen ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in a sep sia he hi! Ama in siatna tungsak hi. Ama in mi tatsiate le a panpuite daan ka pia tu ci in a tawn bangin seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Egypt te sia pathiante hi ngawlin — leitung mihing bekma hi. Amate ii siphute in a pianzia tumdang hi ngawl hi. Topa in a dian tak ciang, a thahat ngam topsuk tu a, tuasia ii a hu a thazawm ngam sia zong puk tu hi. Tua te ngeal kilalcipsak khawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah, “Tuucingte bang zata in a au hial zongin, amate in tawpi khat sia ama ii a thalupsa nganluang kung pan bengkeak zo ngawl hi; tuasia bangma in, keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa ii Zion Mual ka kepna pan hong khaktan thei kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vacim khat in a bu tung pan a note a cin bangma in keima, Vaanglianbelpa Topa in, Jerusalem sungsia in ka hung tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian in, “Israel mihingte awng, kei tungah nong maw zo uh a, nong langpan zo uh hi. Ahitazong tu in kei kung hong zuan kik tavun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngunn le khamh taw na vawt sa uh ahi mawna a piangsak milim teng note theampo ii na vawkkeak tu uh hun khat hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Assyria sia ngal sungah kilalcipsak tu hi, ahihang mihingte thahatna taw hi ngawl hi. Assyria te ngal kisimna pan tai tu a, a tangvalte sia sila in kikai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kumpilianpa lau in tai tu a, a ngalkap maangte lauthawng mama ahikom ngalsimna in a zak a laandial nusia tu uh hi,” ci hi. Jerusalem khua ah kibia a, sangaw biakpiakna atu a kihal mei ii Topa — tua Topa pau zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khatvei ciangin thutuumna taw a uk kumpi khat le, thukhaikim thu taw a uk ngam lampuite om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate khat simin vui vak ciang le suangval vak ciang belhna le bukna bang hi tu hi. Senneal kongaw ngam sungah luitui luang bang le ngam kolhna munah a om suangpi lian khat ii limh bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang amate ii mit le bil in mihing cimawte kisapna mu in, za tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate thintom nawn ngawlin, heakna telthiangna taw diangin, a ci nopte ahi bang tatak son tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kuama in mihing mawmaw khat sia zatak huai sa ngawl tu a, mihing tatsia khat sia thumaan kici ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihing mawmaw khat in mawmawt kam veu pau in, a sia vawt tu vive ngaisun hi. A nasep le a kampau in Topa selnona vive hi a, ama in ngilkial dangtaakte an le tui pia ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngaisutna kicing ngawl pa sia ngilo in, a sia vive vawt hi; leilot thu taw mizawngte suksiat sawmin, a nga tu a kilawmte khaktansak tu sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang a zatak huai mipa in thumaan takin ngamta a, a maanna sangah kho din hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thinngimna nei ngawl, a ol no in, a nungta no numeite awng, ka ci bang hong ngai tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu laitakin lungkim tha tu nu hi, ahihang mai ciang tu hunin sapitngate na law tu uh om ngawl tu a, na thin uh kiam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thinngimna le nei ngawlin, nuntak ol in na nungta uh hi; ahihang tu in, patau in liing vun! Na puante suutkeak vun a na kawngah puansia lom sawm vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuangai in na awm uh beang vun, banghang ziam cile leiphana lote le sapithuante kilalsak zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />lingnguite le lingkungte ka mite ii leitang tungah po zo hi. Mihingte lungdam takin a teenna innte theampo atu le nuntakna a nuam khuapi atu in kap vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpi inn ngawngawn kinusia tu a, khuapi taisan in kiloai tu hi. Innte le amate a dal kulhte a tawntung lalcip tu hi. Tua mun ah ngam laate vakin tuute an zong tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahizong Pathian in ama thaa khatvei ma hong puak kik tu hi. Leisiate leipha suak kik tu a, lo panin an tam mama piang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngamsung mun theampo ah thumaan thutang le thukhaikim thu om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing theampo in a maan sia seam tek tu ahikom, kilemna le ngam muanna om tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian ii mihingte in thinngimna te taw kipeal in, a innte sia thinnopna le ngam muanna taw kidim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />(Ahihang duisung ah ngial kia in, khuapi sia kicimhthamsak tu hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An ciin natu tui kicing piikpeak in, laate le khuite a tat natu mun theampo muanhuai ahiciang mihing theampo bang zata in lungdam tu uh ziam?
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ih ngalte a lal ahi hi! Kuama in amate suttol ngawl, leeheak ngawl napi in, amate in ngual ii neisa suttol in leeheak uh hi. Ahihang ngual ii neisa a sutol tu le a leeheak tu hun bo tu a, tuaciang amate mama sia ngual ii sutol le theam thuak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa awng, kote hong hesuak ta'n. Ka lamet uh sia nangma na hi hi. Ni khat zawk ni khat kote hong khoi ta'n a thinngim hunin, hong hun ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ko atu ngal na sim ciangin minamte sia ngal kisimna awnging panin taikeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate ii neisate kizamh tu a ngalvanh mat bangin kilaaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa bangza in lian ziam! Ama in na theampo uk hi. Ama in thukhaikim le thutuumna taw Jerusalem dimh tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ngam bup kikhealna om ngawlin khosak tu hi. Ama in a mite sungsia tawntungin, ciimna le heakna pia tu hi. A nei lianbel uh sia Topa a thasiana uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngalhangte in hu ngen uh hi. Kilemna omsak tu a hanciam tongciinte nasia takin kap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lampi liante lauhuai mama ahikom kuama in tawn ngawl hi. Thuciamnate ciampealin, thukimnate kipaltan hi. A kizakta khat zongh om nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leitang kinusia cip in a awng thongin om hi. Lebanon ngam duisung ah thingte ngeau zo in, Sharon leipha kuam sia sennealngam bang hi a, Bashan ngam le Carmel mual tungah thingkungte a tee pul uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in minamte tungah, “Tu in kong diang tu hi. Ka vaangletna kong lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na ngealnate kimanna om ngawl a, na nasep theampo luithawthong hi. Ka thaa sia note hong lalcipsak tu meikuang khat bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leikaang nga natu in suang a kihal bangin na zaanvui tu uh a, lingkungte vut suakin a kihaltum bang na hi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A naina le a khualana ah a om mihingte theampo in ka sep sate za tek tahen a, ka vaangletna hong heaksak tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zion ah mawnei mihingte lau na taw liing uh hi. Amate in, “Pathian ii thukhenna sia a kuang tawntung mei khat taw kibang hi. Tuabang meikuang sung pan akua suakta zo thong tu ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thumaan son in a maan na seam uh le na suakta zo tu uh hi. Na vaang neina uh sia mizawngte theamna in zangh heak vun a, sumnguk sang heak vun. Mihing thalup a sawmte taw ahizong, a dang a sia vawt theite taw ahizong, kipawl heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua hile na ngammuang tu uh hi; a muanhuai kulh sungah om bangin thinmuang lungmuangin na om tu uh hi. Note in anneak tu le tuidawn tu na nei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A zai mama ngam khat, et hoi takin a uk kumpipa sia khatvei na mu kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nidangin na kiitak ngamdangmi shiadongte le thukankute sia thu nung phaw kik khat hi lel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na tel thei ngawl uh kam a pau, a kisathei ngamdangmite na mu nawn buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ih biakna poaite khaamna khuapi ahi, Zion khua en vun. Jerusalem khua en vun! Teen natu in bang zata in a muanhuai a bitna mun khat ahi ziam? Tua in a khetphinte a kidok ngeingawl, a sawmna khaute a tattan ngeingawl, a kikhiin ngeingawl puanbuk khat taw kibang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in a vaangletna eite hong lak tu hi. Ngun zaite le lui zaite hui ah ih teang tu hi, ahihang ngal teambawte tuate tungah pai nawn ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua teambawte tungah a kizangh khaute theampo a luithawthong hi; Teambaw puankhakte kiphal thei ngawl hi! Ih ngalte ii ngalkap honte nei na manpha theampo ih matsak tu a, vanh tam mama tu ahikom peangbaite ngawngawn zongin hawmtel khat tek nga tu uh hi. Topa mama sia ih kumpi hi tu a; ama in eite hong ukin hong sungsia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ih leitang tungah a teang mite kuama in ka ciina hi ci in phun kik ngei nawn ngawl tu a, tuaciang mawna theampo kimaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Minam theampo te awng, hong pai tavun! Hong kikhawm tavun a hong ngai tavun. Leitung buppi le leitung ah a teang mihingte theampo hi lai ah hong pai in thu ngai hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa sia minam theampo le a ngalkap honte theampo tungah thin uuk hi. Topa in tuate a lalcip tu in ningkhiin zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate ii luangte kiphum ngawlin, tualai ah a muat a ui in om tu hi; tuaciang mualte chi taw san tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ni, tha le aksite leivui suak tu hi. Van sia laizial bangin kizialin mang vadi in, aksite sia sapitkung, theikung tung pan a teete a pul bangin taak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in vantung ah a namsau kinging khol zo a, tu in suksiat tu a see sa Edom mite saat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa namsau sia amate ii a chi le a thau taw kituam tu a, biakpiakna in a kinei tuu le kealte ii chi le thaute taw kibang tu hi. Topa in hi biakpiakna sia Bozrah khuapi ah pia tu hi; ama in hisia Edom ngam sungah kithalupna lian mama khat suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihingte sia ngamsung khuital le khuital note bangin pukvawk in, leitang sia chisan taw sanin nganthau taw kituam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu hun sia Topa in Zion a suatak tu le a ngalte a thuk kik tu hun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Edom ngunte sia kattazasi suak tu a, leitang sia kaan suak tu hi. Ngam buppi sia kattazasi hal bangin kuang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sun taw zan taw kuang topin, a khu suak tawntung tu hi. Tua ngam sia khang khat pan khang khat ngam tul suakin, kuama in khualhawin kaantan kik ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Simbu le va-akte in tua ngam lua tu uh hi. Lei a piansak ma bang keakin tua mun sia Topa in ngamkol suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngam uk tu kumpi om ngawl tu a, lampuite theampo bo siat tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpi innte theampo sung le luphung taw ki uum khuapite sungah lingte le a mulnei lingkungte po in, ngia le simbute tua ii sungah teang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngamsate tualai ah taa tu a, doaite khat le khat kisam tu uh hi. Zantaa doai in a tawlngak natu mun zongin tua munah pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Simbute in a bu uh tomin, tuui in, a no keu a tua munah khoi in keam tu uh hi. Vaciikte khat zawkciang khat tua munah kikhawm tua tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa ii laibu sungah a nungta ngamsate ii thu zong vun a, bang ci ziam sim vun. Hi ngamsate khat zongh bo ngawl tu a, a kopin om siat tu hi. Tuabang ahi natu in Topa in thupia zo hi; ama mama in ngamsate kaikhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuate leitang a hawmsak tu le tel khat tek a pia tu sia in Topa ahi hi. Amate in tua leitang tungah khang sim khang simin teang tu uh a, a tawntungin tang suak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sennealngam lungdam tu a, ngam tawnghtol sungah paakte palh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sennealngam in lasa in, lungdam in au tu hi; Tuasia in Lebanon mualte bangin et hoi a, Carmel le Sharon lote bangin lei pha tu hi. Mihing theampo in Topa ii a nasiatna, a letna le a vaangletnate mu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A toi khutte le tha zawmin a liing vadil khupte a tha khosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Hat vun a lau heak vun! Pathian sia note hong suatak tu le na ngalte uh daan pia tu in hong pai tu hi,” ci in a thinkiamte theampo son vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mittawte in khuamu thei tu uh a, nangongte in khuaza tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Peangbaite leangin laam tu uh a, a pau thei ngawlte lungdam in au tu uh hi. Sennealngam sungah luituite luang tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a kaangh sen sate sia tuili khat suak tu a, lei kona sia ciktui taw kidimh tu hi. Ngiate teen ngeina munah buannawng sung a po lopa le pumpa kungte po tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua munah, “Thianthona ii lampi” a kici lampi lian khat om tu hi. Mawneite kuama in tua lampi tawn nawn ngawl tu hi; tua lampi a tawnte sia a mawmawte zongh lam pial ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua munah tawpite om ngawl tu a, a kiitakhuai nganhingte in tua lampi kaantan ngawl tu hi. Topa ii suatak sa mihingte in tua lampi tawnin a inn uh ah cia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in thinnopna taw lasa in, au in lungdamna taw Jerusalem khua theng tu uh hi. Amate heena le khuangaina taw kipeal tawntungin, lungdam top tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekiah ii Judah kumpi a sep zawk kum sawm le kum li kumin, Assyria kumpilianpa Sennacherib in Judah ngam sungah kulh taw a ki uum khuapi muanhuai theampo simin la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Sennacherib kumpipa in ama ii khutnuai ah Hezekiah kumpipa a tum natu sawl tu in ama ii ulianbel pa sia ngalkap honkhat taw Lachish pan Jerusalem ah paisak hi. Tua ulian pa in puantakte nasepna phual omna lampi, tuili tungnung pan tui laakna luamhui ah omna la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama taw a kimu tu in Judah mite ulian thum; kumpi inn sung sai pa Hilkiah ii tapa Eliakim; kumpi inn sung thuzeakpipa, Shebna; le thu tepteena keam pa, Asaph ii tapa Joah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Assyria ulian pa in, bangbel in Hezekiah kumpipa sia hi zata in kimuangsak ziam ci sia kumpilianpa in he nuam hi ci in amate son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in, “Ngal sim thiamna le thazaw suanna taangin kammal bek kizangh thei tu in um nu ziam? Assyria te leedo natu in akua in note hong hu tu in muangmaw nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Egypt te in hong hu tu hi ci in um nu hi, ahihang tuabangin na muanmawkna sia pumpa kung khat ciangkhut in zak taw kibang tu a — taltan in na khut hong sun tu hi. Egypt kumpipa a suang mihing khat pawpo sia tuabang veu ahi hi,” ci in thudokna nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Assyria ulianpa in hi bangin dongh thua lai hi, “Tua ahibuale note in Topa na Pathian ka suang uh hi nong ci tu uh ziam? Hezekiah in biaknatau mun khat bek ah Pathian na bia tu uh hi ci in Judah le Jerusalem mite tungah thu a son lai in, ama ii suksiatte sia Topa ii munsaang biakinn le biaknataute ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpilianpa min tawin kikhap thukimna khat ih nei tu hi. Siphu tung to tu mihing tam na nga zo na uh le siphu tul nii kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note in Assyria ngalkap mang a za nobel khat ngawngawn zongh na dem zo buatu uh hi; tua hi napi Egypt te kung panin leang le siphu ngalkapte hong puak tu na muangmaw lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa ii panpuina ngawl taw kei in na ngam uh hong simin lalsak zo tu in hong um nu ziam? Topa mama in na ngam uh simin lalcipsak tu in kei hong sawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Eliakim, Shebna, le Joab in ulianpa tungah, “Aramaic kam in hong paupui ta'n. Koma tel khu hi. Hebrew kam taw hong paupui heak in; luphung tungah a om mihingte theampo in hong ngai hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in, “Assyria kumpilianpa in note le na kumpipa tung bek ah hi thute theampo son tu in hong sawl sa nu ziam? Hi ngawl hi, noma taw a kibang ma in amate zun le eak ma a ne tu ahi, luphung tungah a to mihingte tung zongh ah ka son hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciang ulianpa dingto in Hebrew kam taw au in, “Assyria kumpilianpa ii hong son sia ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hezekiah ii na theamsak ngawl natu in ama in note tungah kidop natu in hong son hi. Hezekiah in note hong ngum thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa suan le muanin a nei tu in, ama in note zolsak heak vun. Topa in note hong ngum tu a, Assyria ngalkapte ii na khuapi simin a laak natu pan tawlngasak tu ci in ngaisun tha heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hezekiah ii thu ngai heak vun! Assyria kumpilianpa in khuapi pan pusuakin ama ii khutnuai ah na tum natu in thu hong pia hi. Note theampo na sapitkung tung uh pan sapitngate, na theikung uh pan theingate hong nesak tu a, na tuikhuk uh pan tui hong dawnsak tu hi —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />sapittui nei natu in sapitkung om a, anluum vawt natu in an omna, na ngam uh taw a kibang ngam khat ah kumpilianpa ii hong om kik sak mateng tuabangin na om tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in note hong suatak tu ci in ngaisutna taw Hezekiah in note theamsak heak vun. Minam dangte khat pawpo ii pathiante in Assyria kumpilianpa ii khut sung panin amate ngam hun zo na ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu in Hamath le Arpad ii pathiante koi sungah om ziam? Sepharvaim ii pathiante koi sungah om ziam? Akua in Samaria hun zo ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi ngamte theampo ii pathian khat pawpo in ih kumpilianpa khut sung pan, bang hunin amate ii ngam hun ngei ziam? Tua ahile Topa in Jerusalem hun thei hi ci in a bang in hong ngaisunsak ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hezekiah Kumpipa ii sonkhol bangma in amate thim khipkhepin om hi; kam khat zongh huthe ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaciang Eliakim, Shebna, le Joah khuangai in a puante balkeak in Assyria ulianpa ii ci teng kumpipa kungah pai in ko uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekiah Kumpipa sia amate ii thupuakte a zaak pawpo ciang khuangai in a puan balkeak a, khau-ip puan silhin Topa Biakinnpi zuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in kumpi inn sung ukpa Eliakim, zumsung thuzeakpipa Shebna, le thiampi khanghaamte sia Amoz ii tapa kamsaang Isaiah kungah puak hi. Amate zongh in khau-ip puan silh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi thu sia Isaiah tungah a son tu kumpipa ii thupuak hi a: “Tuni sia ngim thuak ni khat ahi hi; daan ih kha a ih maimawl hi. Eite sia numei khat nau suak tu kithoai zo napi, a tha zawm lei hu in a suak zo ngawl taw ih kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Assyria kumpilianpa in a ulianbel pa sia a nungta Pathian nunau tu in paisak zo hi. Hi bang nunaunate Topa na Pathian in za tahen a, nunauna kampaute daan pia tahen. Tua ahiciang a nungta lai ih mite atu in Pathian tungah thungen vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isaiah in Hezekiah kumpipa tung pan thupuak sia a nga ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />hi bangin zo kik hi: “ Topa in note hong hun zo ngawl tu hi ci a, Assyria te ii hong son hangin na patau ngawl natu uh in Topa in note hong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua kumpilianpa sia a ngam ah a cia kik natu in Topa in kamleang khat zasak tu a, tua zawkciang Topa in tua munah ama kithatlumsak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Assyria kumpilianpa sia Lachish khua pan ding zo a, Libnah khuapi naina ah ngalsimin a omna thu Assyria ulianpa in za hi; tua ahikom ama ii tungah thu dongh tu in tua munah ama pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ethiopia kumpipa Tirhakah in Egypt ngalkapte lampui in Assyria te sim tu in hong kuanna thu sia Assyria te in za zo hi. Kumpilianpa in hi thu a zaak ciang, Judah kumpipa Hezekiah tungah lai khat thaak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Na muan uh pathian in note sia ka khut sung theng ngawl tu hi ci in note hong son zo hi, ahitazong tua thu in note theamsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Assyria kumpilianpa in lalsak tu in, a khensat sa ngam khat pawpo a vawtna thu sia na za zo uh hi. Suakta zo tu in ki um nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka taanghpupite in Gozan, Haran le Rezeph khuapite lalcipsakin, Telassar ah a teang Betheden mite thatlum hi, amate ii pathiante khat zongh in amate hun zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hamath, Arpad, Sepharvaim, Hena le Ivvah khuapite ii kumpite koi sungah om ziam?” ci in at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hezekiah kumpipa in kamtaite tung pan laithak sia saangin sim hi. Tua zawkciang Biakinnpi ah pai in Topa mai ah tua laithak koi in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a thungetna ah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Cherubim tungah a to, Vaanglianbelpa Topa Israel ii Pathian awng, nangma bekma Pathian hi a, leitung kumpi ngam theampo na uk hi. Nangma in lei le van na bitphua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu in Topa awng, hong ngai ta'n a, kote tungah hong piang thute hong en ta'n. A nungta Pathian ahi nang tungah Sennacherib papau in hong nunauna thute theampo ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa awng, Assyria kumpiliante in minam tam mama susia in, a ngam uh siasak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a pathiante — tuate sia pathian tatak hi ngawl het a, khut taw a vawttawm thing le suang po ii limte bek ahi a pathiante a haltumsak sia ka he siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu in Topa kote Pathian awng, nangma bek Topa na hina thu, leitung ngam theampo in a heak natu in, Assyria te khut sung panin kote hong suatak ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaciang kumpipa ii thungetna, Topa ii a zona thu teng sia Isaiah in Hezekiah kumpipa kungah thupuaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in, “Sennacherib awng, Jerusalem khuapi in nang hong nuisan in hong nomu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na selno a na nunau sia akua hi tu na um ziam? Keima Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian hong melsia na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na siphu ngalleang theampo taw Lebanon mualsaangbel sia na zawna thu, kei tungah a kisuangtaak tu in na naseamte nong puak hi. Nangma in a saangbel cedar thingkung le a hoibel cypress thingkungte tua munah phuktan in, ngam thuk belnate dong na thetna sia kisuantaak na in nong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngamdang ah tuikhuk to in tui na neak theina le na ngalkapte in a peangte taw tuanhin Nile ngun a kosak sia na kiphatsak pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Taanghlai pek pan hite theampo ka ngeal sa ahi hunlam za ngeingawl ni ziam? Tuasia, tu in ka zomto zo hi. Kulh taw ki uum khuapi muanhuaite sia niinthukte na suasak natu in thahatna kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualai ah a teang mite sia thahatna nei ngawl a; lau in lungmang uh hi. Amate in lo sungah lopate bang, ahibuale innkhum tungah a po lopate, nisuana sang pan vuisate ii seamkeak bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Ahitazong na thu theampo, bang vawtin, a koisung teng pai cisia ka he siat hi. Ka tungah na thin uukna ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua na thin uukna thu le na kiphatsakna thu he siat zo ka hikom tu in na naak ah thikkoai khat kong thua tu a, na kam ah kamkhau thua in, nong paina lampi zui in kong cia kiksak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaciang, Isaiah in Hezekiah kumpipa tungah, “Hi thu in maisang hong piang tu lakna lim ahi hi. Tu kum le mai kum ciangin ngamh an bek na ne tu uh hi; ahizong kum kik ciangin thaicii tu in an na la tu uh a, sapitkung suanin a nga na ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judah minam sung pan a suakta mite sia khangto in, lei thukna ah zung tha in nga a nga thingno kungte bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jerusalem khua sung le Zion Mual tungah a suakta mihing om tu hi, banghang ziam cile Vaanglianbelpa Topa in hi bang piangsak tu in khensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Tuaciang hi thu sia Assyria kumpilianpa taw kisai Topa ii sonsa ahi hi: ‘Ama in hi khuapi sung tum ngawl tu a, thaltang khat taw zong kap ngawl tu hi. Lum toai ngalkapte kuama khuapi nai ah pai ngawl tu a, a kiim ah ngalnan natu kulh kivawt ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama sia hi khuapi sungah tum ngawlin, hong paina lampi ma zui in cia kik tu hi. Keima Topa pau zo khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka minthan natu le ka naseampa David tungah ka kamciam hu in hi khuapi hungin ka dal tu hi,’ ci hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Topa ii vantunglalang khat Assyria te ngiaphual ah pai in ngalkap 185,000 thatlum hi. A zing ciang zingsang khuavak tuungin tua munah amate a thi siatsa in kisial hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuaciang Assyria kumpilianpa Sennacherib sia nungkin in Nineveh ah heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ni khat ni in Sennacherib in a biakinn sungah a pathian Nisroch bia in a om laitak, a tate sung pan nii ahi, Adrammelech le Sharezer te in amate ii namsaute taw a pa thatlum in, tua zawkciang Ararat ngam ah ngelin suakta uh hi. A tate sung pan a dang khat ahi Esarhaddon in a kumpilian za lua hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi hunin Hezekiah Kumpipa a ciina in thi dektak hi. Amoz ii tapa, kamsaang pa Isaiah in ve a, ama tungah, “ Topa in a kul theampo vawt siat hen, banghang ziam cile dam kik ngawl tu hi hong ci hi. Tua ahiciang a thi tu in kinging in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang Hezekiah sia pang sang nga in hi bangin thungen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Nangma tungah thumaan tak muanhuai takin na na ka sepnate le sepsak tu nong dei bangin a tawntung hanciam in ka nasepnate hong phawk ta'n, Topa awng,” ci hi. Tuaciang ama sia nasia tak kap tu in kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang, Topa in Isaiah tungah hi bangin thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hezekiah kungah pai kik in a, ama tungah, “Na taanghpupi David ii Topa Pathian ahi, Keima in, na thungetna ka za zo a, na thituite ka mu zo hi; na nuntakna kum sawm le kum nga kong khangkhan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Assyria kumpipa khut sung pan nangma le Jerusalem khuapi kong suatak tu a, hi khuapi ka sungsia suak tu hi,” ci in son in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isaiah in, “ Topa in hong kamciam a peal ngawlna lim nang tungah hong lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahaz Kumpipa ii a vawt keallei tungah, Topa in a limh nungsangah kal sawm heak kiksak tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi. Tuaciang a limh kal sawm heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hezekiah a natna pan a dam kik zawkciang, hi pokna la at hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka khan kimlaitakin mithi khua zuan tu hi thong tang a, Huaikut teakkut in nungta ngawl tu hi tang a, ci in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A nungtate omna hi leitung ah Topa mu ngei nawn ngawlin, A nungta mi kuama mu nawn ngawl tu hi tangh a ci in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puanbuk khat a kiphelthap bang, thiambu pan puan a ki attan bangin, ka nuntakna hong ki attan a, hong kibosak hi. Pathian in ka nuntakna hong bosak hi ci in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tawpi in ka ngute hong thiatansak bang keakin zankhuateak na sa in ka au hi. Pathian in ka nuntakna hong bosak hi ci in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka aw theapin nging zo ngawl a, vakhu bangin ka kuul hi. Vantung ka etna in ka mit toi hi. Topa awng, hi ngimna theampo pan hong suatak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi thu sia Topa vawt sa hi a, kei in bang ka ci thei thong tu ziam? Ka thinngim lei in, ka mu thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa awng, nang atu, nang atu bekma in ka nungta tu hi; Ka cii hong damsakin, hong nungtasak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thinngimna sia thinnopna suak tu hi. Lauhuaina theampo pan ka nuntakna nong ngum hi; ka khialna theampo nong maisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mithi khua ah a om mite kuama in nang hong pok thei ngawlin, mithite in nang ii thumaanna hong muang thei ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu laitakin nang kong pok uh bangin, nang hong pokte sia a nungta laite ahi hi. Pate in a tate tungah na thumaan nate son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa awng, kei nong damsak zo hi. Tumtheite tumin nang pokna la ka sa tu uh hi. Ka nuntak lai uh tengin, na Biakinn sungah pokna la ka sa tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isaiah in kumpipa tungah na meima sia thei naai noai lete dam kik tu ni hi ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaciang Hezekiah Kumpipa in, “Biakinn ah ka pai zawk natu bang lim in hong lak tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi hun sungin Baladan ii tapa, Babylon kumpipa ahi Merodach Baladan in Hezekiah kumpipa cii natna thu za ahikom lai khat le letsong khat thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hezekiah in kamtaite pha takin vaidawn a, a hau nate — a ngunn le a khamh, a hel namtui te le a paaknamtui te banah a ngalvanh theampo lak hi. A vanh kholna inndoite ah vanhte ahizong, a ngamsung theampo ah a om vanhte ahizong a lak ngawl khat zongh om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang kamsaang Isaiah sia Hezekiah kumpipa kungah pai in, “Hi mite koisung pan hong pai a, nang tungah bang hong ci ziam” ci in dongh hi. Hezekiah in, “Amate sia a khuala mama na ngam Babylon pan hong pai ahi uh hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Amate in kumpi inn sungah bang teng mu ziam?” “Na theampo mu uh hi. Vanh kholna inndoite ah amate ka lak ngawl bangma om nawn ngawl hi,” ci in Hezekiah in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang Isaiah in kumpipa tungah, “Vaanglianbelpa Topa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />na kumpi inn sungah a om, na taanghpupite ii tu ni dong a kholsa vanh theampo Babylon khua ah a kipuak tu hun khat hong theng tu hi. Bangma taang ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma sung pan a piang na suan na paalte pawlkhat sia kipaipui tu a, Babylon kumpipa inn sungah numei uk seam tu in a cil kinget tu hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hezekiah kumpipa in ama ii nuntak sung tengin thinnopna le ngammuanna om tu hi, a cinopna ahi hunlam tel ahikom, “ Topa kung pan hong pai nong thupuak sia pha hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ih Pathian in, “Ka mite heeneam vun” ci hi. “Amate heeneam vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem mite hanthawn vun. Amate in ngei hialma thuak zo a, tu in a mawna teng kimaisak zo hi ci in son vun. A mawna theampo atu a kicingin amate daan ka pia zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw khat in, “Ngam tawnghtol sungah Topa atu in lampi khat vawtkhol vun! Ih Pathian atu in sennealngam sungah lam sial vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Munkuam theampo dimh vun; mualpi theampo maaitamsak vun. Mualnote zaangtam suak tu a, a hamna mun kinealsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa minthanna kilangh tu a, minam bup in mu tu uh hi. Topa ama mama in hi thu kamciam zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw khat hong ngingin, “Thu khat thangsak in!” hong ci hi. “Bang thu thangsak tu khi ziam” ci in ka dongh hi. “Mihing theampo sia lopa taw kibang a; ngam sungah a om paakte sangin khuangei nungta zaw tuan ngawl ahi sia thangsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in tuate vui in a seamsak ciang lopate kongaw in paakte vul hi. Mihingte sia lopate sangin thuak zo zaw tuan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi hi, lopate kongaw in paakte vul a, ahihang ih Pathian ii kammal sia a tawntung kip hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, mualsaang khat tungah kaato in lungdamna thupha thangsak in! Zion awng, nging takin au keakin, lungdamna thupha taangko in! Lau ngawlin son khe in. A Pathian uh hong pai tu hi ci in Judah khuate tungah son vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa sia vaangletna taw uk tu in hong pai a, ama ii a suatak sa mite hong tonpui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuucing pa khat taw kibangin ama in a tuuhon keamcing tu hi; ama in tuunote kaikhawmin a baan ah toai a, tuate ii puite dam takin paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Akua in khutkuak dim taw tuipi tee thei tu ziam, ahibuale a khutte taw vantung tee thei tu ziam? Akua in hai khat sungah leitung leitang heang thei tu ziam? tua ahibuale akua in mualliante le mualnote toai tee thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bang vawt tu ci sia Topa tungah akua in son thei tu ziam? Akua in ama hil thei tu ahibuale ngaisutna pia thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nate bangbangin vawt tuak hi ci a, heak natu le tel natu in Pathian in akua dongh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa atu in minamte sia bangma hi ngawlin, tuimal khat bang zongh hi ngawl hi; a khuala na ah a om tuikulhte sia leivui bangin zaang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lebanon ngam duisung ah a om nganhing theampo sia ih Pathian biakpiak natu in kicing zo ngawl a, a thingkungte zongh biakpiakna meihal natu in tawm lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Minamte theampo sia ama atu in bangma tham hi ngawl het hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian sia akua taw kitee ngat thei tu ziam? Ama sia bang taw kibang hi ci in bangbang na son thei tu uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama sia thikseakte khutthiamte ii vawt, ngunn huanna sungah a sun suk khamh taw a zut milim taw kibang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngunn ahibuale khamh taw a vawt zo ngawl pa in a muat ngawl tu thing teal hi. A pukvawk ngawl tu milim khat vawt tu in ama in khutthiamna neipa khat zong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />He ngawl nu ziam? Nidang pekin note tungah hong kison hi ngawl ka na ziam? Leitung sia bangbangin kipan cisia za ngeingawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuasia in van kalh ah a om leitung ii tungsia ama kumpi tokhum tungah a to pa ii vawt sa ahi hi; a nuai ah om mite sia mitsa nocik bang ahi hi. Puan dalna khat a kikhak bang le a sungah teen natu in puanbuk khat a kiphal bangin Ama in van a phalh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in a thahat ngamukte khiasukin bangma ngawl suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate sia a kung moino, a po tuung, a zung kho ngawl laite taw kibang hi. Topa in vui a vaksak ciang tuate kongaw in taangphaw bangin lenkeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thiangtho Pathian sia akua taw kitee ngat thei tu ziam? Ama taw a kibang akua dang om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Van ento in! Na mu aksite akua in bitphua ziam? Ngalkap honkhat lampui bangin, aksite lam a puipa in aksite a phakza he a, khat simin a min taw sam hi! Ama vaanglian mama a — amate khat zongh peuhe ngeingawl hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahile Israel te awng, ngimna na thuak uhte Topa in hong heaksak ngawl hi ahibuale thukhaikim om ngawlin na thuak uh ciang Topa in hong awlmawk ngawl hi ci in banghangin phun nu ziam
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />He ngawl nu ziam? Za zo hi ngawl nu ziam? Topa sia tawntung Pathian ahi hi; ama in leitung theampo bitphua hi. Ama sia toi ngeingawl a, ngim ngeingawl hi. Ama ii ngaisutnate kuama in tel ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in a thazawmte le a toite thahatsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khangmoite ngawngawn a tha uh kiam hi; tangvalte a tha uh bo in puk thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahihang a hu tu in Topa a muangte in a tha uh thathak a dim kik sia mu tu uh hi. Amate muvanlaite bangin a tha uh taw leangto tu hi; amate a tai hangin toi ngawl tu uh hi; lam a pai uh hangin a thazawm ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in, “A khuala ah a om ngamte awng, thimdide in om vun a ka thu hong ngai tavun! Zum ah na thu sung tu in kinging vun; thu son thei natu hun nga tu nu hi. Akua thumaan ziam ci in khensat tu in paikhawm tek tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nisuana sang panin ngalzo pa hong paipui in, a paina theampo ah ngal a zosak sia akua ziam? Akua in kumpite le minamte tungah ama zawna pia ziam? Amate sia leivui bang keakin ama ii namsau in saatsuk hi. Taangphaw sia vui ii letkeak bangin a thaltangte in amate thethaang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in ngammuang takin a nung pan zui in a del ciang, a peang in lei thutha man ngawl tu za in manlang hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi bangin, a piangsak sia akua ziam? A kua in taanghthu suak tu in piangsak ziam? Tua munah a kipatciil pan kipan keima Topa ka om a, keima Topa sia a khakbel dongin tua munah ka om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“A khuala ngammite in ka sep sate mu zo hi; amate lau in kiitakna taw liing uh hi. Tua ahikom amate a vekpi kikhawmin hong pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khutthiamte sia khat le khat kihu in kihanthawn uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lettama pa in khamh seakpa tungah ‘Pha mama hi!’ ci hi. Milim a nealin a zeam pa in thikpim taw a kilh pa hanthawn hi. Amate in, ‘A kipeena pha hi’ ci uh hi — tuaciang amate in milim sia a koina munah kho takin kilh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ahihang nang, ka naseampa Israel awng, kong tealsa mi na hi a, ka lawmpa Abraham ii suan le paalte na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leimongte panin nang kong paipui hi; a khualabel a kingte panin kong sam a, ‘Nang sia ka naseampa ni hi’ kong ci hi. Kei in nang kong nial bua a, nang kong teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lau heak in — nang kong ompui hi! Keima in na Pathian ka hi hi — bangma lau heak in! Kong thahatsak tu a, kong hu tu hi; kong dal tu a, kong ngum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Nang tungah hong thin uukte sia ngallel maizumna he tu uh hi. Nang hong sim mite thi tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />leitung panin mang vadi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in na Topa Pathian ka hi hi; nang kong thahatsak a, ‘Lau heak in; hong hu tu khi hi’ ci in kong son hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel awng, note in mi cii tawmte le a thazawmte na hi uh hi. lau heak vun; hong hu tu khi hi. Keima, Israel ii a thiangtho Pathian sia nang hong ngumpa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hiam, ha thak a nei ancilna bangin kong vawt tu hi. Note in mualpite cilin na susia tu uh hi; mualnote leivui suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate sia vui sungah na lawn tu uh hi; vui va in amate len a, vuipi in amate thethaang tu uh hi. Tuasia ciang keima in na Pathian ka hi hu in na lungdam tu uh hi; Israel ii a thiangtho Pathian ahi keima nong pok tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ka mite tui kisamh in tui a zon uh ciang, tuidu in a dang a ko ciang, Topa , keima in amate thungetna ka zo tu hi; Israel te ii Pathian, keima in amate ka nusia ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mualkolte kawm ah ngunte ka luangsak tu a, mun kuamte sungah ciktui ka luangsak tu hi. Sennealngam sia tuilite ka suaksak tu a, leiko na mun sia ciktui luangte ka suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sennealngam ah cedar kungte, acacia, myrtle le olive kungte ka posak tu hi. Ngamkolna ah taakthingte, juniper thing le cypress thingte po in dui hong suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi teng mite in mu in Topa, keima in hi nate vawt zo hi ci sia he tu uh hi. Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian in hite a piansakna thu sia amate in he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel te ii kumpi ahi, Topa in hite son tu nei hi: “No, minamte ii pathiante awng, na thu uh hong sung tavun. Na nial natu a phabel thute hong paipui tavun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi sungah hong pai tavun a, bang piang tu ziam hong sonkhol tavun, tua hile tuasia hong pian ciang ih he tu hi. A piang sa thute zum ah thiang son vun a, tuate ii cinopna hong son tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mai sangah bang thu hong piang tu ci sia hong son tavun — tuaciang note sia pathiante na hi hunlam kong he thei tu uh hi! Thupha pawlkhat vawt vun, ahibuale siatna pawlkhat tungsak vun; launa le lamdangsakna taw hong kidimsak tavun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Noma le na vawtte theampo bangma hi ngawl hi; no hong biate kiihuai hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Nisuana sangah a teang mihing khat ka teal zo hi; saksang pan a sim tu in ama ka puak tu hi. Beal seakpa khat in tungman a totcil bangin, ama in ngamukte sia buan bangin tuanhcil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Maan tatak nu hi kong ci thei natu in hi thu piang tu hi ci in akua in sonkhol nu ziam? Tua taw kisai kuama in kam khat zongh son ngawl nu hi; khat beak zongh in na kampau za ngawl hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zion mite tungah tua thu a son phitbel sia, Topa, keima ka hi hi; ‘Na mite hong pai hi! Amate inn ah hong cia uh hi!’ ci thu a son tu in Jerusalem ah kamtai khat ka paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua pathiante sung ka et ciang, son tu a nei kuama om ngawl hi; ka thudokte khat zongh in hong zo thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi pathiante theampo sia a luithawthong ahi hi; amate in bangma vawt thei vet ngawl hi — hi milimte sia thazawmin vaang nei ngawl hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “A tha ka hatsak ka naseampa sia hi sungah om hi — ama sia ka teal pa hi a, ka lungkim hi. Ka thaa taw ama ka dimh zo a, minam theampo tungah thumaanna puak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama au ngawl, a aw saangsak ngawlin, lampi ah a ngingin pau ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in pumpa kung koai khat thiaktan ngawlin, lalciin meitaang phe valep sia mitsak ngawl tu hi. Ama in mihing theampo tungah a kip thukhaikim thengsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in lametna bo ngawlin thin kiam ngawl tu hi; leitung ah thukhaikimna piangsak tu hi. A khuala ngamte in ama ii thuhilna ngakla uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in vantungte bitphua in, phalhkeak hi; ama in leitung le leitung ah a teangte theampo vawt hi; leitung mite theampo tungah nuntakna le husanna pia hi. Tuaciang tu in, Topa Pathian in a naseampa tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“ Topa, keima in, leitung ah thukhaikimin a kiseam ziam ci thu en tu in, nangma kong sam a, vaangletna kong pia zo hi. Nangma tungtawnin mite theampo taw thuciamna khat ka vawt tu hi; nangma tungtawnin minamte tungah khuavak ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma in mittawte ii mitte na hong tu a, thongzing sungah a tote na suatak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Keima bekma Topa na Pathian ka hi hi. Pathian dang khat tungah ka vaangletna kihawm ngawl tu hi; kei hong kipoknate sia milimte ka hawm buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu in ka sonkhol thute taangtung tu hi. Tu in a piang ngawl lai thu thakte hong pian ma ngawngawn in, kong son tu hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa tungah la thak khat sa vun; leitung theampo awng, ama pokna lasa vun! Tuipi tung khualhawte awng, ama pok vun; Tuipi sungah nganhingte theampo awng, ama pok vun! ngam khuala nate le tua munah a teangte theampo awng, lasa vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sennealngam le a khuapite in Pathian pok hen; Kedar mite in ama pok hen! Sela khuapi sungah a teangte in mualdawnte pan lungdamin au hen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngam khuala na sungah a teangte in Topa tungah pokna le minthanna pia hen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa sia ngalhang pa bangin ngalsim tu in kuan hi; Ama sia ngal do tu lawpin kinging hi. Ama in ngal phawngin au a, hanla sam hi; Ama in a ngalte tungah a vaangletna lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian in, “Khuangei hial poma ka thim dide hi; ka mite ka paupui bua hi. Ahitazong tu in ka dian tu hun hong theng zo hi; numei nausuak tun tu bangin ka au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mualnote le mualliante ka siasak tu a lopa le thingkungte ka kongawsak tu hi. Ngundungte sennealngam suaksakin, tuilite ka kangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mittaw ka mite sia amate tot ngeingawl lampite ah lam ka pui tu hi. Amate khuazing sia khuavak suaksakin a hamna mun sia amate mai ah ka nealsak tu hi. Hite sia ka kamciamte hi a, peal ngawlin ka taangtungsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Milimte a muangte theampo, milimte a pathian hi a cite theampo kimaizumsakin, kimaimawlsak tu hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in, “Ngai vun, no nangong mite awng! A nai in en vun, no mittawte awng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka naseampa sang khuamu ngawl zaw khat po, kamtai in ka sawlpa sangin nangong zaw khat po a om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel awng, nang in tam mama na mu zo hi, ahihang nang atu in bang khiakna nei ziam? Na khuazaak natu in bil na nei hi, ahihang bang tatak na za ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa sia hong ngup tu a ngakla Pathian hi a, tua ahikom a thukhamte le a hilnate thupisak hi, tuaciang ama in tuate a mite ii zatak tu dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang tu in a mite kisuttol zo hi; leinuai thong ah kikalhcipin thong sungah kiseal hi. Amate ii vanhte kiphuulin kisuttol a, amate suatak tu in kuama hong pai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Note sung pan akua in hi thu ngai tu nu ziam? Tu pan kipan pha takin, na ngai tu uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A suttolte tungah Israel te a pia sia akua ziam? Eite ii a tungah ih maw, Topa ma ahi hi! Ama ii dei le oai bangin ih nungta bua a, ama ii hong hilnate bang ih mang bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahiciang ama ii thin uuk tut nate eite hong thuaksakin, ngal ii daan hong thuaksak hi. Ama ii thin uukna sia mei bangin Israel mite theampo sungah kuang hi, ahihang bang thu piang ziam cisia eite in ih he ngei bua hi; tua ih thuakna panin eite in heakna bangma ih nei peuma bua hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel awng, nang hong bitphua Topa in, “Lau heak in — kong ngum tu hi. Na min taw kong sam zo hi — nang sia Keima mi na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tui thukte na kaantan ciang, nang taw kong omkhawm tu hi; ngim na thuaknate in hong zo zo ngawl tu hi. Meikuang na kaantan ciang, na kaangh buatu hi; na thuak haksatnate in nang hong nasak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile keima in Topa na Pathian, Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian, nangma hong ngumpa ka hi hi. Nangma kong suataksak natu in Egypt ka suplaw tu a; Ethiopia le Seba ka suplaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na nuntakna ngum tu in minamte theampo ka suplaw tu hi, banghang ziam cile nang sia kei atu in na manpha a, nang kong it a kong upat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lau heakin — nangma hong ompui khi hi! “Ni suana a khualana pan le nitumna sang a khuala belna panin, na mite inn ah kong ciapui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saksangte tungah amate paisak vun ka ci tu a; thangsang te tungah amate khaktan heak vun ka ci tu hi. Ngam khuala na pan le leitung mun theampo panin ka mite heak kik tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate sia keima mite hi a, keima hong minthangsak tu in ka bitphua ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian in, “Ka mite zum ah sam vun. Amate in mittang nei hi napi, a mit uh taw hi; amate in bil nei hi napi, a nangong uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thu kisitna munah hong pai natu in minamte sam vun. Amate ii pathiante sung pan akua in maisang thu sonkhol thei ziam? Amate sung pan akua in tu a a piang thu sia sonkhol ziam? Hi pathiante in a sonkhol thute maanin, amate kammalte maan hi, ci in a kilangh natu in, a tetti te hong paipui tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Israel mite awng, note in ka tetti te na hi uh hi; kei hong he in nong up natu le, keima bekma Pathian ka hi sia na tel natu uh in ka naseam tu in no kong teal hi. Keima simngawl pathian dang om ngawl hi; om ngeingawlin, maisang zongh ah om ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“No hong ngum thei tu sia Topa ahi, keima khat bekma ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bang hong piang tu cisia ka sonkhol zo a, tuaciang no hong hu tu in kong pai hi. Ngamdang pathian in hi bang vawt ngeingawl hi; note in ka tetti te na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in Pathian ka hi a, a tawntungin ka hi tu hi. Kuama in ka vaangletna panin suakta thei ngawl tu hi; ka septe kuama in kheal zo ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian, note hong ngum Topa in, “Note hong ngum tu in, Babylon a sim tu ngalkap honkhat kong puak tu hi; khuapi kongpite ka siasak tu a, a mite auna awte in kaana aw suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in Topa a thiangtho na Pathian ka hi hi. Israel awng, no kong bitphua a, keima in note kumpi ka hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nidang lai pekin Topa in tuipi kaantan in lampi khat vawt a, a tuipeite kaantanin lamzin khat vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in siphu ngalleangte le siphute a kihel, a thahat ngalkap hon khat suksiatna ah lampui hi. Amate pukin tho kik nawn ngawl a, meivak kuang muutmit bang ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahizong Topa in, “Nungsang thute len heak vun a, taanghlai a piang thute thupi in ngaisun heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thak na khat ka vawt tu sia en vun. Tuasia hong piang zo hi — tu in mu thei nu hi! Ngam tawnghtol sungah lampi khat ka vawt tu a, tualai ah note atu in tui ka luangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngamsate ngawngawn in kei hong zakta tu hi; ka tealsa mite tui pia tu in sennealngam sungah nguntui ka luansak ciang, ngiate le kalaoh vacimte in kei hong pok tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate sia keima atu in ka vawt mite hi a, amate in keima hong pokna lasa tu uh hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel awng, ahihang kei nong cimtak zo hi; nang in kei nong bia bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangma in tuu taw na meihal biakpiaknate kei kungah nong paipui bua hi; na biakpiakna taw kei nong zatak vawt bua hi. Biakpiaknate ngenin vanhngit kong suan bua a, ngimnamtui ngenin, thinngim kong pia bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kei atu in ngimnamtui na lei bua a, na nganhingte ii thau taw nong lungkimsak bua hi. Ahihang na mawnate taw kei tungah vanhngit nong suan zaw pumsai a; khialna na vawtnate taw in ka thin nong ngimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahitazong, na mawna hong maisak sia Pathian keima hi a, keima ka hikom hi bangin ka vawt hi. Na khialnate lenin maw kong suan buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Zum ah pai tawng; nang hong kimawsakna thu hong paipui ta'n! Nangma in a maan na hina thu lak tu in na thu sung in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na taanghpupi masa belpa uh maw hi; na lampuite ka tungah hong khial hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />no hong ukte in ka inn thiangtho sia ninsak uh hi. Tua ahikom Israel tungah siatna kong thengsak hi; ka mite selnona ka thuaksak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel, ka naseampa, ka teal mi, Jacob suan le paalte awng, tu in ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />No hong bitphua Topa ka hi hi; na sua hun pan kipan, kong hu zo hi. Lau heak in; nangma in kong it kong teal mi, ka naseampa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“A dangko leitang tungah tui ka pia tu a leiko tungah luitui ka luangsak tu hi. Na tate tungah ka thaa ka bua tu a, na suan na paalte tungah ka thupha ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in pha takpi in tui a kibuak lopate le, luitui luangte hui ah a po pakngiam thingte bangin khang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Mite, khat zawkciang khat in, ‘Keima in Topa aa ka hi hi,’ ci tu hi. Amate in Israel mite taw kikop tu in hong pai tu uh hi. mi simin a baan tungah Topa min at in ama le ama sia Pathian ii mihing khat ka hi hi,’ ci tu hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel dalin, a uk Topa , Vaanglianbelpa Topa in: “Keima in a masabel, a khakbel le khat bek ahi Pathian ka hi hi; keima simngawl pathian dang om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima sep bangin akua dang in seam thei ziam? A kipatciil pan a tawpna hun dong a piang tu thu theampo akua in sonkhol thei ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lau heak vun, ka mite awng! Taanghlai hun pan kipan tu hun dong hong piang tu thu ka sonkhol sa theampo note in na he uh a, tuaciang, note in ka tetti na hi uh hi. pathian dang a om ziam? Ka zaak ngeingawl a vaanglian pathian dang khat po om ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Milim a vawt mite theampo mannung ngawlin, amate ii a man neisak mama pathiante sia luithawthong hi. Hi bang pathiante a biate sia a mit uh taw in, bangma he ngawl uh a — amate kimaimawlsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />pathian khat bangin biak tu in thik milim vawt tu sia bangma a phatna om ngawl hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabangte a bia theampo in maizumna nga tu hi. Milim a vawt mite sia mihing ma hi lel uh hi. Amate hong paisak tavun a, thusitna thuaksak vun — amate patau tu a, maimawlna thuak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thik seakpa in thikbek khat la in meikam tungah pum taw zaap hi. Ama ii a thahat khut taw ama dei bang lim a sua natu in, sek vikin seak hi. Ama in na a sep ciang, ngilkial dangtaak in toi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lettama pa in thing pitee hi. Ama inn sungah a koi tu in, ama in leikaang taw lim khat suai in, ama na zakte taw khuakin, a mealpha mihing lim khat vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in a zak tu in cedar thingkungte phuk tu hi, tua ahibuale oak thingkung ahizong cypress thing ahizong duisung panin teal tu hi. Tua ahibuale laurel thingkung suanin a khan natu in nguatui ngak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihing khat in thingkung khat sia thingthu tu le milim vawt natu in zangh hi. Ama in thing khen khat sia a meilum oai tu le anluum em natu in zangh hi; khen khat taw pathian vawtin bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in thing pawlkhat sia meikhuk ah thut hi; sa em in ne a, lungkim hi. Ama in mei oai in, “Khualum a bang zata nuam ziam! Mei sia pha mama ta a!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thing a om lai sia taw ama in milim khat vawt a, tuaciang a mai ah kun in bia hi. Ama in milim tungah thungen in, “Nang in ka pathian na hi hi — hong ngum ta'n!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuabang mite sia mawmaw leilam ahikom amate in bang teng vawt khu ziam ci zongh he ngawl hi. Amate in thumaan thutak a mu thei ngawl natu in, a mit uh si in, a tel thei ngawl natu in a ngaisutna khak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Milimte a vawtpa in hi bangin a ci thei natu ciimna heakna nei ngawl hi, “Thing pawlkhat ka thuttum hi. Meikam tungah anluum pawlkhat ka em a, sa zongh em in ka ne hi. A om lai thingte sia milim in ka vawt hi. Hi munah thingtawng khat ii mai ah ka kunsuk hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama sia vut ne te taw kibang lel hi. Ama ii mawmawt ngaisut nate in lamkhialsak zo a ama sia kihu zo nawn ngawl hi. A khut sungah a toai milim sia pathian hi vet ngawl hi, ama in ci nuam ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel awng, hi thu ciamtee in; ka naseampa na hi sia ciamtee in, ka naseam tu in nang kong bitphua a, kong mangil ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na mawnate meeikaai bangin ka bosak zo hi. Ka kungah hong cia kik ta'n; keima in nang hong ngumpa ka hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lungdamin au vun, no vantungte awng! Au vun, lei sung a thuk munte awng! Lungdamin au vun, mualte le ngam sungah a om thingkungte theampo awng! Topa in a letna sia ama mi Israel te a ngupna taw in hong lak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Keima in Topa, nang hong ngumpa ka hi hi. Keima in nang hong bitphuapa ka hi hi. Keima in Topa , na theampo A bitphuapa ka hi hi. Keima nguakin vantungte ka zalhkeak hi; leitung ka vawt lai in, kuama in kei hong hu ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aisaan theite a mawmaw ka sua tu a, aksi en theite ii thuson kholnate a lungmanhuai ka sua tu hi. Mipilte ii kammalte ka nial a amate pilna sia mawmawtna ahi hunlam ka lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahihang ka naseampa in thuson kholna khat a nei ciang, ka ngealnate pualaak tu in, kamtai khat ka puak ciang tua ngealnate le sonkholnate ka taangtungsak hi. Jerusalem ah mite teang kik tu hi ci in Jerusalem tungah ka son a, Judah ngam khuapite kisa kik tu hi ci in Judah ngam khuapite ka son hi. Tua khuapite sia a siatcipnate sung pan tho to tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thupiakna kam khat taw tuipi ka kangcipsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Keima in Cyrus tungah, ‘Nangma in keima luangin a uk tu pa na hi hi; Keima dei bangin na seam tu hi: Jerusalem khua a kisak kik natu le Biakinnpi tawdapphate a kipha natu in thu na pia tu hi,’ ka ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Cyrus sia kumpi tu in teal zo hi! Topa in ngamte zo tu in ama sawl zo hi; kumpite ii vaangletna hawkkeak tu in Topa in ama puak hi; Topa in khuapi kongpite Cyrus atu in hong tu hi. Cyrus tungah Topa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Keima in muallian mualnote tamkimsakin, na lampi ka puua tu hi. keima in taau kongpite thiaktan in a thikzawlte ka saattham tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zingna munah, a thimtham munah a kiphual sumngumte nang kong pia tu hi; tuasia ciang keima in Topa ka hi hunlam le Israel ii Pathian in na minlo in nang hong sam zo hi cisia na tel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka tealsa mi ahi Israel ka naseampa hu tu in nang kong sep hi, nang in kei hong he ngawl na hitazong upatna lian kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Keima in Topa ka hi hi; pathian dang om ngawl hi. Na kitaangsap thahatna sia, nangma in kei hong he ngawl na hihang kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Leimong khat pan leimong khat dongah a om mihing theampo in keima sia Topa ka hina thu le pathian dang om ngawl a hina thu a heak thei natu in hi bangin ka vawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in khuavak le khuazing ka bitphua khawm hi; thupha le tuasiatna ka puak khawm hi. Topa ahi, keima in hite theampo ka vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in ngalzawna sia ngua bangin van pan ka zusak tu a; a saang tu in lei kihong tu a suatakna le thumaanna taw paak bang hong palh tu hi. Topa, keima in hisia ka piangsak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A dangte theampo taw ma a kibang leibeal khat in ama a vawtpa kam nial ngam tu ziam? Tungman in beal seakpa tungah bang vawt ni ziam ci in a dongh ziam? Beal in beal seakpa tungah thiam bua teh ci in phunsan ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Akua in a nu a pate tungah, “Banghang hi bang keak a hong piangsak nu ziam?” ci ngam tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian ahi, Topa, maisang atu a piangsak pa in: “Ka tate taw kisai in kei tungah thu nong dok natu thu, ahibuale kei vawt tu a kul sia nong son natu thu na nei bua hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima in leitung a vawtpa le tua tungah a teang tu minam a bitphuapa ka hi hi. Ka vaangletna taw vantungte ka phalhkeak a; ni, tha le aksite ka uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka tup ka sawmna bang a taangtut thei natu le nate a maan a sua natu a seam tu in Cyrus ka thaw hi. Ama ii khualhawna lampi theampo ka tangsak tu hi. Ama in ka khuapi, Jerusalem sa kik tu a, koltaang ka mite suaktasak tu hi. Hi thu vawt tu in kuama in ama cial ngawl hi, ahibuale sumnguk pia ngawl hi” ci hi. Vaanglianbelpa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in Israel tungah, “Egypt le Ethiopia te hauna sia no atu hi tu a, a tunsaang Seba mite sia na sila uh suak tu hi; amate thikkol kibulin na nung uh hong zui tu hi. Amate in note mai ah kunin, ‘Pathian sia note taw omkhawmin — ama bekma Pathian hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A mite a ngum, Israel te ii Pathian sia, ama le ama a kiseal Pathian ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Milim a vawtte a vekpi in kimaizumsak tu hi; amate a vekpi in a mai uh kimawlsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang Israel ahile Topa in ngumin, a ngalzawna a tawntungin kip hi; Ama mite kimaimawlsak ngeingawl tu hi,’ ci in pualaak tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in vantungte bitphua a — ama sia Pathian ahi hi! Ama in leitung lemh in vawt a — a kip a kho suaksak hi. Ama in leitung a awngthong ngamkol khatin vawt ngawl a, mihing teenna mun tu in piangsak hi. “Keima in Topa ka hi a, Pathian dang om ngawl hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima in a thimthamin thu ka son ngei bua a, ahibuale ka tupnate ka phualseal bua hi. Kuama teen ngawlna a awngthong ngamkolna munah kei hong zong tu in Israel te ka taangsamh bua hi. Keima in Topa ka hi a, thumaan thutak ka son hi; a maan nate ka pualaak hi,” a ci pa sia ama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in, “Ngam tuatuam pan mite awng, a lal kumpi ngamlian pan a suakta mite theampo awng, hong pai tek tavun; thu sit thuak tu in noma na ki aap vun! A thing milimte taw thuangsia khawmin amate a ngum thei ngawl pathian tungah thungen mite — tua mite in bangma heak nei ngawl uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hong pai tavun a, na thu uh zum ah son vun; thu neite khat le khat kikum hen. Thupiang tute akua in taanghlai in sonkhol ziam? A mite a ngum Pathian, Topa sia keima hi ngawl kana khi ziam? Keima ngawl pathian dang om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Leitung mihing theampo awng, tu in kei kungah hong kiheak tavun a, ngupna nga tavun! Pathian khat bek a om sia keima ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka kamciam sia thumaanin, kikheal ngawl tu hi. Keima in keima ka hina theampo taw ciliaphuai takin ka kiciam hi: Mihing theampo hong pai in ka mai ah hong khupdin tu uh a, kei tungah thumaan tu in hong kiciam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Amate in keima taw bekin ngalzawna om a thahatna kinga hi ci tu uh hi; ahihang kei hong ngaimawte theampo in maimawlna thuak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa, keima in, Jacob ii suan le paalte theampo ka suatak tu a, amate in kei hong pok tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia in Babylon ii pathiante bona thu ahi hi! Bel le Nebo sia khatvei lai in kibia ngei a, ahihang tu in amate sia laate tungah kisuanhin, a toi nganhingte ii vanhngit khat suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Milimte in amate le amate kingum thei ngawl hi; tuate kimatsak in kipaipui hi. Hi thu sia Babylon ii pathiante bona thu ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka mite sung pan a taanglai Jacob suan le paalte theampo awng, hong ngai tavun. Na sua uh pan kipan kong ou kong pau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in note Pathian ka hi a, na huai na teak na puakkaan dong kong ou kong keam tu hi. Keima in note kong vawt a kong khoi tu hi; note kong hu tu a, kong suatak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Akua taw hong tee ngat tu nu ziam?” Topa in ci hi. “Kei taw a kibang akua dang om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihingte in a dangka ipte hongin khamhte suakeak hi; khaikhin taw ngunnte tee uh hi. Amate in pathian khat vawt tu in khamh seak khat cial hi; tuaciang amate kunin tuasia bia uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in a liangko tungah suanhto in pua uh hi; Ama ii a om natu munah koi in, tualai ah om a, tua mun pan koima dangah kin thei ngawl hi. Khat pawpo in ama tungah thungen le ama in zo thei ngawlin, ahibuale tuasiatna panin ngum thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Hi thu ciamtee vun, no mimaw mikhialte awng; ka sep sate ngaisun vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nidang lai a, a piang thute phawk vun; keima bekma Pathian hi a, kei taw a kibang kuama dang om ngawl a hina thu phawk tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kipatciil panin a piang tu thu ka sonkhol zo hi; bang hong piang tu cisia taanghlai pek panin ka sonkhol zo hi. Ka ngealnate taangtung ngawlin om ngeingawl tu a, vawt tu ka sawm theampo ka vawt tu hi, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nisuana sang panin mihing khat hong pai tu in ka sam hi; Ama in muthi bangin suktun in hong tuak suk a, ka ngeal sate taangtungsak tu hi. Keima ii ka sonsa bangma in, kiseam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ngal zaw natu khuala mama lai hi ci in a ngaisun no mihing thinpuite awng, kei hong ngai tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zaw natu ni, kong thengsak pal tu a — khuala nawn ngawl het tu hi. Zawna ka mualsuana kihaisaangsak ngawl tu hi. Jerusalem ka ngum tu a Israel te tua munah minphatna ka pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Babylon awng, na kumpi tokhum tung pan hong tuaksuk ta'n a, leivui sungah to in. Nang in khatvei lai in ngaknu thiangtho khat bang na hi a, a kizo ngeingawl khuapi khat bang na hi hi, ahihang nang sia moisua in na sa a neal nawn bua hi! Tu in nang sia sal khat na hi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An ngoaina suangpheak pei in! An ngoai in! Na lu tuamna dial suut in! Na puan pha silhte suut in! Luite kaantan tu in na nikboaite zepto in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na pumnguak na om sia mihingte in hong mu tu hi; a kiniamkhiak le a maizumin amate in nang hong mu tu hi. Keima in phu ka la tu a, kuama in hong khak zo ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian in eite hong suaktasak a — Ama min sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Babylon tungah, “Khuazing sungah thim dide in to khipkhep in; Amate in nang sia ngamte ii kumpinu hong ci nawn ngawl tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite tungah ka thin uuk hi; ka mi in ka tuat nawn bua hi: Nangma khut sungah amate kong aap a, amate na hesuak bua hi; Khanghaamte ngawngawn na vawtsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tawntungin kumpinu khat hi tu in na ki um a, hi thute na thinsung ah ngaisun ngawlin ahibuale a vekpi bangbang bo tu cisia na ngaisun bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Nopsakna bek dei in, muanhuai in bit a kisa sia awng, hi thu ngai in. Pathian za in lian na kisa hi — Nang taw a kibang kuama dang khat zongh om ngawl hi, na ci hi. Nangma in meingong nu ka suak ngei buatu hi, ahibuale ka tate thina bona a thuak ngei buatu hi ci in na ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang tawmvei no sung, ni khat thu in, thu hite ngeal piang tu hi. Mitbum pilna theampo na zak hang na pasal le na tate thi in na khuai sua veve tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Na phat ngawlnate sungah nangma le nangma na thin na muang a; kuama in hong mu thei buan te ci in ngaisun ni hi. Na ciimna le na pilna in nangma lam hong pialsak a, Nangma le nangma, ‘Keima in Pathian ka hi hi — kei bang a dang khat zongh om ngawl hi,’ na kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang tungah tuasiatna hong theng tu a, na mitbum thiamna in khak zo ngawl tu hi. Na mang zong na mat ngeingawl siatna — nang tungah thakhat thu in hong theng tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na no lai pek panin na zak na mitbum thiamna le na dei aite a vekpi in keamcing in. Tuate in nang hong hu thei tha tu hi; na ngalte na lauthawn thei tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngaisutna hong kipiak hangin vawt zawk na nei bua hi. Na aksi en theite — vantungte a khawk a khawkin khenin nang tungah bang thu piang tu ci in tha sim tha simin nang tungah ngaisutna hong pia na aksi en thiamte hong paisak ta'n a, amate in ngumsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Amate in taangphaw beknote taw kibang tu a, mei khat in kaanghtum tu hi! Amate le amate ngawngawn kihun zo ngawl tu uh a — amate meilum oai bang hi ngawlin meikuangte sia amate atu in sa lei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na khan tawntungin thu na dok aisaante in — nang atu a pha hong sepsak tu sia tuabang teng ma ahi hi. Amate in nang hong nusia siat tu a, amate san tek pai in, nang hong hun tu in kuama taang ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi thu ngai vun, Judah suan Israel mite awng: Note in Topa min taw kiciam in Israel te ii Pathian ka bia tu uh hi ci nu hi — ahizong na kam bek uh hi a, na ci takpi ahi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang a thiangtho khuapi ah a teang mite ka hi uh a, Israel te ii Pathian ahi Vaanglianbelpa Topa a suangte ka hi uh hi ci in, na kiphasak lalai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in Israel tungah, “Taanghlai pekin bang thu hong piang tu cisia ka sonkhol hi; tua zawkciang thakhat thu in ka piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na thinpui uh sia thik le taau bangin sak mama tu ci sia ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na milim uhte in hite piangsak hi na ci thei ngawl natu uh in, keima in taanghlai pek pan noma ii maisang thupiang tu te a pian ma in ka sonkhol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ka sonkhol sate theampo tu in taangtung zo hi; ka sonkhol thute maan hi ci in na laak tu uh bek ahi hi. Nidang in kong pualaak ngeingawl lai hong pai tu thuthakte, tu in kong son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu hun ciang bekin ka piansak hi a; nidangin hi bang piang ngeingawl hi. A piangsa hi thong le a vekpi in ka heaksa thu hi na ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note sia a tawntung ngual langpan ci in hong kihe ahikom note sia muan thei tu hi ngawl ci in kong he hi. Tua hu in hi thu na za ngei vet bua uh a, na nakheng sung uh ah hi kammal tum ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mihingte in ka min hong pok natu in ka thin uukna ka vei kenkon hi; kong suksiat ngawl natu in ka iip kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meikhuk sungah ngunnte a kisit bangma in note sia meisa thuakna sungah kong sit zo hi. Ahihang note sia bangma man nei ngawlin kong mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi bang ka vawt sia keima atu hi a — ka min hong kipaansak tu ka oai buatu hi, ahibuale minthanna sia kuama dang kihawm ngawlin keima atu bek hi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in, “Hong ngai tavun, kong sapsa Israel mite awng! Keima in a masabel le a khakbel Pathian, keima bek Pathian ka hi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leitung tawdapte sia ka khut taw ka vawt a, vantungte ka phalhkeak hi. Lei le van ka sap ciang, thakhat thu in hong pai in ka mai ah ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Note theampo kikhawm in ngai vun! Keima ii tealsa mipa in Babylon sim tu hi ci sia tua pathiante khat zongh in sonkhol thei ngawl uh hi; ama in keima dei bangin seam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in thu a son pa le ama a sam pa ka hi hi; Keima in ama lam ka pui a, ngalzawna ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tu in hong pai in ka kung hong neak tavun a, ka ci bang hong za tavun. A kipatciil a kipan a langh taakin thu ka son a, ka kammalte a tawntungin ka taangtungsak zo hi,” ci hi. (Tu in Vaanglianpipa Topa in a vaangletna kei hong pia zo a, kei hong sawl zo hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian, note hong ngum Topa in: “Keima in note Topa Pathian ka hi a, note phattuam natu hong hil nuam pa le na zui tu a kilawm lampi hong lak pa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kong thupiaknate ngai hi thong le uh te! a kang ngeingawl luamtui bangin thuphate note atu in luang tu hi. Tuipi vaal ah tuihualte bangin zawna na tung hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na suan na paalte senneal za in tam tu a, keima in amate a kisusia ngeingawl tu in ka vawt tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babylon pan pusuak in, suakta takin pai vun! lungdamna taw hi thuphate au in son vun; “ Topa in a naseampa Israel ngum zo hi!” ci in mun theampo ah thangsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in a mite sia a sa, a ko sennealngam sungah lampui in a pai lai in, a dangko ngawl uh hi. Amate atu in ama in suang sung pan tui phuulsak hi; ama in suang phaltham in, tui hong luang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mawneite atu in a bitna mun om ngawl hi,” Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngam khuala ah a teang minamte awng, ka thuson hong ngai tavun! Ka pian ma in, Topa in kei hong teal zo a, a naseam tu in kei hong seekhol zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in ka kammalte namsau bangin hiamsak hi. Ama ii khut taw kei hong sungsia hi. Ama in thaltang bangin kei hong vawt a, zaktawm thei tu in hong hiamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in ka tungah, “Israel awng, ka naseampa na hi hi; nangma hangin, mihingte in kei hong pok tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in, “Ka seam zo hi, ahihang lamet tu mama om ngawl hi! Ka thatang theampo zangh siat zo hi veang i, ahihang bangma ka taangtun bua hi,” ka ci hi. Tua hikale ka vai hong panpui tu in Topa ka muang thei veve hi; ama in ka sepna thaman hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka pian ma in Topa in nasep tu hong see hi; ama in keima sia a mite kaikhawm kik tu le, a kithethaang Israel mite kaikhawm kik tu in a naseampa hong suaksak hi. Topa in vaang hong pia hi; ama in ka thahatna bulpi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah, “Ka naseampa awng, nangma sep tu in nasep lian zaw khat ka nei hi, a suakta lai Israel mite a lian in lapto kik tu bek hi ngawlin, minamte tungah khuavak ahi tu zonghin nang kong vawt tu hi — tuabangin leitung theampo in ngupna a nga thei natu ahi hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kithusim ngawlhet pa, minamte ii etsat pa le ngamukte ii naseampa tungah Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian le ngumpa in hi bangin ci hi: “Kumpite in na suatak hong mu tu a, nang tungah zatakna lak tu in hong din tu uh hi; kumpi tate zonghin hong mu tu uh a, nangma mai ah zatakna taw hong kun tu uh hi,” ci hi. hi thu piang nanak tu hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in a naseampa teal zo hi; Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian in a kamciamnate keamcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in a mite tungah, “Note ngup tu hun hong thet ciang, maipha kong pia tu a, hu ngenin nong auna awte kong zo tu hi. Note kong cing kong keam tu a, note tungtawnin mite theampo taw thuciamna khat ka vawt tu hi. Tu laitakin a tulsa ngam sungah, note khatvei kong teangsak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in thongtaak mite tungah, ‘Suakta takin pai vun!’ ka ci tu a, khuazing sungah a omte tungah, ‘Khuavakna ah pusuak vun!’ ka ci tu hi. Amate sia mual tungah a taa tuute taw kibang tu uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amate ngilkial, dangtaak ngeingawl tu hi. Nisa le senneal sa in amate bangma tatsak ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate a itpa in lampui tu hi. Ama in amate sia ciktui ah paipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Keima in mualte kaantan in lampi lian khat ka vawt tu a, ka mite khualhaw natu in lam khat ka pua khol tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka mite sia ngam khualana, saksang le nitumna sang pan le thang sangah a om Aswan khuapi panin hong pai tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vantungte awng, lasa vun! Leitung awng, lungdam in au vun! Mualte lasa in au hen! Topa in a mite heeneam tu hi; ngimna a thuak a mite hesuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang Jerusalem mite in, “ Topa in eite hong nusia zo hi! Ama in eite hong mangil zo hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa in, “Numei khat in ama ii nausen mangil in ama ii hin le toai tasen it ngawlin om thei tu ziam? A nu in a tasen a mangil zezen tha hial zongin, keima in note kong mangil ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, nang kong mangil thei ngei bua hi! Ka khutza lamlai ah na min ka at zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Nang hong puua kik tu mite hong theng nai zo a, nang hong siatsuate tai tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na kiim na paam khuadak kawkoai in bang thupiang ziam en in! Na mite kikhawm uh a — inn ah hong cia uh hi! Keima in a nungta Pathian ka hi tatak bangma in, mothak khat in a kizepna suangmanpha a kiphatsak pui bangma in na mite hangin na kiphasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Na ngam sia lalcipin kinusia a — ahihang tu in tualai ah a teang tu hong pai mite atu in toi lei tu hi. A siacipin nang hong nusia mite in nang taw a kikhuala na ah kikhiin tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngamdang saltanna ah a piang na mite in ni khat ni ciang, na tungah, ‘Hi leitang toi lei hiat a — ih teen natu a zaizaw kisamh hing!’ hong ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaciang nangma le nangma, ‘Tano hite theampo kei atu in akua in piangsak ziam? Keima in ka tate bosua zo a ka nei thua zo nawn bua hi, keima saltaangin hong kinotkeak a — hi patangte akua in vaak thong ziam? Keima nguak hong kinusia a — hi patangte koisung pan hong pai hi thong ziam?’ nang le nang na kici tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in a mite tungah: “Keima in minamte tungah lim ka lak tu a, amate in na tate inn ah hong puak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kumpite sia no tungah pate bang hong hi tu hi; kumpinu te sia nute bang hong hi tu hi. Amate in na mai uh ah kun sukin hong upat tu uh hi; amate kiniamkhiakin note zatakna hong lak tu uh hi. Tuasia ciang Topa ka hina thu na he tu uh hi; keima ii hu tu a ngak peuma thin kiam ngawl tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngalkap khat ii sutol sa vanhte na la kik thei tu ziam? Zawthawk thu taw ngamuk pa khat ii matsa koltaangte na suatak thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in, “Hong piang tu thute sia tuabang keak ahi hi. Ngalkapte ii matsa thongtaakte kilaaksak tu a, zawthawk thu taw ngamuk pa ii sutol sate kimatsak tu hi. Nang hong do peuma ka sim tu a, na tate ka suatak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang hong zawthawk vawtte khat le khat ka kithatlumsak tu hi; amate mihing thalup nopna le thin uukna taw a thin uh so ngawp tu hi. Tuaciang mihing nam buppi in keima sia, nang hong ngumpa le hong suatak pa, Topa ka hina thu he tu uh hi. Amate in keima sia Israel te ii a vaanglian Pathian ka hina thu he tu uh hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Pasal khat in a zi a khul bangin keima in ka mite hawlkeak hong sa nu ziam? Tua ahile, zi khulna laite koisungah om ziam? Mihing khat in a tate sila in a zuak bangin, keima in note saltaang tu in zuak hong sa nu ziam? Hi ngawl hi, noma mawna hangin saltaang in a pai na hi uh a; noma khialna liante hangin hong kihawl khia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka mite hun tu kong pai ciang banghangin ka mite in hong awlmawk ngawl ziam? Ka sap ciang amate in banghang hong zo ngawl ziam? Amate a hun tu in keima thazawm lei ka hi ziam? A sungah a om ngasate tui kisamh in a thi natu sia ka thupiakna taw in tuipi tui ka kangsak thei a, ngunte sennealngam ka suaksak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thisate atu khuangai bang keakin, vantung sia ka zingsak thei hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in a ngim a toite ka thahatsak thei natu in ka pau tute hong hil zo hi. Ama ii hong hil tute ka ngai thei natu in zing simin ama in kei hong thalawpsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in thu tel theina kei hong pia zo a, keima in ama langpan ngawlin ka nungngat bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei hong saatte ka nungzaang ka ngat hi. Amate in kei hong selno zazaan a, ka khamulte hong phaisak in ka maitang hong cilphii ciangin ka ngat nginge hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang amate ii hong selnonate in kei bangma hong tatsak zo ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile Vaanglianpipa Topa in kei hong hu hi. Hong selnonate ka thuak tenton hi. Kei hong kimaimawlsak ngawl tu cisia ka he hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Pathian hong nai a, ama in ka maw ngawlna thu pualaak tu hi. Kei tungah akua in thu hong vawt ngam tu ziam? Thukhenzum ah pai tek tawng! Maw hong suan tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa mama in kei hong panpui a — tua hi le akua in kei sia mawnei hi ci in tetti lak thei tu ziam? Kei tungah thu hong vawtte theampo bomang tu hi; amate sia nget ii neak puan bangin bo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa zakta in, a naseampa thu a ni note theampo awng, na paina uh lampi zing tatak tha tu hi, ahihang Topa muangin, na Pathian uh suang vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngualdangte lalcipsak tu a sawm note theampo sia noma ii sawmnate in noma hong lalcipsak tu uh hi. Topa ama mama in hi thu piangsak tu hi; thinngim lungmanna na thuak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Ngup tu dei a, kei kungah hu ngen tu in hong pai note awng, ka thuson hong ngai tavun. Nong paina uh suangpi, hong kitaw na suangkhuk sia ngaisun vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na taanghpupi Abraham le note pianna Sarah ngaisun vun. Abraham ka sap lai in, ama in ta sel hi, Ahihang keima in ama thupha ka pia a, tate ka pia hi; Ama ii suan le paalte ka pungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Keima in a lalsa Jerusalem ah a teangte theampo ka hesuak tu hi. Ama ii ngam sia sennealngam ahihang Eden huan taw kibangin, huan khat ka suaksak tu hi, Tualai ah lungdamna le thinnopna om tu a, kei tungah lungdam hong ko in pokna la hong sak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka mite awng, hong ngai tavun, ka thusonte ngai vun: Minamte tungah thu ka hil hi; keima thukhamte in amate tungah khuavak puak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima manlangin kong pai tu a, amate ka ngum tu hi; ka ngalzawna tu hun hong nai zo hi. Keima in minamte ka uk tu hi. A khuala na ah a om ngamte in ka pai tu hong ngak hi; amate in ka ngup tu lametna taw hong ngak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vantungte ento vun; leitung en vun! Vantungte sia meikhu bangin mang vadi tu hi; leitung sia puan lui taw kibangin paat vadil tu a, a mite theampo sia tho bangin thi tu uh hi. Ahihang keima ii ngupkhiatna ka piak sia kip tawntung tu hi; ka ngalzawna sia a tawntung atu ahi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Thumaanna he in, na thinsung uh ah keima thuhilna a vom mite awng, ka thu hong ngai tavun. Mite in hong selno in hong lan ciangin lau heak vun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />amate sia ngetlungte ii neak puan bangin mang vadi tu uh hi! Ahihang kong paipui ngupkhiatna sia kip tawntung tu hi; ka ngalzawna sia a tawntungin kho tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khanglo in, Topa awng, ko hong hu ta'n! Na vaangletna zanghin ko hong ngum ta'n; taanghlai hun a na zak ngei bangma in zangh in. Tuipi ngulpui Rahab saatin a neensem pa sia nangma na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na hutsa mite in tui a kaantan thei natu in, tui kaantanna lampi khat vawt a, tuipi a kangsak sia zongh nangma na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na suataksak mite lungdamin thinnopna taw au a, lasa in Jerusalem theng tu uh hi. Amate a tawntungin heena khuangaina taw kipealin lungdam tawntung tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in, “Keima in nang hong thahatsak pa ka hi hi. Banghang lopa sangin ngei a nungta ngawl zaw, a thithei mihing kiita tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note hong piangsak, vantungte a phalhkeak, leitung ii tawdapte a pha Topa mangil zo nu ziam? No hong zothawte ii thin uukna le no hong siasak nuamte, banghang kiita tawntungin nungta tu nu ziam? Amate thin uukna in note bangma hong thutha thei nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thongtaakte sia kisuatak pal tu hi; amate khansau in, nungta in an neak tu a kicing nei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Keima in Topa na Pathian ka hi hi; tuipi saukeak in a tuihualte ka hawksak hi. Keima min sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima in vantungte ka phalhkeak a, lei ii tawdapte ka pha hi; Jerusalem tungah, ‘Nang in keima mihing na hi hi! Nang tungah thu kong hil zo a, ka khut taw nang kong dal hi,’ ka ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, khanglo in! Nangma le nangma kiphong in tho in! Topa ii a thin uukna taw hong piak daan piakna hai na dawn zo hi; na taalsuk zo a, nang hong hoisak vatut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang lam hong pui tu kuama om ngawl a, na mite sungah na khut pan nang hong kai tu kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang tungah tuasiatna a thuapin hong tung zo hi: na ngam sia ngal in siasak zo a, na mite pukthi zo hi. No, hesuakna hong lak tu kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lamking theampo ah na mite thazawm in puk uh a; amate sia savaipa thaang sungah sangai awk taw kibang hi. Amate in Pathian ii thin uuk tutna thuak zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zukham bangkeakin a hoi vatut ngimna a thuak no, Jerusalem mite awng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa na Pathian uh in no hong sungsia a tuaciang, “Ka thin uukna taw kong piak hai sia ka la kik hi. No hong hoisak vatut sapittui sia na ne nawn buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua hai sia, no hong nengcipte, note lampi tungah hong sial a ninteak bangin hong siikcipte tungah ka pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, thahat in a, lian kik in! Pathian ii a thiangtho khuapi awng, puan et hoi silh in! Pathian um ngawl mite na kongpite sungah tum kik ngei nawn ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, nangma le nangma kisuaktasak in! Leivui sung pan thoto in a, na kumpi tokhum tungah to in! A kiman Zion mite awng, no hong khiina thikkhaute suut vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in a mite tungah, “Sal na tan uh lai, no atu in sum hong kipiaksak ngawl hi; tuasia bangma in no hong kisuatak natu in bangma hong kipiaksak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Egypt ngam sungah ngamdangmite bangin a teang tu in na pai uh lai in, noma uk thu in na pai uh hi; ahitazong, Assyria te in zawthawk thu taw no hong lakeak a, no atu in bangma hong pia ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu in Babylon ah tuabang ma in piang hi: note sia ngalmatte na hi uh a, no atu in bangma hong kipia ngawl hi. No hong ukte kiphasak, kihisak in kei hong melsia tawntung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khatvei ciangin note tungah thu hong sonpa, keima Pathian ka hina thu na tel tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mualte kaantan in thupha, kilemna thu puak a hong pai kamtaipa khat ih mu tu sia lamdang lawlawm hi! Ama in ngalzawna thangsak a, Zion tungah, “Na Pathian sia kumpi ahi hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuapi a cingte au uh a, lungdam in au khawm tek uh hi! Zion ah Topa hong heak kik sia amate in a mit tek taw mu thei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kisia Jerusalem awng, lungdam in au keak vun! Topa in a khuapi suatak tu a, a mite heeneam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in ama ii a thiangtho vaangletna zangh tu hi; ama in a mite ngum tu a, leitung theampo in mu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Biakinn vanh a pua note theampo awng, Babylon nusia vun. A kikhaam vanhte thutha heak vun; a thiangtho in om vun a, tuaciang nusia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tutung sia manlang bingbung in nusiat kul ngawl tu hi; suatak tu hanciam ngawl tu nu hi. Topa na Pathian in note lam hong pui tu a, na kiim na paam uh pan hong dal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka naseampa in ama ii nasepna zo tu hi; ama sia nasia takin kipatoai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihing tam mama in ama a mu uh ciang lamdang sa leih uh hi; ama sia mihing taw kibang ngawl za dongin a mealhem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang tu in minam tam mama in ama lamdang sa tu uh a, kumpite sia lamdang sa in pau thei ngawl liang tu uh hi. A heak ngeingawl na pawlkhat amate in mu in tel tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihingte in, “Tu a ih thupuak sia akua in um thei tu ziam? Hi thu sungah Topa ii khut akua in mu thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leingum sungah zung a tha thingkung no khat bangin ama ii naseampa a khanto sia Topa deina ahi hi. Ama ih thusim tu in zatakhuaina ahibuale mealhoina nei ngawl hi. Ih thinbot natu ngaibanna bangma nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama ih zawngsak a, ih nial hi; ama, natna ngimna thuak hi. Ama sia kuama in en beak ngawlin — bangma ahi ngawl bang keakin bangma in ih heang bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ahihang ama in ei ii ih thuak tu natna teng thuakin, ih ngim natu teng pua hi. Tua kimlai in ama thuakna sia Pathian ii daan piak hi ci in ih ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang eite ii mawna khialnate hangin ama liamna thuak a, ih siatna hangin vuakna thuak ahi hi. Ama ii daan thuakna taw eite ih dam a, ama ii vuak a thuakna liammate hangin eite ih ciidam thiang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eite ih vekpi in a mangthang tuute taw ih kibang a, eima uukna san tek ah ih pai hi. Ahihang eite theampo ii thuak tu a kilawm daan thuakna sia ama ii tungah Topa in suan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ama sia nasia tak kivawtsia a, ahihang kiniamkhiakna taw thuak hi; kam khat zongh huthe ngeingawl hi. Ngaw tu bekin a om tuuno khat bang le a mul meet tu bekin a kikoi tuu khat bangin, ama in kam khat beak pau ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama sia kimanin thina thuak tu in thu kikhen a, kipaipui hi, ama tung a piang tu thu sia kuama in awlmawk ngawl hi. Ih mite ii mawna khialnate hu in ama sia thina thuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in leilot thu khat zongh son ngeingawlin, ahibuale khialna khat zongh vawt ngeingawl hi napi, mi seksolte taw thaan sungah kisial khawmin, sumhaute taw kiphum khawm hi,” ci in zo kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in, “Hi bang a thuak natu sia keima deina ahi hi; a thina sia mawna maisak natu in biakpiakna ahi hi. Tua ahiciang ama in a suan le a paalte mu tu hi; Ama a khansau in, ama tungtawnin ka tupna taangtung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A khan sungah natna ngimna a thuak zawkciang, ama in lungdamna nga kik tu hi; a thuakna a luithawthong ahi ngawl sia ama in he tu hi, Ama sia a thumaan keima naseampa hi a ka lung hong kimsak pa hi. Ama in mihing tam mama ii thuak tu daan piakna sia thuak tu a, ama thuakna hangin amate mawna ka maisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahiciang ama sia milian le a vaanglian mite sungah upatna dinmun kipia tu hi. Ama in lungkim takin a nuntakna pia a, mihing siate thuak bangin thuak hi. Ama in mimaw mikhial tam mamate ii dinmun la a, amate ii mawna khialna a kimaisak natu in thungetsak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, nang in tasel numei khat bang na hi zo a, ahihang tu in lungdam in lasa in na au thei hi. A pasal taw a kop tawntung nupi khat sangin tu in nang in ta tam na nei zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na teenna puanbuk khan in; a khau sausak in khetphinte khen kip in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ngamkiim theampo ah na ngamngite na keak tu hi; tu laitak a minam dangte ii lua, na ngam sia na mite in la kik tu hi. Tu laitak a, a kinusia khuapite sia mihing taw kidim kiksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lau heak in — na mai hong kimawlsak kik ngawl tu hi; hong kizawngsak ngawl tu hi. A khangmoi zi khat bangin na thumaan ngawlna le, meingong khat bangin, thinkiam a na lunglen mamana te na mangil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma hong bitphuapa in na pasal bang hong hi tu a — ama min sia Vaanglianbelpa Topa ahi hi. Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian in nang hong ngum tu a — ama in leitung theampo a ukpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel awng, nang sia a pasal ii taisat thinngim mama in a om zimoi khat taw na kibang hi. Ahihang Topa in ama kungah nang hong sam kik a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tawmvei no sung nang kong nusia hi; itna lian taw kong pui kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thin uuk hu in tawmvei no sung kong nungngat a, ahihang a tawntungin nang kong itna kong lak tu hi,” hong ci hi. Nang hong ngum Topa in tuabangin ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Leitung ah tuipi liim kik nawn ngawl tu hi ci in Noah hun lai in kong kamciam hi. Na tungah hong thin uuk kik ngawl tu khi hi ci in tu in kong kamciam hi; nang kong teih buatu a daan kong pia buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mualliante le mualnote a cimh ta zongin, nang kong itna bo ngeingawl tu hi; thinnop natu kong kamciam sia ka len tawntung tu hi,” hong ci hi. Nang hong it Topa in tuabangin ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in, “Nang hong heeneam tu om ngawl, ngimna a thuak, a hu tu om ngawl khuapi, Jerusalem awng, na tawdapphate suangmanpha taw ka ciang kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na tausaangte suangmanpha san taw, na kongpite mei bang a taang suangmanpha taw, na kulh theampo suang manpha taw ka vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Keima mama in na mite ka hil tu a, nopsakna le kilemna ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thutang le thumaan in na tha hong khosak tu hi. Zawthawk vawtna le launa, patauna taw na kipeal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khat po in nang hong sim le, kei thukimna om ngawlin hong sim hi a; nang hong do pawpo puk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Meikhuk vawtin, ngalhiamte a piangsak thikseakpa ka bitphua hi. Ngual thalup natu in hiamhte a zangh ngalkap pa zongh ka bitphua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang ngalhiam khat zongh in nang bangma hong law zo ngawl tu hi; nang hong mawsiatte theampo na zo kik natu na he tu hi. Ka naseamte ka panpui tu a, zawna ka pia tu hi,” ci hi. Topa in ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “A dangko theampo awng, hong pai tavun — hi lai ah tui om hi! Hong pai tavun, no sum nei ngawlte awng — an lei vun a ne vun! Hong pai tavun! sapittui le khuinoai lei vun — nang atu bangma man ngawl tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Banghangin ngilva dangva na ngawl po in sum zangh thawthong nu ziam? Banghangin na thalaw sa sumte zangh napi ngilkial lalai nu ziam? Hong ngai tavun a, kong ci bangin seam vun, tua hile an limbel na ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tu in ngai vun, ka mite awng, ka kungah hong pai tavun; ka kungah hong pai tavun tua hile nuntakna na nga tu uh hi! Note taw thuciamna kho khat ka vawt tu a, David tungah ka kamciamsa thuphate kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in ama sia minamte lampui le a ukpa khatin ka koi a, ama tungtawnin mihonpite tungah ka vaangletna ka lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu in note in ngamdang minamte na sam tu uh hi; khatvei lai in amate in note hong he ngawl uh hi, ahihang tu in note taw kikop tu in hong tai tu uh hi! Keima, Topa na Pathian, Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian in, hi te theampo ka piangsak tu a; minthanna le upatna note kong pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu in Topa hong nai ahiciang, ama kung zuan vun a, ama tungah thungen vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi seksolte in amate ii nuntakna zia nusia tahen a, a ngaisutna zia kheal tahen. Topa ih Pathian kungah amate in zuan tahen; Topa in hong hesuak thei a, mawna hong maisak papai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka ngaisutnate note ii ngaisutna taw kibang ngawl a, ka paiziate note ii paizia taw kilamdang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leitung panin vantungte a saan za in, keima paizia le ka ngaisut ziate sia no ii paizia le no ii ngaisutna ziate sangin saang zaw pek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ka kammal sia leitung tuibuak tu in van pan hong taaksuk vuuk le nguatui taw kibang hi. Tuate in ankungte khangtosakin ciin tu anciite le neak tu an piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima pau kammal sia zongh tuabang ma hi tu a — sep tu a ka ngealna bangin taangtung a; ka sawl teng theampo seam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Lungdamna taw Babylon na nusia tu uh hi; kilemna taw khuapi pan hong kipaipui tu hi. Mualliante le mualnote in lasa tu uh a, thingkungte lungdam in au tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu laitakin lingte omna munah cypress kungte po tu hi; lingkungte luangin myrtle kungte poto tu hi. Tua in a tawntung a kho tu lim khat hi tu a, Keima Topa ii sep sate hong phawk kiksak khat hi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in a mihingte tungah, “Khuangei ngawlin note hong ngum tu ka hikom, a thumaan le a thutang sia seam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sabbath tang tawntungin a zangh khial ngawl mite thupha ka pia tu hi. A sia bangma a ngamta ngawlte thupha ka pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian ii mite taw a kikop sa ngamdangmi khat in, “ Topa in kei sia ama ii mite taw Pathian hong biakhawmsak ngawl tu hi,” ci heak hen. A kingetsa pa khat in ta nei thei ngawl tu ahikom, Pathian ii mite sungah a kihel thei ngawl tu ci in ngaisun ngei heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in tuabang a ngaisun pa tungah, “Sabbath na tanna taw kei nong zatak vawt a, ka thuciamna sia thumaan tak lenin kei nong lungdamsak le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka Biakinnpi sung le ka mihingte sungah na min sia tanute tapate na neina taw teptee tu sangin khuangei kiciamtee zaw tu hi. Nang hong kimangil ngei nawn ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in ama mihingte sungah a kihel, ama it in a na a seam, Sabbath tang a, ama ii thuciamna kip takin a len ngamdangmite tungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Biakna taw kisai ka mual thiangtho Zion ah kong paipui tu a, ka thungetna inn sungah kong thinnuamsak tu hi, ka biaknatau tungah nong piak biakpiaknate kong saang tu hi. Ka Biakinnpi sia minam theampo atu in thungetna inn kici tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngamdang a saltanna pan ama mihing Israel te inn ah a ciapui pa, Vaanglianpipa Topa in, amate taw kikop tu in midangte kong paipui lai tu hi ci in kamciam pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in ngamdang minamte tungah ngamsa bangin hong pai in ama mite a neaktum natu in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in, “Ka mite kidop natu thupia tu in, a kingaisun lampuite theampo, a mittaw siat uh hi! Amate in bangma he ngawl uh hi. Amate sia ngual a nak ngawl, inncing uite taw kibang a, lulumin mangman bek uh hi. Amate in mumut ma nuamsa uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate sia a deiza a nga ngeingawl, a duhop uite taw kibang uh hi. Hi lampuite in telthiamna bangma nei ngawl uh hi. Amate uuk bang tekin ngamta in a phattuam natu tek zong uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi sapittui khamte in, ‘Sapittui tawm la sin tawng i, tuaciang ih dawn zawkza dawn tawng! Tuni sangin zing ciang nuam zaw kan tu hi!’ ci uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Miphate thi a, kuama in tua thu tel ngawlin, ngaisut zongin nei ngawl uh hi. Ahihang amate a thi uh ciang, khuangai tuasiatna lian bangma in amate nasak thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngamtat pha in a nungtate in a thi uh ciang thinnopna le tawlngakna mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />No, mimawte awng, thu khenna thuak tu in hi munah hong pai tavun! Note in aisaante, nupa kipalngulte, le pumpi zuak numeite sangin na phazaw tuan bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note in akua ciammui zazaan nu ziam? No, leilot mite in akua selno nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ta hong hausak pathiante ka bia uh hi ci in, tua thingkung thiangthote nuai ah numei le pa khialna na vawt uh hi. Luitui luanna hui ah a om suang hawngte sungah na tanote biakpiakna in na pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua mun panin suangnealte la in pathiante bangin na bia uh hi. Biakpiakna in amate tungah sapittui na buak uh a antang na puak uh hi. Hi bang teng theampo diksa tu in nong um uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mual saangte tungah biakpiakna pia tu le numei le pa khialna vawt tu in na pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na inn mai kongkha sung sangah a mu thada huai na milimte na koi uh hi. Noma in kei nong nusia uh hi; na puante suutin sum taw na thapsa na deite uh taw lumkhawm tu in na lupna zai tung na zuan uh hi. Tuabangin tua munah na pumpi deina ah na lungkim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note in paaknamtui le sathaute kinoai in Molech pathian bia tu in na pai uh hi. Biak tu pathiante a zong tu in mun theampo, mithi khua ngawngawn ah kamtaite na paisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua pathian dangte na zonna uh in na toi uh a, ahizong na tawp thong ngei bua uh hi. A mu thada huai na milimte uh in thahatna hong pia ci in ngaisun na hikom na tha a zawm ngei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in, “Kei nong theam a, kei nong makngil cip natu uh in note hong lausak, tua pathiante sia a kuate ziam? Khuangei hial ka thim om hithiat manin kei hong zakta nawn ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na sep na vawt uh sia a maanin na ngaisun uh hi, ahihang na ngamtatna ka pholaak tu a, tuasia ciang na milimte in nang hong hu zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huna ngen a na au ciang, tua na milimte in nang hong hun tahen! Vuimut khat in amate seamkeak tu hi! Ahihang kei hong muangte sia tua leitang tungah teang tu a, ka Biakinnpi sungah kei hong bia tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka mite ka kungah hong heakkik tahen. Amate lampi a nokkhaksak theampo khiin vun! Lam ziik vun a, zak vahial thei tu in koi vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Keima in a saang le a thiangtho, a tawntung a nungta Pathian ka hi hi. Keima in a saang le a thiangtho na munah ka teang hi, ahihang mite ii hong muanna le lametna a nga kik thei natu in mawna kisiik kik a, a kiniamkhiak vadeam mite taw zongh in ka teang khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima in ka mite nuntakna ka pia a, amate mawsiat tawntung ngawlin, amate tungah a tawntungin ka thin uuk ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate ii mawna le duhopna hu in amate tungah ka thin uuk hi, tua hu in amate daan pia in ka nusia hi. Ahihang amate a thin uh pui in a ngamtat ngei bangin ngamta veve uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Amate ngamtatnate ka mu zo hi, ahihang amate ka damsak tu hi. Amate lampui in hu in, a hee a kapte ka heeneam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A naina le a khuala na ah a omte theampo tungah, thinnopna ka pia hi! Ka mihingte ka damsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang mi ngilote sia a kilok tawntung, a tuihualte ii buan le nin a paipui, a thim ngeingawl tuipi taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mawneite atu in ngammuanna om ngawl hi,” Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “A nging theiza in au vun! Israel ka mite tungah a mawna a khialnate son vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in ka pai ziate heak tu le ka thukhamte zui tu sia ka lawp uh ci in ni simin kei hong bia uh hi. Amate in kei hong biak sia nuamsa a, tuaciang a maan thukhamte ka piasak nuam uh hi ci hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mite in, “ Topa in hong phawk ngeingawl ahile eite in banghangin an tang tu hi ziam? Ama in hong awlmawk ngawl ahile banghangin eite in an ne ngawlin om tu hi ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi. Topa in amate tungah, “A maan tak ci leang an na tan kawmin noma aituam phattuam natu te na del uh a, na naseamte na zawthawk vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na an tanna in nang hong ngoltolsak a, ngual taw kihau in hong kibuansak hi. Hi bang an tannate nam taw nong thungetnate ngai tu in nong um uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An na tan ciang noma le noma ngim kipia na hi uh hi; lopate bangin na lu na kunsuk uh a, na lup natu in khau-ip puan le vutte na pha uh hi. Tua sia an tang na ci uh sia ahi ziam? Tuasia taw lungkim tu in nong um uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Kei dei an tanna sia hi bang ahi hi: zawthawkna thikkolte le thukhaikim ngawl a kivawtna hakkolte suutin, zawthawk vawt a thuakte suataksakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngilkialte na an uh hawm vun a, inn nei ngawl mizawngte atu in na inn uh hon vun. Puan silh tu a nei ngawl mite puan pia vun a, na beete na hu thada heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Kong deisakna sia zing ni bangin na tungah hong taang tu a, na liamna mate dam pal tu hi. Note hong ngum tu in note taw kong omkhawm tawntung tu hi; keima hong om in na kiim na paam theampo panin kong dal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thu na nget uh ciang, kong zo tu hi. Nong sam uh ciang kong zo kik tu hi. “Ngual na zawthawk vawtna, ngual na zawnsaknate le kam sia na paunate theampo na kheal uh le;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ngilkialte an pia in, kitaangsapna a nei mite na lungkimsak uh le; na kiimkot uh a khuazing sia sun khuavak a suak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaciang note lam kong pui tawntung tu a, naphate taw kong lungkimsak tu hi. A ciidam a thahatin kong koi tu hi. Tui tam a nga huan khat, a kang ngeingawl ciktui khat taw na kibang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Taanghlai pekin a siate na mite in sa kik tu a, a tawdappha luite tungah sa kik tu uh hi. Note sia khua uumna pangte a sa kik, inn sia sate a puua kik mihingte hong kici tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in, “Sabbath sia thiangthosakin tua ni in noma meet natu bek zong ngawlin; ka ni thiangtho ni sia man neisakin, khualhaw ngawl, naseam ngawl ahibuale tua ni in kam mannung ngawl pau ngawlin na omna taw zatakna na pia uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />keima na, na sepna uh panin hong pai lungdamna na nga tu uh hi. Leitung mun theampo ah hong ki upat tu in kong vawt tu a, na taanghpupi Jacob tungah ka piak leitang sia lungdam nuamsa in na lua tu uh hi. Topa , keima in ka son zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa sia note hong ngum tu in thaneam leih in, huna na ngetna aw za tu in nangong leih tu in ngaisun heak vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na mawna na khialnate uh hangin ama in hong za ngawl ahi hi. Pathian bia tu na hanciam uh ciang Pathian taw hong khentan sia na mawnate uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note in leilot thu sonna, thazaw suanna, le mihing thana taw na maw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thukhenzum ah na kaa uh hangin note sang pan thumaanna na nei bua uh hi. Thu na zaw natu in leilot thu na suang uh hi. Ngualdang nat natu na tup uh bang na seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A sia vawt tu na sawmnate sia nguu nei ngulpui khat ii tuuite bang ahi hi. A tuui khat sutham lete ngul khat pusuak hi! Ahihang a sia na tup na sawmte in nang tungah phattuamna hong pia ngawl tu hi — tuate sia momkhau taw a kitak puan bangin a luithawthong hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A sia vawt tu na tum tawntung uh a, tuasia vawt tu kaal na ngakla thei uh hi. Khialna mawna nei ngawl mite thalup tu na haisaang ngei bua uh hi. Na paina pawpo uh a sia a lalin na nusia uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />note omna po ah kuama ngammuang ngawl hi. Na sep theampo uh maan ngawl hi. Note in lamkoai khat na zui uh a, tua lampi a zuite kuama thin muang ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihingte in, “Ei hong zawthawk vawtte khut sung panin Pathian in banghangin hong ngum ngawl ziam ci thu tu in ih he hi. Eite, lam ih pai natu in khuavak ih lam en hi, ahihang khuazing bekma om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mittawte bangin ih zawt kawkoai hi. Eima in suntang takpi in zan bang keak le, mithi khua, khuazing sung om bang keakin ih lutu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eite lauthawngin ih thinngim hi. Zawthawk vawtna pan le ahi ngawlin hong kivawtna pan hong ngum tu in Pathian ih thangai a, ahihang bangma piang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“ Topa awng, nang tungah khialna lian kong vawt uh tam mama hi. Ko ii mawna khialnate in kote hong kawk hi. Tuate pha takin ka he siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang kong langpan uh a, hong nialin, na nung kong zui bua uh hi. Midangte zawthawk vawtin nang kung pan lam ka pial uh hi. Ka ngaisutnate uh khial hi; ka thu son uhte leilot thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thukhaikimna kinilkeak a, a maan thu in hong neak thei ngawl hi. Thumaan thutak in mihon kikhopna sungah lutu a, thumaanna in tua munah om natu mun nga zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thumaanna tawm leilam ahikom a sia a vawt nawn ngawlte in ngual ii vawtsiatna lian thuak hi,” ci uh hi. Topa in hi thu mu zo a, thukhaikimna om ngawl ahikom a lungkim ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zawthawk vawtna a thuak mite a hu tu in mihing khat beak zong om ngawl a mu ciang Topa in lamdang sa hi. Tua ahikom amate suatak tu le ngalzawna nga natu in ama in a vaangletna zangh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in thukhaikimna sia ngaldalna thik laktong puasilh bangin silh tu a, ngupna vaangletna sia thik lukhu bangin khu tu hi. Ngimna a thuak mite luangin phulaakna le daan piakna, a pha ngawlte a pha vawt nopna thinsung sia, puan bangin silh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in a ngalte sia a khuala na ngam ah a teangte ngawngawn a ngamtatna taw kizui in daan pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni suana pan nitumna dongah a teang mite theampo in ama le a vaangletna lian sia kiita tu uh hi. Ama in nguntui pawm bang le, vuipi bangin hong pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in a mite tungah, “Keima in note hong dal tu le mawna khialnate pan a kisiik note theampo ngum tu in, Jerusalem ah kong pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Note taw thuciamna khat ka vawt hi: ka vaangletna le ka thuhilnate a tawntung atu in note kong pia zo hi, tu pan kipan note in ka thu nong ni tu uh a, na tate le na suan na paalte in a tawntungin ka thu hong nit natu uh in na hil tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tho in, Jerusalem awng, ni bangin taang in; Topa vaangletna sia na tungah taang hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minam dangte sia khuazing in tuamcip tu a, Ahihang Topa khuavak sia na tungah taang tu hi; Ama ompuina ii taanna sia nang taw omkhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Minamte sia nangma khuavak sungah hong zuan tu a, kumpite sia nangma ii ni thak khuavak hong zuan tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bang thu piang ziam na kiim na paam en in: Inn ah hong cia tu in na mite kikhawm uh hi! Na tapate uh mun khuala pan hong cia tu uh hi; Na tanute sia patangnote bangin kitoai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi thu mu in thinnopna taw na kidim tu hi; Na lungdam leilamin na liing tu hi. Minamte ii haunate nang kungah hong kipuak tu a; tuipi ngal panin amate ii haunate hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Midian le Ephah panin, kalaoh vanhpua honpite hong pai tu hi. Amate sia Sheba panin hong pai tu a, Khamh le ngimnamtui hong paipui tu hi. Mihingte in Topa sep sa thuphate son tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kedar le Nebaioth te ii tuute theampo biakpiakna in nang kungah hong kipuak tu a, Topa lungkim natu in biaknatau tungah kipia tu hi. Topa in a Biakinnpi sia minthangsak seseam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vakhute a ngil a zot bangin Meeikaai bangin hong pai vanawm teambawte sia bang teambawte ahi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua teambawte sia ngam khuala na pan hong pai hi a, Pathian ii mite inn ah hong ciapui ahi hi. Minam theampo in ama mite a zaktasak Israel te ii a thiangtho Pathian Topa ii min patoai natu in, amate in ngunn le khamh hong paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Jerusalem tungah, “Ngamdangmite in na luphungte ciang kik tu a, A kumpite in nangma na seam tu uh hi. Ka thin uukin nang daan kong pia a, Ahihang tu in ka maipha le kong hesuakna nang kong lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minamte ii kumpite in amate ii haunate nang kungah hong paipui thei natu in, na kongpite sun le zan in kihong tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang nangma na a seam ngawl minamte sia kilalcipsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ka Biakinnpi mealhoisak natu, ka khuapi minthansak natu, Lebanon taamthing sung panin a phabel thing ahi, taakthing, juniper le cypress te sia Nang, Jerusalem khua a kisak kik natu in hong kipuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang hong zawthawk vawt mite ii tapate hong pai tu a, Nang zatakna hong lak tu in kun tu hi. Khatvei lai in nang hong nomu theampo sia na peang ah bokin hong bia tu uh hi. Amate in nang sia, ‘ Topa ii Khuapi,’ ‘Zion, Israel ii A thiangtho Pathian ii Khuapi,’ hong ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Nang sia hong kinusia nawn ngawl, hong ki ensan nawn ngawl tu a, A kinusia khuapi le a ngamkhing khuapi na hi nawn buatu hi. Keima in nang sia a lian le a mealhoi in kong vawt tu a, A tawntung, a tawntungin lungdamna munin kong vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nu in a tasen a op bangma in Minamte le kumpite in nang hong keam cing tu hi. Topa ahi Keima in nang kong ngum zo a, Israel ii a vaanglian Pathian in Nang hong suataksakna thute na he tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Keima in, taau luangin khamh, Thik le thing luangin ngunn le taau, Suang luangin thik kong puak tu hi. Nang hong ukte in nang hong zawthawk vawt nawn ngawl tu hi; Thukhaikim thu le kilemna taw amate in kong uksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thazaw suangin kizawthawkna awte kiza nawn ngawl tu hi; Suksiatna in na ngam hong siasak kik nawn ngawl tu hi. Luphung khat bangin nang kong dal, kong pao tu hi; Nang hong ngum zo ka hikom nong pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sun hunin ni in na khuavak hi nawn ngawl tu a, Zan hunin tha zongh na khuavak hi nawn ngawl tu hi; Keima Topa sia a tawntung na khuavak ka hi tu hi; Ka vaangletna khuavak sia nang tungah taang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na hee, na khuangaina nite bo tu hi. Keima Topa sia a tawntung na khuavak ka hi tu a, Ni le tha sangin ngei khozaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na mite theampo in a maan seam tu a A tawntungin tua ngam lua tu hi. A theampo tungah ka letna a pualaak tu in tuate ka suan a, ka vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na minam sung pan a nobel le a kiniamkhiakbel Na innkuan ngawngawn zongh a thahat minam khat bangin lian tu hi. A hun cin ciang keima in hi thu a manlangin ka piangsak tu hi. Keima in Topa ka hi hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in a Thaa taw kei hong dim zo hi. Mizawngte tungah lungdamna thupha puak tu, Thin kitamhthamte a damsak tu, A kimante suatakna thu le Thong sungah a kikhumte suatakna thu taangko tu in Ama in kei hong teal zo a hong puak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in a mite a ngup tu hun le A ngalte a zaw tu hun hong theng zo hi ci sia Thangsak tu in kei hong sawl zo hi. A he a khuangaite theampo heeneam tu in ama in kei hong sawl zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zion ah a om a khuangai mite tungah Heena luangin thinnopna le lungdamna, khuangaina luangin pokna la khat puak tu in kei hong paisak hi. Amate sia Topa mama ii suan sa Thingkungte taw kibang tu hi. Amate theampo in a maan sia seam tu uh a, Pathian sia ama ii sepnate hu in kipok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in khuangeipi ma a lalsa in a om khuapite sa kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka mite awng, ngamdangmite in na na hong sepsak tu uh hi. Amate in na tuu honte cingin, Na lo uh tho in na sapithuante cing tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note sia Topa ii thiampite, Ih Pathian ii naseamte hong kici tu hi. Note in minamte haunate na nopsak pui tu uh a, Note in amate ii hauna sia noma hauna ahikomin Na kiphatsak pui tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na maizumna uh le na min daina uhte bo tu hi. Note in noma leitangh tungah na teang tu uh a, Na haunate uh a zaa nii in khangto a; na lungdamna uh kip tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in, “Thukhaikim ka dei a, kizawthawkna le khialna lian ka huatsa hi. Ka mite thaman thumaan takin ka pia tu a, Tawntung thuciamna khat amate taw ka vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate sia minamte sungah minthang tu uh hi; Amate a mu theampo in Amate sia keima ii thupha ka piaksa minam khat ahi hunlam he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa sepna hangin Jerusalem lungdam hi. Jerusalem sia mothak khat pasal a nei ni in a kizeam bang ahi hi. Pathian in ama sia ngupna le ngalzawna taw tuam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anciite po in a meento bang tatak ma in Vaanglianpipa Topa in a mite ngum tu a, Minamte theampo in ama pok tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem hanthawn tu in ka son khe tu hi; Ama a kingup mateng le, Ama ii ngalzawna in zan a meisip khat det bangin a taan mateng ka thim om buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, minamte in na ngalzawna hong mu tu uh hi! A kumpite theampo in na vaangletna mu tu uh hi. Nang sia Topa ama vateak ii hong piak min thak khat taw hong kisam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang sia Topa atu a hoi kumpilukhu khat taw na kibang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang sia, “A kinusia” hong kici nawn ngawl tu a, Tuaciang, na ngam sia, “A kitaisan Zi” kici nawn ngawl tu hi. Na min thak sia, “Pathian sia Ama taw Lungdam hi,” kici tu hi. Na ngam sia, “Lungdam takin Kiteenpui” kici tu hi, Banghang ziam cile Topa sia nangma taw lungkimin Topa sia na ngam atu in a pasal bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tangval khat in ngaknu thiangtho khat mo in a pui bangma Nang hong vawt Ama in nang hong teenpui tu hi. Zi nei tu pa in a zi tu sia dik a sak bangma in, Na Pathian in nangma zongh dik hong sa tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, na luphungte tungah ngalvilte ka koi zo hi; amate sia sun zong zan zong thimdide ngeingawl het tu hi. Topa ii kamciamnate amate in Topa phawksak nanak tu a, Tuaciang mangilsak ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in Jerusalem khua a puuaphat kik mateng le, Leitung bup ii pok khuapi khat a suasak kik mateng, amate in Topa sia tawlngak hun pia ngawl het tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in a ciliap huai kamciamna khat pia zo a, Ama vaangletna taw tua kamciamna taangtungsak tu hi: “Na antangte sia na ngalte an hi nawn ngawl tu a, Ngamdangmite in na sapittui ne nawn ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang no an a ciingte le an a late in An ne in, Topa na pok tu uh hi. No, sapitkung ciingin sapitnga a lote in Ka Biakinnpi huang sungah sapittui na ne tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem mite awng, khuapi panin pusuak vun a Hong heak kik na mite atu in lam khat ziik vun! Lampi lian khat ziik vun; suangte heam vun! Mihingte heak thei tu in tepteena lim lakna khat khai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in leitung theampo ah thu a thansakna panin: “ Topa sia no hong ngum tu in hong pai a, Ama ii suatak sa mite hong tonpui hi, ci thu Jerusalem mite tungah son vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />No sia, “Pathian ii A thiangtho Mite” “ Topa Ngup sa Mite” hong kici tu hi. Jerusalem sia, “Pathian ii It Khuapi,” “Pathian ii Nusiat Ngawl Khuapi” kici tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Edom ngam Bozrah khuapi pan hong pai hisia pa akua ziam? Puansan silhin pha tak a kizeam, vaangletna le thahatna taw hong pai hisia pa akua ziam?” “A hun zo tu in vaangletna a nei, ama ngalzawna thu thangsak tu in hong pai, Topa ahi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Sapittui vawt tu in sapitnga a cilpa taw kibangin, banghang in a puan tuabang keakin san ziam?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in, “Keima in sapitngate ka totcil bangin minamte ka tuanhcil zo a, kei hong hu tu in kuama hong pai ngawl hi. Thin uukin amate ka tuanhcil a, amate ii chi sia ka puan tung theampo ah baang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mite ka ngup tu hun hong theng zo hi ci in ka khensat hi; a ngalte daan piak tu hun hi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka et ciang kei hong hu tu kuama a om ngawl hunlam mu in, lamdang ka sa hi. Ahihang ka thin uukna in keima hong thahatsak a, keima mama in ngal ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thin uukna taw in minam bup tuanhcil in ka sucip hi. Amate ii nuntakna chisan sia lei ah ka bua hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa ii a kip a kho hong itna thu ka son tu hi; Ei atu in ama hong sep sakte theampo hangin ama ka pok hi. Ama ii hesuakna le tawntung itna hangin Israel mite ama in thupha tam mama pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in, “Amate sia ka mite hi; kei hong theam ngawl tu uh hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom Topa in amate sia
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a thuakna theampo panin, ngum hi. Amate a ngum sia vantunglalang khat hi ngawl a, Topa ama mama ahi hi. A itna le a hesuakna taw amate suatak hi. Ama in a bosa hun sungah amate keamcing tawntung hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahihang amate in Topa langpanin a thaa thiangtho khuangaisak hi. Tua hu in Topa sia amate ngal suakin amate do hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahizong amate in Topa naseampa Moses ii hun lai in a bosa hunte phawk kik a, “A mite ii lampuite, tuipi panin a hunkhia Topa sia tu in koi sungah om ziam? Moses tungah a thaa a pia, Topa sia koi sungah om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama minthan tawntung natu in Moses tungtawnin a vaangletna taw na lian a seam pa, tuipi tuite khen a, tuithuk kaantan in a mite lam a pui pa Topa koi sungah om ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi. Topa in lampui a, amate sia ngam siphu bangin a peang sina kho mama a, lutu ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khuite leipha kuam sungah a kipaipui bangin Topa in a mite tawlngasak hi. Topa in a mihingte hi bangin lampui a, ama min thangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa awng, a thiangtho le a minthang na teenna vantung panin, ko hong ensuk ta'n. Ko nong thin nopmawk belna sia koi sungah om ziam? Na vaangletna koi sungah om ziam? Nong itna le nong hesuakna koi sungah om ziam? Ko hong ngaingon heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangma in kote pa na hi hi. Ka taanghpupi Abraham le Jacob te in ko hong thusim ngawl uh hi, ahihang Topa, kote hong suatak tawntung pa, nangma in kote pa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Banghangin na lampi panin kote lam hong pialsak ni ziam? Banghangin nang kung pan lampial tu in thinpui mama tu in hong vawt ni ziam? Na na a seam mihingte atu le nangma mihing ahi tawntungte atu in hong heak kik ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na mi thiangthote ahi, kote sia, ka ngalte in tawmvei sung teng hong notkeak hi: amate in na inn thiangtho sia tuanhcil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangma in kote hong ukpa ahi ngeingawl bangkeak, kote in nangma mi ahi ngeingawl bang keakin nong vawt hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Banghangin vantung hongkeak in hong tuaksuk ngawl ni ziam? Mualte sia nang hong mu a, hong kiita in liing tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meisa khat tungah a kisuang tuiso bangin amate liing tu uh hi. Hong pai ta'n a na vaangletna na ngalte tungah pualaak in, minamte na mai ah liingsak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nong pai lai in kote muanmawk khol ngawl, a lauhuai nate na vawt hun khat om hi; mualte in nang hong mu in, hong kiita in liing uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama sungah lametna a nei mihingte atu in tuabang na a seam, nangma bang Pathian khat sia kuama in mu ngeingawl a, za zongh za ngeingawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na deisak bangin nuntak tu a phawkte le a maan na seam in a lungdamte na phatvawt hi. Ko tungah na thin uuk hi, ahizong kote in mawna khialna ka vawt leleng uh hi; na thin uuk mama napi in taanghlai pan kipan kote in mawna khialna ka vawt tan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eite theampo ih maw siat zo hi. Ih ngamtatna a phabelte ngawngawn a nincip hi siat hi. Ih mawnate hangin vui ii letkeak thingteekote taw ih kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thungen in nang kung hong zuan kuama om ngawl a; huna ngen tu in nang kung hong pai kuama om ngawl hi. Ka mawnate uh hangin nangma in ko kung pan kisealin nong nusia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahizong Topa awng, nangma in kote Pa na hi hi. Kote in tungman bang hi a, nang in beal seakpa bang na hi hi. Nangma in kote nong bitphua a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua ahikom ko tungah hong thin uuk lei heak in a, ka mawnate uh taw ko hong len top heak in. Kote sia nangma mihingte ka hi uh hi; kote hong hesuak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na khuapi thiangthote sia sennealngam khat bang ahi hi; Jerusalem sia a kinusia a lalcip khat ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />thiangtho in a et hoi, ka taanghpupite ii nang hong pokna mun ahi ka Biakinnpi uh sia, mei in kaanghtum zo hi. Kote ii nop ka sakna mun theampo lal siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa awng, hi thute theampo phamaw sa tuan ngawl ni ziam? Nangma sia bangma lok ngawlin kote thuak laak tu za dongin ngim hong thuaksak tu ni ziam?
  </para>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Keima in ka mite ii thu ngetnate zo tu in a kinging sa in om zo napi, amate in thu ngen ngawl uh hi. Amate ii hong mu thei tu in om zo napi, amate in zon tu zongh hong sawm bua uh hi. ‘Hi lai ah om khi hi; hong hu tu khi hi!’ ci in a zo paih tu in om nginge zo napi, ka mite in ka tungah thu hong ngen bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thinpui in a maan ngawl ngamta a, amate uuk bang po a ngamta ka mite saang tu in a kinging sa in ka om tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate maizum maw in ka thin hong uuksak tan lai hi. Huan thiangthote sungah amate in doai biakpiakna te vawtin doai biaknataute tungah ngimnamtui hal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zanin mithite ii thaate tungah thu dongh tu in suanghawng sung le thaan ah amate pai uh hi. Amate in voksa ne in doai biakpiakna in a nei, sa huanna satuite hawp uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang amate in midangte tungah, ‘Ko kung hong neak heak vun; ko sia no ii thuthaak tu in thiangtho leih khu hi!’ ci uh hi. Tuabang mihingte ka thuak zo bua hi — amate tungah ka thin uukna sia a mit ngeingawl meikuang khat taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Amate daan piak tu in ka khensat zo a, amate ii thuak tute lai sungah kiciamtee zo hi. Amate ii sep sate ka en thong buatu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />amate ii mawnate le a taanghpupite ii mawnate hangin amate in ka thuaksak tu hi. Amate in doaibiakna mual tungah paaknamtui halin keima hong sonsia uh hi. Tua ahiciang amate ii ngamtatna sate taw kizui in a kilawm bangin daan ka pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in, “Sapit nga phate kuama in susia ngawl hi; amate in sapittui in vawt zaw uh hi. Tuabangin ka mite a vekpi in ka susia siat buatu a — ka na a seamte ka ngum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel te sung panin Judah minamte thupha ka pia tu a, amate ii suan le paalte in ka mualtung ngam lua tu uh hi. Ka na a seam, ka tealsa mihingte tua ngam ah teang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in kei hong bia tu uh a, a tuute le a khuite sia a tatna tu mun ahi, nitumna sangah a om Sharon Zaangtam le nisuana sangah a om Ngimna Kuam sungah paipui tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ahihang kei hong nusiate, ka mual thiangtho Zion a awlmawk ngawlte, kaam thu le kaam etna in a dok Gad le Meni pathiante a bia note atu in thutuam hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note kong sap ciang nong zo bua uh a, kong paupui ciang hong ngai ngawl na hi uh komin, thi ngamh in na thi tu uh hi. Ka thu nit ngawl tu le a sia vawt tu na teal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom keima hong bia in ka thu hong nite in neak tu dawn tu hau tu uh a, ahihang note in ngilkial dangtaak in na om tu uh hi, ci in kong son hi. Amate lungdam tu a, ahihang note na mai uh mawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate lungdamin lasa tu uh a, no na hi uh le thin tamhtham in na kap tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka tealsa mihingte in na min sia haamsiatna in zangh tu uh hi. Vaanglianpipa Topa keima in nang kong thisak tu hi. Ahitazong ka thu hong nite min thak khat ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ngam sungah a om thupha a ngen pawpo in Thumaan Pathian ii thupha a piak tu in ngen tu uh hi. Kiciamna a la pawpo in Thumaan Pathian min taw kiciam tu uh hi. A bosa hunsung a ngimnate bomang tu a kimangil tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in, “Keima in leithak le vantung thakte ka vawt hi. Nungsang hun a thupiangte kimangil siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka bitphua sa sungah lungdam thinnuamin om tawntung vun. Ka vawtsa Jerusalem khuathak sia thinnopna taw kidim tu a, a mite lungdam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem le a mite hu in keima mama thinnopna taw ka kidim tu hi. Tua munah kaana, hu kingetna om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nausente a sen in thi nawn ngawlin, mihing theampo in amate nuntak hun ciam vaal khanghaam in nungta tu uh hi. Kum zakhat bang a nungtate khangmoi in kingaisun tu hi. Tua maa in a thite sia keima in amate daan ka piak hunlam a kilakna lim khat hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihingte in inn sa tu uh a, tua ii sungah amate ma teang tu uh hi — tua innte sia kuama dang in zangh ngawl tu hi. Amate in sapithuan vawtin a sapittui ne tu uh hi — midang in neaksak ngawl tu hi. Thingkungte bangin, ka mihingte khansau in nungta tu uh hi. Amate ii sep sa nate taw in lungdamin nuamsa tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A nasepna maapai tu a, a tate in tuasiatna thuak ngawl tu uh hi. Keima in amate le a suan a paalte hong pai tu hun sung theampo thupha ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka tungah thu hong ngetna sia a thunget tawp ma ngawngawn in ka zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngiate le tuunote an nekhawm tu hi; tawpite in khui anneak bangin, taangphaw ne tu a, ngulte sia kiitakhuai nawn ngawl tu hi. Ka mual thiangtho, Zion tungah liamna baina le siatna bangma om ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Vantung sia ka tokhum hi a, leitung sia ka peang ngakna ahi hi. Tua ahiciang a koibang inn sa tu a, a koibang mun sia ka teen natu mun ahi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima mama in vaannuai buppi ka bitphua hi! Kiniamkhiakin a kisiik kikte, kei hong kiita in ka thu hong nite dik ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihingte sia a uuk bang po in ngamta uh hi. Amate in khuital khat ngo in, ahibuale mihing khat that in, biakpiakna in nei a; tuuno, ahibuale ui khat ii ngawng thiaktanin biakpiakna in nei a; antang, ahibuale vokte ii chi pia a; ngimnamtui pia, ahibuale milim khat tungah thu a nget uh sia amate atu in kibang siat hi. Amate in a kiihuai biaknate diksa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate tungah tuasiatna — amate ii kiitak tuasiatnate ma ka thengsak tu hi — banghang ziam cile ka sap ciangin kuama in hong zo ngawl a, ka pau ciangin kuama in hong ngai ngawl uh hi. Amate in ka thu nit ngawl tu le a sia vawt tu ma teal uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />No, ama kiita in a thu a nite in, Topa ci bang ngai vun: “Kei tungah nong thumaan hu in, na mite sung pan ma in pawlkhat sia note hong ensan in bangma hong heang ngawl tu hi. Amate in no hong nunau in, ‘Lungdam takin na nuntak uh kong mu thei natu uh in, Topa in a letna hong lak hen a, hong ngum tahen’ hong ci uh hi. Ahihang amate mama maimawl tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai vun! Khuapi sungah ngamlumna, Biakinnpi sungah aw nginna sia Topa ii a ngalte daan a piakna awnging ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka khuapi thiangtho sia nautun phot ngeingawlin thakhat thuin nau a suak paih nupi khat taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuabang te akua in mu ngei a za ngei ziam? Ni khat thu in ngam khat piang ngei ziam? A minam a pian ma in Zion in khuangei thuak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mite sia keima in nausua hun ciang a suak tu in vawt a, tuaciang, a suaksak ngawl tu in hong ngaisun heak vun,” ci in, Topa pau zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem taw lungdam khawm vun; ama atu in lungdam vun, hi khuapi a it note theampo awng! ama atu in a hee a kap note theampo awng, tu in ama taw lungdam khawm vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tano khat in a nu noai tawpin nop a sak bangin note in Jerusalem ii zawna haunate nuam na sa tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in, “Tawntung nopsakna kong pia tu hi; a kang ngeingawl nguntui bangin minamte ii haunate note kungah hong luang tu hi. Note sia a nu ii a op, a kaang tungah a toai, a itna taw a ou tano khat taw na kibang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nu in a tano a heenep bangin, keima in Jerusalem khua sungah note kong heeneam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi thu a pian na mu uh ciang, na lung uh dam tu hi; note hong thahatsakin hong ciidamsak tu hi. Tuasia ciang Topa keima in ka thu hong nite hu in, ka ngalte tungah ka thin uukna ka lakna thu na he tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa sia meikuang taw hong pai tu hi. Ama sia a thin a uuk sakte tungah daan pia tu in vuipi ii tha tungah to tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in mawna nei in a mu leitung mihingte theampo mei le namsau taw daan pia tu a — tam mama thisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in, “Huan thiangthote sungah a ngui ngitngutin a paite, voksa, zunam sa le a dang a kiihuai ante ne a, doai biakna vawt tu in amate le amate a kithiansua mite ii a bo tu hun nai zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate ii ngaisutna le a nasepnate ka he hi. Ngam theampo ii mite khawmtua tu in kong pai hi. Amate hong pai khop uh ciang, ka vaangletna in bang vawt thei cisia mu tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuaciang amate daan pia pa ka hi sia he tu uh hi. “Ahihang amate sung pan pawlkhat ka khe tu a, ka minthanna a za ngawl, ahibuale ka letna le ka vaangletna a mu ngawl lai minamte le ngam khualate ahi, Spain, Libya, Lydia le a thalkaap thiamte ii ngam, Tubal le Greece te ngam ah ka puak tu hi. Amate in hi ngamte sungah ka letna thangsak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate na Israel mipuite theampo sia hi ngamte pan keima kungah letsong in hong puak kik tu uh hi. Israel mite in biakpiakna antangte sia biakna taw kisai bung thiangthote taw Biakinnpi ah hong paipui bangma in, amate in na ngammipuite sia siphu, laa, kalaoh le siphu ngalleangte le khui leangte tungah pua in ka mual thiangtho Jerusalem ah hong paipui tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima in amate pawlkhat sia thiampite le Levi te ka suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Leitung thak le vantung thakte in keima ii vaangletna taw kho top tu ahi bangma in, na suan na paalte le na min kip in kho tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Thadet Poai vawt sim le Sabbath Ni simin in ngam sim pan mite sia kei hong bia tu in hi mun Jerusalem ah hong pai tu uh hi,” Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Amate a cia uh ciang kei hong langpan te ii luanghawmte mu tu uh hi. Amate a ne lungte thi ngeingawl tu a, amate kihalna meite kimit ngeingawl tu hi. Amate sia mihing nam theampo in a kiihuai in mu tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
</usx>
